hadiths[394]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1201","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Humayd al-Tawil ne hamein khabar di, Thabit se, Anas se, ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek shakhs ko dekha jo apne do beton ke darmiyan sahara diye hue tha. Aap ne farmaya: Ye kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Is ne Baitullah tak paidal chalne ki nazr mani hai. Aap ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala is shakhs ke apne aap ko azab dene se be-niyaz hai. Phir Aap ne use hukm diya, to wo sawar ho gaya."
"1202","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hamein khabar di, Thabit se, Anas se, ke Umm Sulaym ne Hunayn ke din ek khanjar le liya. Abu Talhah ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, ye Umm Sulaym khanjar liye hue hain. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, main ne ise is liye liya hai ke agar mushrikeen me se koi mere qareeb aaya to main is se us ka pet chaak kar dungi. Aazad karda qaidiyon ko qatl kar dijiye; un ki gardanein maar dijiye; wo aap ki wajah se shikast kha gaye hain. Unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) muskuraye aur farmaya: Allah Ta'ala kafi ho gaya aur Us ne achha kiya."
"1203","Uthman ibn Umar ne hamein riwayat kiya, Shu'bah ne hamein khabar di, Thabit se, Anas se, ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek aurat ko dekha jo apne ek bachche par ro rahi thi. Aap ne us se farmaya: Allah se daro aur sabr karo. Us ne kaha: Tumhein meri museebat se kya matlab? Jab Aap wahan se chale gaye, to us se kaha gaya: Wo Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hain. Use goya maut ne aa pakda. Wo Aap ke darwaze par aayi aur us par koi darban na paye. Us ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, main ne Aap ko pehchana nahi tha. Aap ne farmaya: Sabr to sirf pehli chot par hai - ya unhon ne farmaya: sadme ke aaghaz par hai."
"1204","Rawh ibn Ubadah ne hamein riwayat kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hamein riwayat kiya, Thabit se, Anas se, Allah ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se, ke Aap ne Uhud ke din apne chehre se khoon ponchhte hue farmaya: Wo qaum kaise falah payegi jis ne apne nabi ko zakhmi kiya, us ka saamne ka daant tod diya, aur us ke chehre ko khoon aalud kar diya? Phir Allah Ta'ala ne nazil farmaya: Is muamle me tumhara koi ikhtiyar nahi, chahe Wo un par tawajjuh farmaye ya unhein azab de, kyunki wo zalim hain."
"1205","Al-Hasan ibn Musa ne hamein riwayat kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hamein riwayat kiya, Sulayman al-Taymi aur Thabit se, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jis raat mujhe raat me sair karayi gayi, main Musa ke paas se guzra, surkh teele ke paas, jabke wo apni qabr me khade namaz padh rahe the."
"1206","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne hamein riwayat kiya, Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne hamein riwayat kiya, Thabit se, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Zaynab ki iddat khatm ho gayi, to Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Zayd se farmaya: Jao aur mera zikr us se karo. Unhon ne kaha: To Zayd us ke paas gaya, aur dekha ke wo apna aata goondh rahi thi. Unhon ne kaha: Jab main ne use dekha, to mere dil me us ki azmat ki wajah se main us ki taraf dekh na saka, jab mujhe malum hua ke Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use paigham diya hai. To main apni ediyon par peeche hata aur apni peeth us ki taraf kar li. Phir main ne kaha: Ay Zaynab, khushkhabri qubul karo; Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne tumhara zikr karte hue bheja hai. Us ne kaha: Main kuch nahi karungi hatta ke apne Rab se mashwara kar lun. To wo apni namaz ki jagah ki taraf khadi hui. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Quran nazil hua, aur Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aaye hatta ke baghair ijazat us ke paas dakhil hue. Anas ne kaha: Tum ne hamein dekha jab unhein Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas laya gaya: Aap ne un ke waleeme par hamein roti aur gosht khilaya hatta ke din phail gaya, aur log chale gaye jabke ek giroh khane ke baad baatein karta reh gaya. Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bahar nikle, aur main Aap ke peeche chala, aur Aap apni azwaj ke paas jane lage, unhein salam karte hue, aur unhon ne kaha: Aap ne apni ahliya ko kaisa paya, Ya Rasul Allah? Anas ne kaha: Mujhe malum nahi ke main ne unhein ittila di ke log chale gaye hain ya unhein ittila di gayi. Aap chalte rahe hatta ke ghar tak pahunche aur unhein gaya hua paya, to Aap dakhil hue, aur main Aap ke sath dakhil hone laga, magar Aap ne mere aur apne darmiyan parda kheench diya. Unhon ne kaha: Aur hijab nazil hua. Unhon ne kaha: Aur logon ko us se nasihat ki gayi jis se unhein nasihat ki gayi: Nabi ke gharon me dakhil na ho jab tak tumhein ijazat na di jaye, Us ke farman tak: Aur Allah haq se sharmata nahi."
"1207","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hamein riwayat kiya, Hammad ibn Zayd ne hamein riwayat kiya, Thabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Zaynab bint Jahsh ke bare me nazil hua: Aur tum apne dil me wo chhupate ho jise Allah zahir karne wala hai. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se nikah kiya, aur Aap ne apni kisi biwi par waisa waleema nahi kiya jaisa un par kiya; Aap ne ek bakri zibah ki."
"1208","Sulayman ibn Harb ne mujhe riwayat kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hamein khabar di, Thabit se, Anas se, ke assi aadmi Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Aap ke Sahaba par Jabal al-Tan'im se fajr ki namaz ke waqt utre, Aap ko qatl karne ka irada rakhte hue. Wo sab ek sath pakde gaye, aur Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhein aazad kar diya. Phir Allah ne nazil farmaya: Aur Wahi hai Jis ne un ke hathon ko tum se aur tumhare hathon ko un se Makkah ki wadi me rok diya, is ke baad ke Us ne tumhein un par fatah di."
"1209","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne mujhe riwayat kiya, Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne hamein riwayat kiya, Thabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Jab ye ayat nazil hui: Ay iman walo, apni awazein Nabi ki awaz se unchi na karo, Us ke farman tak: jabke tumhein shu'ur na ho - aur Thabit ibn Qays ibn al-Shammas ki awaz buland thi - to unhon ne kaha: Main hi wo hun jo Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par apni awaz buland kiya karta tha; mere a'mal zaya ho gaye; main Jahannamiyon me se hun. To wo ghamzada apne ghar walon me baith gaya. Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use gum paya, to kuch log us ke paas gaye aur kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne tumhein gum paya hai; tumhein kya hua hai? Us ne kaha: Main hi wo hun jo Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki awaz par apni awaz buland karta tha aur un se unchi awaz me baat karta tha; mere a'mal zaya ho gaye; main Jahannamiyon me se hun. Wo Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye aur Aap ko us ke kehne ki khabar di. Aap ne farmaya: Nahi; balke wo Jannatiyon me se hai. Anas ne kaha: Hum use apne darmiyan chalta dekhte the jabke hum jante the ke wo Jannatiyon me se hai. Jab al-Yamamah ka din aaya - Anas ne kaha: aur main un me shamil tha - unhon ne kaha: Hum me kuch paspai hui, to Thabit ibn Qays aaya, khushbu lagaye hue aur apna kafan pehne hue, aur kaha: Bura hai jo tum apne sathiyon ko sikhate ho. Phir unhon ne un se jung ki hatta ke wo shaheed ho gaya, Allah un par rahm farmaye."
"1210","Sulayman ibn Harb ne mujhe riwayat kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hamein khabar di, Thabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Bait al-Ma'mur chauthe aasman me hai; har din sattar hazar farishte us me dakhil hote hain, phir Qayamat qayam hone tak us me wapas nahi aate."
"1211","Ali ibn Asim ne mujhe riwayat kiya, Humayd se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Jab mushrikeen ko shikast hui, to Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aaye aur khade hue. Phir Aap ne Abu Jahl ibn Hisham ke bare me hukm diya, to use ghaseeta gaya aur garhe me daal diya gaya. Phir Aap ne Utbah ibn Rabi'ah ke bare me hukm diya, to use ghaseeta gaya aur garhe me daal diya gaya. Phir Aap ne Shaybah ibn Rabi'ah ke bare me hukm diya, to use ghaseeta gaya aur garhe me daal diya gaya. Phir Aap ne Umayyah ibn Khalaf ke bare me hukm diya, to use ghaseeta gaya aur garhe me daal diya gaya, jabke Abu Hudhayfah ibn Utbah Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke pehlu me khade the, aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhein mehsoos na kiya. Jab unhon ne apne walid ko ghaseete jate dekha hatta ke garhe me daal diya gaya, to un ka chehra mutaghayyir ho gaya. Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ki taraf mutawajjuh hue, aur jab Aap ne un ka chehra mutaghayyir dekha, to farmaya: Ay Abu Hudhayfah, goya Utbah ke sath hamare kiye ne tumhein ranjida kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, main Allah aur Us ke Rasul par iman rakhne wala kyun na hun? Magar logon me koi aisa na tha jo aql me aur sharafat me Utbah se mushabeh ho, to main ummeed rakhta tha ke Allah Ta'ala use Islam ki hidayat dega. Jab main ne us ka maqtul hona dekha, to is ne mujhe ghamgin kiya. Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se khair ki baat farmayi. Raat ki tareeki me Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bahar nikle, aur logon ne Aap ko raat ki tareeki me pukarte suna: Ay Abu Jahl ibn Hisham, aur ay Utbah ibn Rabi'ah, aur ay Shaybah ibn Rabi'ah, aur ay Umayyah ibn Khalaf, kya tum ne apne Rab ke wade ko sachcha paya? Kyunki main ne apne Rab ke wade ko sachcha paya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Logon ne Aap ko pukara: Ya Rasul Allah, kya Aap aise logon ko pukarte hain jo gal sar gaye hain? Aap ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam, tum meri baat ko un se zyada sunne wale nahi ho, lekin wo jawab dene ki taqat nahi rakhte."
"1212","Ubayd al-Attar ne mujhe riwayat kiya, Sinan ibn Harun al-Burjumi ne hamein riwayat kiya, Humayd al-Tawil se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Umm Habibah ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, hum me se ek aurat ke is duniya me do shauhar hote hain, phir wo faut hoti hai aur Jannat me dakhil hoti hai, wo aur us ke dono shauhar; wo un me se kis ki hogi, pehle ki ya aakhri ki? Aap ne farmaya: Wo dono me se behtar akhlaq wale ko chunegi, jaisa ke wo is duniya me us ke sath tha, aur wahi Jannat me us ka shauhar hoga. Ay Umm Habibah, husn-e-akhlaq duniya ki bhalayi aur aakhirat ki bhalayi le gaya."
"1213","Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne hamein riwayat kiya, Wuhayb ibn Khalid ne hamein riwayat kiya, Abd al-Aziz ibn Suhayb ne hamein riwayat kiya, Anas ibn Malik se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se: Mere Sahaba me se kuch log Hawz par mere paas aayenge, hatta ke jab main unhein dekhunga aur pehchan lunga, to unhein mujh tak pahunchne se pehle uchak liya jayega. To main kahunga: Ay mere Rab, mere sathi, mere sathi. Phir kaha jayega: Tum nahi jante unhon ne tumhare baad kya naya nikala."
"1214","Qabisah ibn Uqbah ne hamein riwayat kiya, Sufyan ne hamein riwayat kiya, Sulayman al-Taymi se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne wasiyyat farmayi, jabke Aap ki zaban mushkil se harkat kar sakti thi, farmate hue: Namaz, aur jin ke tumhare daayein haath malik hain."
"1215","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, al-Awwam ibn Hawshab ne hamein khabar di, kehte hue: Sulayman ibn Abi Sulayman, Ibn Abbas ke aazad karda ghulam, ne mujhe riwayat kiya, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah Ta'ala ne zameen ko paida kiya, to wo jhukne lagi, to Us ne pahadon ko paida kiya aur unhein us par daal diya, to wo qarar pakad gayi. Farishte pahadon ki quwwat par hairaan hue aur kaha: Ay Rab, kya Teri makhluq me se pahadon se zyada taqatwar koi cheez hai? Us ne farmaya: Haan, loha. Unhon ne kaha: Ay Rab, kya Teri makhluq me se lohe se zyada taqatwar koi cheez hai? Us ne farmaya: Haan, aag. Unhon ne kaha: Ay Rab, kya Teri makhluq me se aag se zyada taqatwar koi cheez hai? Us ne farmaya: Haan, pani. Unhon ne kaha: Ay Rab, kya Teri makhluq me se pani se zyada taqatwar koi cheez hai? Us ne farmaya: Haan, hawa. Unhon ne kaha: Ay Rab, kya Teri makhluq me se hawa se zyada taqatwar koi cheez hai? Us ne farmaya: Haan, wo shakhs jo apne daayein haath se sadqa deta hai, use apne baayein haath se chhupate hue."
"1216","Abu al-Walid aur Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne mujhe riwayat kiya, dono kehte hue: Hammad ibn Salamah ne hamein riwayat kiya, Hisham ibn Zayd ne hamein riwayat kiya, Anas ibn Malik se, ke Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar Qayamat qayam ho jaye jabke tum me se kisi ke haath me ek paudha ho, to agar wo khade hone se pehle use lagane ki taqat rakhta ho to use lagaye."
"1217","Husayn ibn Ali al-Ju'fi ne mujhe riwayat kiya, Fudayl ibn Iyad se, Hisham se, Hanzalah al-Sadusi se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, kya hum me se koi mulaqat ke waqt dusre ke liye jhuke? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. Hum ne kaha: Kya hum me se koi dusre se mu'anaqa kare? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. Hum ne kaha: Kya hum me se koi dusre se musafaha kare? Aap ne farmaya: Haan."
"1218","Wahb ibn Jarir ne hamein riwayat kiya, Hisham ibn Hassan ne hamein riwayat kiya, Muhammad se, Anas ibn Malik se, ke Hilal ibn Umayyah ne apni biwi par Sharik ibn Sahma' ke sath tuhmat lagayi. Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Us ka intezar karo; agar wo use gora aur seedhe balon wala laye, to wo Hilal ibn Umayyah ka hai, aur agar wo use surmedar aankhon wala, ghungharale balon wala, pindliyon se dubla laye, to wo Sharik ibn Sahma' ka hai. Wo use surmedar aankhon wala, ghungharale balon wala, pindliyon se dubla layi."
"1219","Wahb ibn Jarir ne hamein riwayat kiya, Hisham ne hamein riwayat kiya, Muhammad se, Anas se, ke jab Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne halq karaya, to Aap ne apne sar ke daayein hisse se ibtida ki, phir use Abu Talhah ko diya, phir baayein hisse ka halq karaya, aur use logon me taqseem kar diya."
"1220","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Baqiyyah ibn al-Walid ne hamein khabar di, Mu'an ibn Rifa'ah al-Salami ne hamein khabar di, Abu Khalaf al-A'ma se, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat kabhi gumrahi par jama nahi hogi; jab tum ikhtilaf dekho, to bade giroh ko lazmi pakdo."
"1221","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Shu'bah ne hamein Anas ibn Sirin se bayan kiya, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Ansar ka ek bhari jism wala aadmi Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath namaz ada karne se qasir tha, us ne kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasool sallallahu alaihi wa sallam, main aap ke saath namaz ada karne se aajiz hun, pas mujhe dikhaiye ke aap kaise namaz padhte hain taake main bhi usi tarah namaz padhun jaise aap padhte hain, unhon ne kaha: Pas us ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke liye khana tayyar kiya phir unhein apne ghar dawat di, unhon ne kaha: Pas us ne Rasool Allah ke liye chatai ke kinare par pani chhidka phir aap ne do rak'atein padhein, Basrah walon mein se Banu al-Jarud ke ek aadmi ne Anas ibn Malik se kaha: Kya Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Duha ki namaz padhte the? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne unhein is din se pehle kabhi ise padhte nahi dekha."
"1222","al-Hasan ibn Musa ne hamein bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hamein Ali ibn Zayd se bayan kiya, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main ne us raat jab mujhe raat mein sair karayi gayi aise mardon ko dekha jin ke honth aag ki qainchiyon se kaate ja rahe the, main ne Jibril se kaha: Ye kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: Ye aap ki ummat ke khatib hain jo logon ko neki ka hukm dete hain aur apne aap ko bhool jate hain, halanke woh Kitab ki tilawat karte hain, kya woh aqal se kaam nahi lete?"
"1223","Affan ibn Muslim ne hamein bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hamein Ali ibn Zayd se bayan kiya, Anas ibn Malik se, ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam chhah maah tak jab fajr ki namaz ke liye nikalte to Fatimah ke darwaze ke paas se guzarte, farmate hue: Ai ahl-e-bait, namaz! Allah to sirf ye chahta hai ke tum se napaki ko door kar de, ai ahl-e-bait, aur tumhein khoob paak saaf kar de."
"1224","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hamein bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Zayd ne hamein Ali ibn Zayd se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Aaj main aise gunah dekhta hun jo tumhari nazar mein baal se bhi zyada bareek hain, hum Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke zamane mein unhein kabira gunahon mein shumar karte the."
"1225","Affan ibn Muslim ne hamein bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hamein Ali ibn Zayd se bayan kiya, Anas ibn Malik se, ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag ka libas pehnaya jane wala pehla shakhs Iblis hoga, woh usay apni bhaun par rakhega aur apne peeche ghasitega, kehte hue: Hai meri halakat! Aur us ki aulad us ke peeche kehti hogi: Hai hamari halakat! Phir kaha jayega: Aaj ek halakat ko mat pukaro, balke bahut si halakaton ko pukaro."
"1226","Yazid ibn Abi Hakim ne hamein bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hamein Asim al-Ahwal se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas se al-Safa aur al-Marwah ke bare mein pucha, unhon ne kaha: Ye zamana-e-jahiliyyat ke sha'air mein se the, pas jab Islam aaya to hum in se ruk gaye, phir Allah Ta'ala ne ye ayat nazil farmayi: Beshak al-Safa aur al-Marwah Allah ki nishaniyon mein se hain, jo koi Baitullah ka Hajj ya Umrah kare to us par in ka tawaf karne mein koi harj nahi, unhon ne kaha: Ye nafl hain, aur jo koi khushi se neki kare to beshak Allah Qadr-daan, Khoob Janne wala hai."
"1227","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein bayan kiya, Abu Zilal ne hamein khabar di, kehte hue: Main Anas ibn Malik ke paas aaya to unhon ne mujh se kaha: Qareeb aao, tumhari binayi kab gayi? Main ne kaha: Jab main do saal ka tha, jaise mere ghar wale kehte hain, unhon ne kaha: Kya main tumhein aisi basharat na dun jis se tumhari aankh thandi ho jaye? Main ne kaha: Kyun nahi, zaroor, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umm Maktum Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas se guzre aur unhein salam kiya phir aage chale gaye, Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Jis shakhs ki do pyari cheezein main le lun us ke liye mere paas Jannat ke siwa koi badla nahi."
"1228","Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hamein Musa ibn Ubaydah se bayan kiya, Abu Bakr ibn Ubaydullah ibn Anas se, un ke dada Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya: Mujhe meri izzat ki qasam, main kisi bande ki do pyari cheezein - ya farmaya do mehboob cheezein - le lun aur woh sabr kare aur mere faisle par razi rahe to main us ke liye Jannat se kam kisi badle par razi nahi hota."
"1229","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Shu'bah ne hamein Muslim al-A'war se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam mareez ki iyadat karte, janaze mein shareek hote, ghulam ki dawat qabool farmate aur gadhe par sawari karte the, aur main ne unhein Khaybar ke din ek gadhe par dekha jis ki lagam khajoor ki chhaal ki thi."
"1230","Ja'far ibn Awn ne hamein khabar di, Muslim al-A'war ne hamein Anas se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Khaybar ke din aur al-Nadir ke din ek gadhe par the jis par palan bandha hua tha aur jis ki lagam khajoor ki chhaal ki rassi se bani hui thi."
"1231","Ja'far ibn Awn ne hamein khabar di, Muslim al-Mulai ne hamein Anas se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Zuhr ki namaz tab padhte jab suraj dhal jata, aur Asr ki namaz tab padhte jab suraj safed aur raushan hota, aur Maghrib ki namaz tab padhte jab suraj ghuroob ho jata, aur Isha mein takheer farmate, farmate hue: Hoshiyar raho, aur so na jao, aur Fajr ki namaz tab padhte jab roshni aasman par chha jati."
"1232","Habban ibn Hilal ne mujh se bayan kiya, Khalid al-Wasiti ne hamein bayan kiya, Muslim al-A'war ne hamein Anas ibn Malik se bayan kiya, ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas ek Qibti qameez thi jo lambai mein chhoti aur aasteenon mein chhoti thi."
"1233","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Rib'i ibn Abdullah ibn al-Jarud ne hamein khabar di, kehte hue: Amr ibn Abi al-Hajjaj ne mujh se bayan kiya, al-Jarud ibn Abi Sabrah se, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apni sawari par nafl namaz padhne ka irada farmate to qiblah rukh ho kar takbir kehte phir use us ke raste par chhod dete, phir apni sawari par namaz padhte chahe woh unhein le kar jis rukh phir jaye."
"1234","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Hisham al-Dastuwai ne hamein Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se khabar di, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kisi qaum ke paas roza iftar farmate to ye farmate: Rozahdaron ne tumhare han iftar kiya, nek logon ne tumhara khana khaya aur farishte tum par nazil hue."
"1235","Ibn Ubayd ne hamein bayan kiya, Isma'il ibn Abi Khalid ne hamein Nufay' se bayan kiya, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi, chahe ghani ho ya faqir, magar Qiyamat ke din ye tamanna karega ke kaash use duniya mein sirf guzare laiq rizq hi diya gaya hota."
"1236","Ja'far ibn Awn ne hamein khabar di, Usamah ibn Zayd ne hamein Hafs ibn Ubaydullah se khabar di, Anas ibn Malik se, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bahut se paragan-da baal, ghubar-aluda aadmi jo do purane kapdon mein hote hain, agar Allah par qasam kha lein to Allah usay poora farma de."
"1237","Zakariyya ibn Adi ne hamein khabar di, Hushaym ne hamein Muhammad ibn Ishaq se bayan kiya, Hafs ibn Ubaydullah ibn Anas se, Anas se, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Eid ke din nikalne se pehle taza khajooron se iftar farmate the."
"1238","Rawh ibn Ubadah ne hamein bayan kiya, Malik ibn Anas ne hamein Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talhah se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Anas ibn Malik ko kehte hue suna: Abu Talhah ne Umm Sulaym se kaha: Main ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki awaz kamzor suni jis se main bhook mehsoos karta hun, kya tumhare paas kuch hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, pas woh jau ki rotiyan le aayin phir apni ek odhni layin, roti ko us ke ek hisse mein lapeta, mere bazu ke neeche diya aur mujhe us ke ek hisse se dhak diya, phir unhon ne mujhe Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas bheja, main use le kar gaya aur Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko masjid mein logon ke saath paya, main un ke upar khada hua to Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujh se farmaya: Kya Abu Talhah ne tumhein bheja hai? Main ne kaha: Ji haan, unhon ne farmaya: Khane ke liye? Main ne kaha: Ji haan, unhon ne apne saath walon se farmaya: Utho, chalo, main un se aage chala yahan tak ke Abu Talhah ke paas aaya aur unhein ittila di, Abu Talhah ne kaha: Ai Umm Sulaym, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tashreef le aaye hain aur hamare paas itna khana nahi jo un sab ko kafi ho, unhon ne kaha: Allah aur us ke Rasool behtar jante hain, unhon ne kaha: Abu Talhah nikle yahan tak ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se mile, Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Abu Talhah ke hamrah aaye yahan tak ke andar dakhil hue, Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ai Umm Sulaym, jo kuch tumhare paas hai le aao, woh woh roti le aayin aur Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us ke bare mein hukm diya to use chura kiya gaya aur Umm Sulaym ne apni ghee ki mashk se us par salan ke taur par ghee nichoda, phir Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us par jo Allah ne chaha kaha, phir farmaya: Das ko andar aane do, woh andar aaye, pet bhar khaya phir nikal gaye, phir farmaya: Das ko andar aane do, woh andar aaye, pet bhar khaya phir nikal gaye, phir farmaya: Das ko andar aane do, aur tamam logon ne khaya aur sair hue, aur log sattar ya assi mard the."
"1239","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Ma'mar ne hamein Thabit al-Bunani se khabar di, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Madinah tashreef laye to Habshiyon ne aap ki aamad ki khushi mein khel pesh kiya, woh apne nezon se khel rahe the."
"1240","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Ma'mar ne hamein Thabit al-Bunani se khabar di, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Umm Sulaym ka Abu Talhah se ek beta tha, woh bimar hua phir faut ho gaya to unhon ne use kapde se dhak diya, Abu Talhah andar aaye aur kaha: Aaj shaam mera beta kaisa hai? Unhon ne kaha: Aaj shaam woh pur-sukoon hai, unhon ne raat ka khana khaya, phir raat ke ek hisse mein unhon ne kaha: Aap ka kya khayal hai, agar koi shakhs aap ko kuch aariyat de phir aap se wapas le le to kya aap ghamgeen honge? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi, unhon ne kaha: Allah Tabarak wa Ta'ala ne aap ko aap ka beta aariyat diya tha aur us ne use wapas le liya hai, unhon ne kaha: Subah woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas gaye aur unhein un ki baat ki khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Aur woh us raat un ke saath rahe the, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah tum dono ko tumhari raat mein barkat de, pas un ke haan Abdullah naam ka ek ladka paida hua aur zikr kiya gaya ke woh apne zamane ke behtareen logon mein se tha."
"1241","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Fahash goi jis cheez mein bhi hoti hai use ruswa kar deti hai, aur haya jis cheez mein bhi hoti hai use zeenat bakhshti hai."
"1242","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Sabit se, Anas se, ke Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke baal aap ke dono kanon ke darmiyan tak pahunchte the."
"1243","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Sabit al-Bunani se, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sar aur dadhi par sirf chaudah safed baal shumar kiye."
"1244","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Sabit al-Bunani se, Anas ibn Malik se, ke Usaid ibn Hudair aur Ansar mein se ek aur shakhs ek raat Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se apni ek hajat ke bare mein guftagu kar rahe the, yahan tak ke raat ka ek hissa guzar gaya, sakht tareek raat mein. Phir ve Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke pas se nikle, wapas jane ke liye palat-te hue, har ek ke hath mein chhoti lathi thi. Un dono mein se ek ki lathi ne un dono ke liye roshni ki, aur ve us ki roshni mein chale yahan tak ke jab raste ne unhen juda kar diya to dusre ki lathi ne us ke liye roshni ki. Un mein se har ek apni lathi ki roshni mein chala yahan tak ke apne ghar pahunch gaya."
"1245","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Sabit se, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Julaybib ke liye Ansar ki ek aurat ka rishta us ke walid se manga. Us ne kaha: Yahan tak ke main us ki walida se mashwara kar lun. Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Phir han, is surat mein. Vo shakhs apni biwi ke pas gaya aur us se is ka zikr kiya. Us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, to kya Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Julaybib ke siwa koi na mila. Hum ne use fulan aur fulan se rok diya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Aur ladki parde ke pichhe sun rahi thi. Vo shakhs Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko is ki khabar dene ke liye rawana hua. Ladki ne kaha: Kya tum Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hukm ko wapas karna chahte ho. Agar unhon ne use tumhare liye pasand kiya hai to us ka nikah us se kar do. Goya us ne apne waldain se shak door kar diya, aur unhon ne kaha: Us ne sach kaha. Us ka walid Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke pas gaya aur kaha: Agar aap ne use pasand kiya hai to hum ne use pasand kar liya. Unhon ne farmaya: Maine use pasand kiya hai. Unhon ne kaha: To us ne us ka nikah us se kar diya. Phir Madinah wale jang ke liye ghabra kar uthe, aur Julaybib nikla. Unhon ne use shaheed paya, aur us ke ird gird mushrikon mein se log the jinhen us ne qatl kiya tha. Anas ne kaha: Maine use dekha, aur vo Madinah mein sab se zyada kharch karne wale gharanon mein se thi."
"1246","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Sabit al-Bunani se, Anas ibn Malik se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se, unhon ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi kisi taklif ke sabab jo use pahunchi ho maut ki tamanna na kare."
"1247","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Sabit al-Bunani se, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Qayamat us shakhs par qaim na hogi jo kehta ho: Allah, Allah."
"1248","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Sabit al-Bunani se, Anas ibn Malik se, ke Safiyyah ko ye baat pahunchi ke Hafsah ne kaha: Ae Yahudi ki beti. Ve roin, aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ke pas tashrif laye jabke ve ro rahi thin. Unhon ne farmaya: Tumhen kis cheez ne rulaya. Unhon ne kaha: Hafsah ne kaha hai: Main Yahudi ki beti hun. Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum nabi ki beti ho, aur tumhare chacha nabi hain, aur tum nabi ke nikah mein ho, to vo tum par kis cheez se fakhr karti hai. Phir unhon ne farmaya: Ae Hafsah, Allah se daro."
"1249","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Sabit al-Bunani se, Anas ibn Malik se, ke: Maine Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha, namaz khadi ho chuki thi, ek shakhs apni hajat ke bare mein un se baat kar raha tha, un ke aur qible ke darmiyan khada hua. Ve khade us se baat karte rahe, yahan tak ke Maine kuch logon ko dekha ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke us ke sath khade rehne ki tawalat se unhen oongh aa rahi thi."
"1250","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Sabit aur Aban se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke bad kabhi aisi namaz na padhi jo Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki namaz se halki ho, ruku aur sajde ko mukammal karne mein."
"1251","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Sabit al-Bunani se, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: In safon ko durust karo, kyunke main tumhen apne pichhe se dekhta hun."
"1252","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) kabhi sajde ya ruku se apna sar uthate aur un dono ke darmiyan thehre rehte, yahan tak ke hum kehte: Kya ve bhool gaye hain."
"1253","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Sabit al-Bunani se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne auraton se jab un se baiat li to ye liya ke ve noha na karen. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, jahiliyat mein auraton ne noha karne mein hamari madad ki, to kya hum Islam mein un ki madad karen. Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Islam mein nohe mein koi madad nahi, aur na Islam mein shighar hai, aur na qabron par zabah karna hai, aur na jallab aur na janab hai, aur jo loot mare vo hum mein se nahi."
"1254","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Sabit se, Anas se, ke Mughirah ibn Shubah ne ek aurat se nikah ka irada kiya. Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Jao aur use dekh lo, kyunke ye tum dono ke darmiyan ulfat paida karne ke liye zyada munasib hai. Unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne aisa hi kiya, us se nikah kiya, aur us ki muwafiqat ka zikr kiya."
"1255","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Jafar ibn Sulaiman al-Dubai ne hamein khabar di, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Umm Sulaim mujhe Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke pas layin jab main ladka tha, aur unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, ye Unais hai, is ke liye dua kijiye. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah, is ke mal aur is ki aulad mein izafa farma, aur use Jannat mein dakhil farma. Unhon ne kaha: Maine un mein se do ko dekh liya hai, aur teesri ki ummid rakhta hun."
"1256","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Sabit se, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne shighar se mana farmaya."
"1257","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Jafar ibn Sulaiman al-Dubai ne hamein khabar di, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) umrah al-qada ke liye Makkah mein dakhil hue jabke Ibn Rawahah aap ke aage ashaar kehte hue chal rahe the, aur Umar ne kaha: Ae Ibn Rawahah, kya tum Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke samne aur Allah ke haram mein sher padhte ho. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Use chhod do, kyunke ye un par teeron ke barsne se zyada tez hai."
"1258","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hamein bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hamein bayan kiya, Sabit ne hamein bayan kiya, Anas ibn Malik se: ke Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke baal aap ke kanon se aage na badhte the."
"1259","Wahb ibn Jarir ne mujhe bayan kiya, mere walid ne hamein bayan kiya, kehte hue: Maine Sabit al-Bunani ko Anas se riwayat karte hue suna: ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab namaz khadi ki jaye to khade na ho yahan tak ke mujhe dekh lo."
"1260","Wahb ibn Jarir ne mujhe bayan kiya, mere walid ne hamein bayan kiya, kehte hue: Maine Sabit al-Bunani ko Anas se riwayat karte hue suna: ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) kabhi Jume ke din mimbar se utarte to ek shakhs aap se milta aur apni hajat ke bare mein aap se baat karta, to aap us ke sath khade rehte, phir namaz mein dakhil hote."
"1261","Wahb ibn Jarir ne mujhe bayan kiya, Shubah ne hamein Thabit al-Bunani se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Anas ibn Malik hamein Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ki namaz ka tariqa is tarah bataya karte the: Aap khade hokar namaz padhte, phir jab ruku' se sar mubarak uthate to itni der qiyam farmate ki hum kehte: Aap bhool gaye hain; aur jab pehle sajde se sar uthate to itni der baithe rehte ki hum kehte: Aap bhool gaye hain."
"1262","Sulayman ibn Dawud ne hamein bayan kiya, Shubah se, Thabit al-Bunani se, Anas ibn Malik se: ke Nabi Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam aksar ye dua farmaya karte the: Ai Allah, hamein duniya mein bhalai ata farma aur aakhirat mein bhi bhalai ata farma, aur hamein aag ke azab se bacha le. Shubah ne kaha: Maine is ka zikr Qatadah se kiya to unhon ne kaha: Anas isi dua ke sath dua kiya karte the."
"1263","Sulayman ibn Dawud ne hamein bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah se, Thabit al-Bunani se, Anas ibn Malik se: ke Nabi Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam apni tamam azwaj ke paas ek sath tashrif le gaye. Sulayman ne kaha: yani ek hi raat mein sab ke paas."
"1264","Abu al-Walid ne mujhe bayan kiya, al-Hakam ibn Atiyyah ne hamein Thabit se bayan kiya, Anas se: ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Wo us ka naam Muhammad rakhte hain, phir use bura bhala kehte hain."
"1265","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne hamein bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne hamein Thabit al-Bunani se bayan kiya, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah, ek aadmi dusre aadmi se muhabbat karta hai lekin us jaise a'mal nahi kar sakta. To Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi usi ke sath hai jis se wo muhabbat karta hai."
"1266","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne hamein bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne hamein Thabit se bayan kiya, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam Ramadan mein raat ko namaz padhte the, to main aaya aur Aap ke pehlu mein khada ho gaya, aur ek aur aadmi aaya aur wo bhi khada ho gaya, yahan tak ke hum ek jama'at ban gaye. Jab Nabi Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne mehsoos kiya ke hum Aap ke peeche hain to Aap ne apni namaz mukhtasar kar di, phir apne hujre mein dakhil hue aur ek namaz padhi jo hamare sath nahi padhi. Hum ne subah Aap se arz kiya: Kya Aap ne guzishta raat hamein mehsoos kiya tha? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, isi ne mujhe ye karne par aamada kiya. Phir Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne maheene ke aakhir mein wisal ke roze rakhne shuru kiye, aur Aap ke ba'z sahaba ne bhi aisa hi karna shuru kar diya, to Aap ne farmaya: Tum meri tarah nahi ho. Allah ki qasam, agar maheena mere liye lamba kar diya jata to main is tarah musalsal roza rakhta ke hadd se badhne wale apni hadd se tajawuz ko tark kar dete."
"1267","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne hamein bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne hamein Thabit al-Bunani se bayan kiya, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam hamare haan tashrif laye jab wahan mere, meri walida aur meri khala Umm Haram ke siwa koi na tha. Aap ne farmaya: Khade ho jao taake main farz namaz ke ilawa tumhare sath namaz padhun, phir Aap ne hamare sath namaz padhi. Ek aadmi ne Thabit se kaha: Aap ne Anas ko apni nisbat kahan khada kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Aap ne unhein apne dayen janib khada kiya. Phir Aap ne hamare liye, hum ahl-e-khana ke liye, duniya aur aakhirat ki har bhalai ki dua farmai. Meri walida ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah, ye Aap ka chhota khadim hai, is ke liye Allah se dua farmaiye. To Aap ne mere liye har bhalai ki dua farmai, aur Aap ki aakhiri duaon mein se ye thi: Ai Allah, is ke maal aur aulad mein izafa farma aur is mein barkat ata farma."
"1268","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne mujhe bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne hamein Thabit se bayan kiya, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam hamare haan tashrif laye aur hamare ghar mein qailulah farmaya, aur Aap ko paseena aaya. Meri walida ek shishi layin aur us mein Aap ka paseena jama karne lagin. Nabi Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam bedar hue aur farmaya: Ai Umm Sulaym, ye kya kar rahi ho? Unhon ne arz kiya: Ye Aap ka paseena hai; hum ise apne itr mein shamil kar lete hain, aur ye Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ki khushbu se behtareen khushbuon mein se hai. Thabit ne kaha: Anas ibn Malik ne kaha: Maine kisi ambar ya mushk ko Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam se zyada mu'attar nahi sungha, aur na hi kisi cheez, dibaj, khazz ya resham ko chhua jo chhune mein Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam se zyada narm ho. Thabit ne kaha: Maine kaha, Ai Abu Hamzah: Kya goya aap ab bhi Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ko dekh rahe hain aur Aap ki awaz sun rahe hain? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, Allah ki qasam, main ummeed rakhta hun ke Qiyamat ke din Aap se milunga aur arz karunga: Ya Rasulullah, Aap ka chhota khadim. Unhon ne kaha: Maine das saal tak Madinah mein Aap ki khidmat ki jab main ladka tha; har aadmi waisa nahi hota jaisa us ka sathi use chahta hai; Aap ne mujhe kabhi uff tak nahi kaha, aur na mujh se kaha: Tum ne ye kyun kiya, ya: Tum ne ye kyun nahi kiya."
"1269","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne mujhe bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne hamein Thabit se bayan kiya, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Main ladkon ke sath daud raha tha jab wo keh rahe the: Muhammad aa gaye hain, to main daudta aur kuch na dekhta, phir wo kehte: Muhammad aa gaye hain, aur main daudta aur kuch na dekhta, yahan tak ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam apne rafiq Abu Bakr al-Siddiq ke sath tashrif laye. Hum Madinah ke ek ujade hue hisse mein the, phir unhon ne Ansar ko un ki aamad ki khabar dene ke liye ek dehati aadmi ko bheja. Taqreeban paanch sau Ansar un se milne aaye yahan tak ke un tak pahunch gaye, aur Ansar ne kaha: Tashrif le chaliye, aap mamoon aur muta' hain. To Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam aur Aap ke rafiq un ke darmiyan aage badhe, aur ahl-e-Madinah nikal aaye, yahan tak ke kunwari ladkiyan gharon ki chhaton par se unhein dekh rahi thin, kehti hui: Un mein se wo kaun se hain, wo kaun se hain? Unhon ne kaha: Hum ne us din jaisa manzar kabhi nahi dekha. Anas ne kaha: Maine Aap ko us din dekha jis din Aap hamare darmiyan tashrif laye aur us din bhi jis din Aap ne wafat pai, aur maine un jaisa do din kabhi nahi dekhe."
"1270","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne hamein bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne hamein Thabit se bayan kiya, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Ek din maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ki khidmat ki yahan tak ke jab maine dekha ke main Aap ki khidmat se farigh ho chuka hun to maine kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam qailulah farmayenge. To main bahar nikla aur kuch ladkon ko khelte hue paya, aur main un ke khel ko dekhte hue khada ho gaya. Phir Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam tashrif laye, unhein salam kiya, phir mujhe bulaya aur mujhe apne ek kaam par bheja, aur Aap saaye mein rahe yahan tak ke main Aap ke paas wapas aaya. Main apni walida ke paas apne aane ke muqarrar waqt se der se pahuncha to unhon ne kaha: Kis cheez ne tumhein rok liya? Maine kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne mujhe apne ek kaam par bheja tha. Unhon ne kaha: Wo kya hai? Maine kaha: Wo Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ka raaz hai. Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ke raaz ki hifazat karo. Unhon ne kaha: Maine logon mein se kisi ko bhi us kaam ke baare mein nahi bataya; agar main kisi ko batata to tumhein batata."
"1271","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne mujhe bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne hamein Thabit se bayan kiya, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Main Qiyamat ke din Jannat ke darwaze par aaunga aur us ke kholne ka mutalaba karunga. Darban kahega: Aap kaun hain? Main kahunga: Muhammad. Wo kahega: Mujhe Aap ke baare mein hukm diya gaya hai ke Aap se pehle kisi ke liye darwaza na kholun."
"1272","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne mujhe bayan kiya, Sulayman ne hamein Thabit se bayan kiya, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne Busaysah ko jasoos bana kar bheja taake dekhein Abu Sufyan ka qafila kya kar raha hai. Wo is haal mein wapas aaye ke ghar mein mere aur Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ke siwa koi na tha — mujhe yaad nahi ke unhon ne apni ba'z azwaj ko mustasna kiya tha ya nahi — aur unhon ne Aap ko khabar di. Phir Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam bahar tashrif laye aur khitab farmaya, farmate hue: Hamare saamne ek maqsad hai jise hasil karna hai, to jis ki sawari haazir hai wo hamare sath sawar ho chale. Kuch log Madinah ke baalaai hisse mein khade apne unton ke baare mein Aap se ijazat maangne lage, to Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, magar jis ki sawari haazir ho. To Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam aur Aap ke sahaba rawana hue yahan tak ke mushrikeen se pehle Badr pahunch gaye, aur mushrikeen aa gaye. Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi kisi cheez ki taraf qadam na badhaye yahan tak ke main us ka elaan karun. Mushrikeen qareeb aa gaye, aur Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Us Jannat ki taraf utho jis ki chaurai aasmano aur zameen ke barabar hai. Umayr ibn Humam al-Ansari ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah, aisi Jannat jis ki chaurai aasman aur zameen ke barabar hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Bakh, bakh. Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Tumhein bakh, bakh kehne par kis cheez ne ubhara? Unhon ne arz kiya: Allah ki qasam, Ya Rasulullah, sirf is ummeed ne ke main us ke ahl mein se ho jaun. Aap ne farmaya: Phir tum us ke ahl mein se ho. Unhon ne apne tar kash se kuch khajoorein nikalein aur khane lage, phir kaha: Agar main ye khajoorein khatam karne tak zinda raha to ye to badi lambi zindagi hai. To unhon ne jo khajoorein un ke paas thin phenk din, phir un se qital kiya yahan tak ke shaheed ho gaye, Allah un par rehem farmaye."
"1273","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne hamein bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne hamein Thabit se bayan kiya, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ko is haal mein dekha ke hajjam Aap ki hajaamat kar raha tha, aur Aap ke sahaba Aap ko ghere hue the, chahte hue ke koi baal zameen par na gire magar kisi aadmi ke haath mein."
"1274","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne mujhe bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne mujhe Thabit al-Bunani se bayan kiya, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam fajr ki namaz padh chukte to Madinah ke khadim paani ke bartanon ke sath aate, aur koi bartan na laya jata magar Aap us mein apna dast-e-mubarak dubote; kabhi kabhi wo sard subah mein Aap ke paas aate aur Aap us mein apna haath dubote."
"1275","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne mujhe bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne hamein Thabit se bayan kiya, Anas ibn Malik se: ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam achhe khwabon ko pasand farmate the, aur Aap jo kuch farmaya karte the us mein se ye bhi tha: Kya tum mein se kisi ne koi khwab dekha hai? Agar koi na-ashna aadmi khwab dekhta to Aap us ke baare mein daryaft farmate, aur agar Aap ko us ke baare mein koi achhi baat batai jati to Aap ko us ka khwab aur bhi zyada khush karta. Ek khatoon aayin aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah, maine neend mein dekha goya mujhe nikala gaya aur Jannat mein dakhil kiya gaya, aur maine ek dhamaka suna jis se Jannat hil gayi, aur wahan fulaan bin fulaan aur fulaan bin fulaan the, yahan tak ke unhon ne baarah mardon ko gina — Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne us se pehle ek lashkar rawana kiya tha — aur unhein ghubar alud kapdon mein laya gaya jab ke un ki shah rag phoot rahi thin. Kaha gaya: Unhein nahr-e-Baydhakh par le jao. Unhein us mein duboya gaya aur wo chaudahwin raat ke chand jaise chehron ke sath nikle. Sone ki kursiyan laai gayin aur wo un par baith gaye, aur sone ka ek thaal laya gaya jis mein kachchi khajoorein thin, aur unhon ne us mein se apni marzi ke mutabiq khajoorein khayeen; wo us thaal ko jis taraf bhi pherte, jo phal chahte kha lete. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, aur maine bhi un ke sath khaya. Phir us lashkar se basharat dene wala aaya aur kehne laga: Ya Rasulullah, aisa aisa hua, aur fulaan aur fulaan ko zakhm laga, yahan tak ke us ne baarah mardon ko gina. Aap ne farmaya: Us khatoon ko mere paas lao. Wo aayin, to Aap ne farmaya: Apna khwab ise sunao. Us aadmi ne kaha: Jaise us ne kaha waisa hi hai; fulaan aur fulaan zakhmi hue."
"1276","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne hamein bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne hamein Thabit se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hum Anas ke paas the jab unhon ne apne ahl-e-khana ke darmiyan ek dastavez likhi, aur unhon ne kaha: Gawah raho, ai qariyon ki jama'at. Thabit ne kaha: Goya mujhe ye na-pasand laga, to maine kaha: Ai Abu Hamzah, kaash aap unhein un ke naamon se pukarte. Unhon ne kaha: Mujhe tumhein qari kehne mein kya harj hai? Kya main tumhein tumhare un bhaiyon ke baare mein na bataun jinhein hum Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ke zamane mein qurra kaha karte the? Unhon ne zikr kiya ke wo sattar afraad the. Jab raat unhein dhaanp leti to wo Madinah mein ek taleem gah mein jate aur wahan subah tak Quran ka dars karte. Jab subah hoti to jo taqatwar hota meetha paani lata aur lakdiyaan jama karta, aur jin ke paas maali gunjaish hoti wo mil kar ek bakri khareedte aur use tayyar karte, aur subah tak wo Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ke hujron par latka diya jata. Jab Khubayb ko shaheed kiya gaya to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne unhein bheja, aur wo Banu Sulaym ke ek qabeela par ja pahunche jin mein mere chacha Haram bhi the. Haram ne un ke sardar se kaha: Mujhe jaane do taake main in logon ko bata dun ke hum un ka irada nahi rakhte, taake wo hamein guzarne dein. Haram ne un se kaha: Hum tumhara irada nahi rakhte, to hamein guzarne do. Ek aadmi neza le kar un ke saamne aaya aur unhein us se paar kar diya, aur jab unhon ne neze ko apne pet mein mehsoos kiya to kaha: Allahu Akbar, Rab-e-Ka'ba ki qasam main kamyab ho gaya. Phir wo un par toot pade aur un mein se koi bhi baqi na raha. Anas ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ko kisi cheez par itna ghamgeen nahi dekha jitna Aap un par ghamgeen hue. Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ko dekha ke jab bhi Aap fajr ki namaz padhte to apne haath uthate aur un ke khilaf dua karte. Baad mein Abu Talhah ne mujh se kaha: Haram ke qatil ka kya hua? Maine kaha: Us ka kya hua, Allah us ke sath aisa kare aur waisa kare. Unhon ne kaha: Thehro, kyunke wo musalman ho chuka hai."
"1277","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne mujhe bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne hamein Thabit se bayan kiya, Anas se: Ek aadmi ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ki dawat ki, to Aap tashrif le gaye, aur main bhi Aap ke sath gaya. Kaddu wala shorba laya gaya, aur Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam wo kaddu khane lage aur wo Aap ko pasand aaya. Jab maine ye dekha to main use Aap ke saamne karne laga aur khud us mein se kuch na khaya. Anas ne kaha: Tab se mujhe ye pasand hai. Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne kaha: Maine ye hadith Sulayman al-Taymi ko sunai to unhon ne kaha: Hum kaddu ke mausam mein Anas ibn Malik ke paas kabhi na gaye magar hum ne use un ke khane mein paya."
"1278","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne mujhe bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne hamein Thabit se bayan kiya, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Hum mein Banu al-Najjar ka ek aadmi tha jis ne Surah al-Baqarah aur Al-e-Imran padh rakhi thi aur jo Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ke liye kitabat kiya karta tha. Wo bhaag kar Ahl-e-Kitab se ja mila. Unhon ne us ki takreem ki aur kaha: Ye Muhammad ke liye likha karta tha, aur wo us se muta'ssir hue. Zyada arsa na guzra tha ke Allah ne un ke darmiyan us ki gardan tod di. Unhon ne us ke liye qabr khodi aur use dafan kar diya, lekin subah ko zameen ne use apni satah par bahar phenk diya. Phir wo palte, us ke liye khoda aur dafan kiya, lekin subah ko zameen ne use apni satah par bahar phenk diya, to unhon ne use bahar pada hua chhod diya."
"1279","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne mujhe bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne hamein Thabit se bayan kiya, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Talhah ka ek beta tha jis ke paas ek chhoti churiya thi jis se wo khelta tha, aur Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Ai Abu Umayr, chhoti churiya ka kya hua?"
"1280","Salm ibn Qutaybah ne hamein bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne hamein Thabit se khabar di, Anas ibn Malik se: ke Nabi Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ka ek katib mushrikeen se ja mila, to unhon ne kaha: Ye Muhammad ka katib hai; is ne tumhara deen ikhtiyar kar liya hai, to is ki takreem karo. Us ki takreem ki gayi, aur zyada arsa na guzra ke wo faut ho gaya. Us ke liye qabr khodi gayi, lekin zameen ne use bahar phenk diya; phir dobara us ke liye qabr khodi gayi, lekin zameen ne use bahar phenk diya, to use un ghatiyon mein se ek ghati mein daal diya gaya."
"1281","Mujhe Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne bayan kiya, hum se Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne bayan kiya, Thabit se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ibn Malik ne humein Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki namaz ka wasf bayan kiya, phir khare hue aur hamare sath namaz parhi. Pas unhon ne ruku kiya, phir seedhe khare rahe hatta ke hum me se baaz ne gumaan kiya ke woh bhool gaye hain, phir sajda kiya, phir seedhe baithe rahe hatta ke hum me se baaz ne gumaan kiya ke woh bhool gaye hain, phir seedhe baithe rahe."
"1282","Mujhe Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne bayan kiya, hum se Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Main jumuah ke din mimbar ke paas khara tha jabke Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khutba de rahe the, ke masjid walon me se ek shakhs ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, barish ruk gayi hai aur maweshi halak ho gaye hain, pas Allah Azza wa Jalla se dua kijiye ke humein barish ata farmaye. To Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apne dono haath buland kiye, halanke hum aasman me koi badal na dekhte the, to Allah Taala ne badalon ko jama kar diya, aur hum par musladhar barish barsai hatta ke hum ne dekha ke taqatwar aadmi ko sirf apne ghar walon tak pahunchne ki fikr thi. Hum par saat din tak baghair rukay barish hoti rahi hatta ke agle jumuah tak, jab Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khutba de rahe the, to logon me se ek ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, ghar munhadim ho gaye aur safar munqata ho gaya, pas Allah se dua kijiye ke ise hum se hata de. To unhon ne apne dono haath buland kiye aur farmaya: Ya Allah, hamare ird gird barsa aur hum par na barsa. Jo hamare saroon ke upar tha woh chhat gaya goya hum saiban ke neeche hon, pas hamare ird gird barish hui jabke hum par barish na hui."
"1283","Hum se Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne bayan kiya, hum se Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka aisa waleema dekha jis me na roti thi aur na gosht tha. Safiyyah Dihyah al-Kalbi ke hisse me aain thin, aur log Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke samne un ki tareef karne lage, kehte hue: Hum ne qaidiyon me aisi aurat dekhi hai jaisi hum ne qaidiyon me kabhi nahi dekhi. Pas unhon ne Dihyah ki taraf qasid bheja aur unhe uske badle me jo unhe pasand aaya ata kiya. Phir unhe Umm Sulaym ke supurd kiya aur farmaya: Inhe taiyar karo. Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Khaybar se nikle hatta ke use peeche chhor diya, phir thehre aur un par khaima lagaya, phir subah farmaya: Jis ke paas zaid tosha ho woh use hamare paas laye. Log zaid khajoor, zaid sawiq aur zaid ghee lane lage hatta ke unhon ne hays ka bara dher bana diya. Unhon ne khaya, phir un ke paas maujood barish ke pani se piya, aur yahi Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka un ke liye waleema tha. Hum rawana hue, aur jab kabhi safar me Madeenah ki deewarein dekhte to un ki taraf jaldi karte, apni sawariyon ko daurाते hue, aur Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apni sawari ko dauraya jabke Safiyyah un ke peeche thin, kyunke unhon ne unhe apne peeche sawaar kiya tha. Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki sawari ko thokar lagi to woh gir pare aur woh bhi gir parin, aur logon me se koi un ki taraf na dekhta raha hatta ke Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khare hue aur unhe dhaanp diya. Un ke Sahaba un ke paas aaye, to Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe koi takleef nahi pahunchi. Hum Madeenah pahunche, aur un ke ghar ki bachchiyan unhe dekhne ke liye niklin, un ke girne par khushi manati huin."
"1284","Hum se Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne bayan kiya, hum se Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne bayan kiya, Thabit al-Bunani se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Anas se kaha: Ay Abu Hamzah, humein un ajeeb waqiat me se kuch bayan kijiye jo aap ne dekhe aur kisi aur se bayan na kijiye. Unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek din zuhr ki namaz parhi, phir gaye hatta ke un nashiston par baithe jahan Jibreel un ke paas aaya karte the. Bilal aaye aur asr ki namaz ke liye azaan kahi, to har woh shakhs jis ke ghar wale Madeenah me the qazae hajat aur wuzu ke liye khara hua, jabke Muhajireen me se kuch mard baqi rahe jin ke ghar wale Madeenah me na the. Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas pani se bhara ek chaura pyala laya gaya, unhon ne apni hatheli bartan me rakhi, lekin bartan un ki poori hatheli ki gunjaish na rakh saka, pas unhon ne apni ye chaar ungliyan bartan me rakhin, phir farmaya: Qareeb aao aur wuzu karo, jabke un ka haath bartan me tha. To unhon ne wuzu kiya hatta ke un me se koi baqi na raha magar us ne wuzu kar liya. Maine kaha: Ay Abu Hamzah, aap ke khayal me woh kitne the? Unhon ne kaha: Sattar se assi ke darmiyan."
"1285","Hum se Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne bayan kiya, hum se Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Humein Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kisi cheez ke baare me sawal karne se mana kiya gaya tha, aur humein achchha lagta tha jab koi aqalmand dehati aadmi aata aur un se sawal karta jabke hum sunte. Ek dehati aadmi aaya aur kaha: Ay Muhammad, aap ka qasid hamare paas aaya aur dawa kiya ke aap dawa karte hain ke Allah ne aap ko bheja hai. Unhon ne farmaya: Us ne sach kaha. Us ne kaha: Aasman ko kis ne paida kiya? Unhon ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla ne. Us ne kaha: Zameen ko kis ne paida kiya? Unhon ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla ne. Us ne kaha: In paharon ko kis ne nasb kiya aur un me jo kuch rakha woh rakha? Unhon ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla ne. Us ne kaha: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne aasman ko paida kiya aur zameen ko paida kiya aur in paharon ko nasb kiya aur un me jo rakha woh rakha, kya Allah ne aap ko bheja hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Haan. Us ne kaha: Aap ke qasid ne dawa kiya ke hamare din aur raat me paanch namazein hum par wajib hain. Unhon ne farmaya: Us ne sach kaha. Us ne kaha: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne aap ko bheja, kya Allah ne aap ko is ka hukm diya hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Haan. Aap ke qasid ne dawa kiya ke hamare maalon me zakat hum par wajib hai. Unhon ne farmaya: Us ne sach kaha. Us ne kaha: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne aap ko bheja, kya Allah ne aap ko is ka hukm diya hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Haan. Aap ke qasid ne dawa kiya ke hamare saal me ek maheene ka roza hum par wajib hai. Unhon ne farmaya: Us ne sach kaha. Us ne kaha: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne aap ko bheja, kya Allah ne aap ko is ka hukm diya hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Haan. Aap ke qasid ne dawa kiya ke Baitullah ka hajj hum par wajib hai jo us tak rasta pa sake. Unhon ne farmaya: Us ne sach kaha. Us ne kaha: Phir woh peeth pher kar gaya aur kaha: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne aap ko haq ke sath bheja, main na in par kuch barhaunga aur na in me se kuch ghataunga. Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar yeh sach kehta hai to Jannat me dakhil hoga."
"1286","Hum se Abd al-Malik ibn Amr ne bayan kiya, hum se Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne bayan kiya, Thabit al-Bunani se, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Khandaq ke din Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath the, aur Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamare sath khod rahe the aur utha rahe the, hatta ke main un ki khaal ki tehon ke darmiyan aur un ki khaal par mitti dekh sakta tha, jabke hum aisi sakhti me the jise Allah Taala janta hai. Hamare paas jau ki roti lai gayi jo kharab charbi se choopri hui thi, to hum khane lage jabke woh hamare sath kha rahe the. Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ya Allah, haqeeqi aish to Aakhirat ka aish hai."
"1287","Hum se Abd al-Malik ibn Amr ne bayan kiya, hum se Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah ne bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aaj raat mera ek beta paida hua hai, aur maine us ka naam apne walid Ibrahim ke naam par rakha hai. Phir unhon ne use Umm Sayf ke hawale kiya, jo Madeenah me doodh pilane wali thin. Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) unhe dekhne gaye, aur main un ke sath gaya. Hum Abu Sayf ke paas pahunche jabke woh apni bhaathi me phoonk rahe the aur ghar dhuein se bhara tha. Main Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se aage badha aur kaha: Ay Abu Sayf, ruk jao, Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tashreef laye hain. Pas woh ruk gaye, aur Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aaye, ladke ko manga, use gale lagaya, aur jo Allah ne chaha ke woh kahein kaha. Phir maine use un ke samne rooh se joojhte dekha, aur Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki aankhon se aansu beh nikle. Unhon ne farmaya: Aankh roti hai, dil ghamgeen hai, aur hum sirf wahi kehte hain jo hamare Rabb ko pasand ho. Allah ki qasam, ay Ibrahim, hum tumhari wajah se ghamgeen hain."
"1288","Humein Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, humein Mamar ne khabar di, Thabit al-Bunani se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Khaybar fatah kiya to al-Hajjaj ibn Ilat ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, Makkah me mera maal hai aur wahan mera ghar hai, aur main un ke paas jana chahta hun, to kya mujhe aap ke khilaf kehne ya kuch kehne ki ijazat hai? Pas Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe jo chahein kehne ki ijazat de di. Woh apni biwi ke paas aaye jab pahunche aur kaha: Jo kuch tumhare paas hai jama kar lo, kyunke main Muhammad aur un ke Sahaba ke maal ghanimat se khareedna chahta hun, kyunke woh loot liye gaye hain aur un ka maal le liya gaya hai. Yeh baat Makkah me phail gayi, pas Musalman ghamgeen hue jabke mushrikeen ne khushi aur masarrat zahir ki. Yeh khabar al-Abbas ibn Abd al-Muttalib ko pahunchi, to woh apni baithne ki jagah me maazoor ho gaye, khare na ho sake. Mamar ne kaha: Mujhe Uthman al-Jazari ne khabar di, Miqsam se, unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne apne ek bete ko liya jise Qutham kaha jata tha, apni peeth par lete, use apne seene par rakha, aur kaha: Qutham khubsurat. Mamar ne kaha: Thabit ne kaha, Anas se: Phir unhon ne apne ek ghulam ladke ko al-Hajjaj ibn Ilat ki taraf bheja, kehte hue: Tum par afsos, tum kya laye ho aur kya keh rahe ho? Jo Allah ne wada kiya hai woh us se behtar hai jo tum laye ho. Al-Hajjaj ne us ghulam ladke se kaha: Abu al-Fadl ko salam pahunchana aur unhe kehna ke mere liye apne gharon me se ek ghar khali kar dein taake main un se mulaqat karun, kyunke khabar wohi hogi jo unhe khush karegi. Un ka ghulam ladka aaya, aur jab darwaze par pahuncha to kaha: Khushkhabri ho, ay Abu al-Fadl. Al-Abbas khushi se uchhle aur unhe dono aankhon ke darmiyan bosa diya, aur us ne unhe woh bataya jo al-Hajjaj ne kaha tha, pas unhon ne use azaad kar diya. Phir al-Hajjaj aaye aur unhe bataya ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Khaybar fatah kar liya hai, us ke maal ko maal ghanimat banaya hai, ke Allah ke hisse us me se taqseem kiye gaye hain, ke Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Safiyyah bint Huyayy ko apne liye muntakhab kiya hai aur unhe azaad ho kar un ki biwi banne ya apne ghar walon se milne ke darmiyan ikhtiyar diya hai, aur unhon ne azaad ho kar un ki biwi banne ko muntakhab kiya hai. Lekin main us maal ke liye aaya hun jo mera yahan tha jise main jama karke le jana chahta tha, pas maine Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se ijazat maangi aur unhon ne mujhe jo chahun kehne ki ijazat de di, pas mujh se teen din tak ise chhupaye rakhna, phir jo chaaho kehna. Un ki biwi ne jo zewar aur saamaan un ke paas tha jama kiya, use ikattha kiya, aur un ke hawale kar diya, aur woh use lekar rawana ho gaye. Teen din ke baad, al-Abbas al-Hajjaj ki biwi ke paas gaye aur kaha: Tumhare shauhar ne kya kiya? Us ne unhe bataya ke woh falan falan din nikal gaye, aur kaha: Allah aap ko ghamgeen na kare, ay Abu al-Fadl, jo aap ko pahuncha us se hum ranjeeda hue. Unhon ne kaha: Haan, Allah mujhe ghamgeen na kare, Allah ki hamd se woh sirf wahi tha jise hum chahte the. Al-Hajjaj ne mujhe bataya hai ke Allah Tabarak wa Taala ne Khaybar Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko ata farmaya hai, us me Allah ke hisse taqseem kiye gaye hain, aur Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Safiyyah ko apne liye muntakhab kiya hai. Agar tumhe apne shauhar ki zaroorat ho to un se ja milo. Us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, mera khayal hai ke aap sach keh rahe hain. Unhon ne kaha: Main sach kehta hun, aur muamala waisa hi hai jaisa maine tumhe bataya. Phir woh Quraysh ki majlison me gaye jabke woh kehte the: Aap ko bhalai ke siwa kuch na pahunche, ay Abu al-Fadl. Unhon ne kaha: Mujhe bhalai ke siwa kuch na pahuncha, Allah ki hamd se. Al-Hajjaj ibn Ilat ne mujhe bataya hai ke Allah Azza wa Jalla ne Khaybar apne Rasul ko ata farmaya hai, us me Musalmanon ke hisse taqseem kiye gaye hain, Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Safiyyah ko apne liye muntakhab kiya hai, aur us ne mujh se teen din tak use chhupane ko kaha tha, woh sirf apna maal aur jo us ka yahan tha lene aaya tha, phir chala jayega. Pas Allah ne woh ranj jo Musalmanon par tha mushrikeen par daal diya. Jo Musalman ghamgeen hokar apne gharon me dakhil hue the woh nikle hatta ke al-Abbas ke paas pahunche, pas unhon ne unhe khabar sunai, to Musalman khush hue, aur jo ranj, gussa ya gham tha woh mushrikeen par laut aaya."
"1289","Mujhe Abu al-Walid ne khabar di, hum se Jafar ibn Sulayman ne bayan kiya, hum se Thabit ne bayan kiya, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Jis din Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Madeenah tashreef laye, us me har cheez roshan ho gayi, aur jis din unhon ne wafaat pai, har cheez tareek ho gayi. Hum unhe dafan kar hi rahe the, hum ne un ke dafan se apne haath na uthaye the ke hum ne apne dil badle hue paye."
"1290","Mujhe Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne bayan kiya, hum se Hammad ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, Thabit al-Bunani se, Anas se: ke Farsi mard Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka hamsaya tha, aur us ke shorbe ki khushbu sab se umdah thi. Us ne khana taiyar kiya, phir Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur unhe dawat di, jabke Aishah un ke pehlu me thin, un ki taraf ishara karte hue: Aaiye. Unhon ne farmaya: Aur ye mere sath wali bhi, Aishah ki taraf ishara karke. Us ne kaha: Nahi. Phir us ne dusri martaba ishara kiya, to unhon ne farmaya: Aur ye mere sath wali. Us ne kaha: Nahi. Phir us ne teesri martaba ishara kiya, to unhon ne farmaya: Haan. Pas Aishah gain."
"1291","Hum se Yunus ibn Muhammad ne bayan kiya, hum se Salih al-Murri ne bayan kiya, Thabit al-Bunani, Maymun ibn Siyah aur Jafar ibn Zayd se, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah ke gharon me kasrat se aane wale Allah wale hain."
"1292","Hum se Yunus ibn Muhammad ne bayan kiya, hum se Hammad ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, Thabit se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Anas se puchha: Kya Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki angoothi thi? Unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek raat isha ki namaz me taakheer farmai hatta ke aadhi raat ke qareeb, phir farmaya: Log namaz parh kar so gaye, lekin tum namaz me hi rehte ho jab tak us ka intezar karte ho. Anas ne kaha: Goya main ab bhi un ki chandi ki angoothi ki chamak dekh raha hun, aur unhon ne apna baayan haath uthaya."
"1293","Hum se Yunus ibn Muhammad ne bayan kiya, hum se Hammad ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, Thabit al-Bunani se, Anas se: ke Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne barish ke liye dua farmai aur is tarah dua me haath phailaye, apne haathon ki pusht apne chehre ki taraf pherte hue."
"1294","Hum se Yunus ibn Muhammad ne bayan kiya, hum se Hammad ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, Aban se, Anas ibn Malik se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se: isi ki manind, siwaye is ke ke unhon ne Arafah me dua farmai."
"1295","Hum se Yunus ibn Muhammad ne bayan kiya, hum se Hammad ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Urwah se, Urwah se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se: isi ki manind, ke unhon ne us ke sath barish ke liye dua farmai."
"1296","Hum se Hajjaj ibn Minhal ne bayan kiya, hum se Hammad ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, Thabit al-Bunani se, Anas ibn Malik se: ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, Qayamat kab aayegi, jabke un ke paas ek Ansari ladka tha jise Muhammad kaha jata tha. Unhon ne farmaya: Agar yeh ladka zinda raha to ho sakta hai ke woh burhapa na paye is se pehle ke Qayamat aa jaye."
"1297","Hum se Hajjaj ibn Minhal ne bayan kiya, hum se Hammad ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, Thabit al-Bunani se, Anas ibn Malik se: ke ek aadmi ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se Qayamat ke aane ke baare me puchha. Phir namaz qaim ki gayi, aur jab unhon ne apni namaz mukammal ki to farmaya: Qayamat ke baare me puchhne wala kahan hai? Us ne kaha: Main hazir hun, Ya Rasul Allah. Unhon ne farmaya: Tum ne us ke liye kya taiyari ki hai? Us ne kaha: Maine us ke liye zyada amal taiyar nahi kiya, siwaye is ke ke main Allah aur us ke Rasul se mohabbat karta hun. Unhon ne farmaya: Aadmi usi ke sath hai jis se woh mohabbat karta hai. Anas kaha karte the: Pas hum Allah aur us ke Rasul se mohabbat karte hain."
"1298","Hum se Sulayman ibn Dawud ne bayan kiya, al-Hakam ibn Atiyyah se: Maine Thabit ko Anas se bayan karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us masjid me tashreef late jis me Muhajireen aur Ansar the, aur un me se koi apna sar apne ghutnon me jhukaye baithne ki halat se na uthata siwaye Abu Bakr aur Umar ke, woh unhe dekh kar muskurate aur woh unhe dekh kar muskurate."
"1299","Hum se Sulayman ibn Dawud ne bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah se, Thabit se, Anas se: ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) fajr ke waqt hamla karte aur sunte, pas agar azaan sunte to ruk jate, warna hamla karte."
"1300","Hum se Affan ibn Muslim ne bayan kiya, hum se Hammad ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, kehte hue: Humein Thabit ne khabar di, Anas se: ke Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) fajr ki namaz ke waqt hamla karte aur sunte, pas agar azaan sunte to warna hamla karte. Ek din unhon ne suna aur ek aadmi ko kehte suna: Allah sab se bara hai, Allah sab se bara hai. Unhon ne farmaya: Fitrat par. Us ne kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahi. Unhon ne farmaya: Tum Aag se nikal aaye."
"1301","Affan ibn Muslim ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, kaha: Thabit ne hamein khabar di, Anas ibn Malik se: ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aksar farmate the: Ai Allah, hamein duniya mein bhalai ata farma aur akhirat mein bhalai ata farma, aur hamein aag ke azab se bacha."
"1302","Sulayman ibn Harb aur Abu al-Walid ne ham se bayan kiya, kaha: Shubah ne ham se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se, aap ne farmaya: Har dhoke baz ke liye Qayamat ke din ek jhanda hoga jis se woh pehchana jayega."
"1303","Said ibn al-Rabi ne ham se bayan kiya, Shubah ne hamein khabar di, Thabit se: maine Anas ko kehte hue suna: woh aksar kehte the: Ai Allah, hamein duniya mein bhalai ata farma aur akhirat mein bhalai ata farma, aur hamein aag ke azab se bacha. Shubah ne kaha: maine Thabit se kaha: kya yeh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se hai."
"1304","Said ibn al-Rabi ne ham se bayan kiya, Shubah ne ham se bayan kiya, Thabit se: maine Anas ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam dua mein apne dono haath buland farmate yahan tak ke aap ki baghlon ki safedi nazar aati. Shubah ne kaha: maine is ka zikr Ali ibn Zayd se kiya, to unhon ne kaha: yeh sirf barish ki dua mein hai. Maine un se kaha: kya tum ne yeh Anas se suna hai? Unhon ne kaha: Subhan Allah. Maine kaha: kya tum ne yeh Anas se suna hai? Unhon ne kaha: Subhan Allah, do ya teen martaba kehte hue."
"1305","Said ibn al-Rabi ne ham se bayan kiya, Shubah ne ham se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se: hamein Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki namaz ka haal bayan karte hue: jab aap ruku se apna sar uthate to itni der khare rehte yahan tak ke ham kehte: woh bhool gaye hain."
"1306","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Mubarak ibn Fadalah ne ham se bayan kiya, Thabit al-Bunani se, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: ek shakhs ne kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasul, main is surat se muhabbat karta hun: Qul Huwallahu Ahad. To Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: tumhari is se muhabbat ne tumhein Jannat mein dakhil kar diya hai."
"1307","Hajjaj ibn Minhal ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Humayd aur Thabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: maine Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko is pyale mein har mashrub pilaya: shehad, doodh, nabidh aur pani."
"1308","Hajjaj ibn Minhal ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, kaha: Thabit al-Bunani ne mujhe khabar di, Anas ibn Malik se: ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ladkon ke sath khel rahe the ke koi aane wala aaya, aap ko pakra, gira diya, aap ka seena khola, dil nikala, phir dil ko khola aur us mein se ek lothra nikala, kehte hue: yeh aap mein Shaitan ka hissa hai. Phir use Zamzam ke pani se sone ke tasht mein dhoya, band kiya, aur use us ki jagah wapas rakha. Ladke daudte hue aap ki walida yani aap ki razai walida ke paas aaye, kehte hue: Muhammad qatl kar diye gaye hain. Woh aaye aur aap ko mile jabke aap ka rang zard tha. Anas ne kaha: ham aap ke seene par us silai ka nishan dekhte the."
"1309","Hajjaj ibn Minhal ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se: ke ek shakhs ne kaha: Ai hamare sardar aur hamare sardar ke bete, aur ai hamare behtareen aur hamare behtareen ke bete. Aap ne farmaya: Ai logo, apni guftagu par qaim raho, aur Shaitan tumhein gumrah na kare. Main Muhammad ibn Abdullah hun."
"1310","Hajjaj ibn Minhal ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se, aap ne farmaya: Jannat mein se jitna Allah chahega baqi rahega, phir Allah Taala us ke liye jo makhluq chahega paida farmayega."
"1311","Hajjaj ibn Minhal ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Thabit aur Humayd al-Tawil se, Anas se: ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat mashaqqaton se gheri hui hai, aur Jahannam khwahishat se gheri hui hai."
"1312","Hajjaj ibn Minhal ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Thabit al-Bunani aur Abu Imran se, Anas ibn Malik se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se. Abu Imran ne kaha: chaar aadmi aag se nikalenge, jabke Thabit ne kaha: do aadmi. Unhein Allah Azza wa Jalla ke samne pesh kiya jayega, phir unhein aag mein jane ka hukm diya jayega. Un mein se ek paltega aur kahega: Ai mere Rab, jab Tu ne mujhe us se nikala tha to main ummeed rakhta tha ke Tu mujhe us mein wapas nahi karega. To Allah use us se nijaat dega."
"1313","Hajjaj ibn Minhal ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se, aap ne farmaya: duniya mein ahle Jannat mein se sab se zyada museebat uthane wale shakhs ko laya jayega, aur Allah farmayega: use Jannat mein ek martaba gota do. Use us mein duboya jayega, phir woh bahar aayega, aur Woh farmayega: Ai ibn Adam, kya tum ne kabhi takleef ya koi napasandida cheez dekhi? Woh kahega: nahi. Phir duniya mein ahle Jahannam mein se sab se zyada aish karne wale shakhs ko laya jayega, aur Allah Azza wa Jalla farmayega: Ai ibn Adam, kya tum ne kabhi koi bhalai ya koi rahat dekhi? Woh kahega: nahi, Teri izzat ki qasam."
"1314","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se: ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: maine aaj raat khwab mein dekha goya ke ham Uqbah ibn Rafi ke ghar mein hain, aur hamare paas Ibn Tab ki taza khajoorein lai gayin. Maine is ki tabeer ki ke hamare liye duniya mein bulandi hai, akhirat mein husn-e-anjam hai, aur ke hamara deen durust ho gaya hai."
"1315","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Thabit ne ham se bayan kiya, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki oontni al-Adba kabhi maghloob nahi hui thi. Ek dehati aaya aur us ne use apne ek jawan oont par daudaya, to dehati us se jeet gaya. Yeh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke Sahaba par bhari guzra, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah par haq hai ke duniya ki koi cheez buland nahi hoti magar Woh use past kar deta hai."
"1316","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Thabit ne ham se bayan kiya, Anas se: ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kaddu pasand farmate the. Jab woh pesh kiya jata to kaddu Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki taraf badha diya jata."
"1317","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Thabit ne ham se bayan kiya, Anas se: ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: mujhe daraya gaya halanke koi nahi daraya gaya, aur mujhe Allah ke raaste mein takleef di gayi halanke koi takleef nahi diya gaya. Mujh par tees din aur raatein guzrin jabke mere paas aur Bilal ke paas koi aisa khana nahi tha jo kisi jandar ke layak ho siwaye us cheez ke jo Bilal ki baghal mein chhupi hui thi."
"1318","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Thabit ne ham se bayan kiya, Anas se: ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke Sahaba mein se kuchh afrad ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki azwaj se aap ki khalwat ki ibadat ke bare mein pucha. Un mein se ek ne kaha: main bistar par nahi sounga; dusre ne kaha: main aurton se nikah nahi karunga; teesre ne kaha: main roza rakhunga aur kabhi iftar nahi karunga. Yeh baat Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tak pahunchi, to aap khutba dene ke liye khare hue, Allah Azza wa Jalla ki hamd o sana bayan ki, phir farmaya: Amma bad, un logon ka kya haal hai jinhon ne aisa aisa kaha? Lekin main roza rakhta hun aur iftar karta hun, sota hun aur namaz padhta hun, aur aurton se nikah karta hun. Jo meri sunnat se airaz kare woh mujh se nahi hai."
"1319","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se: ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke Sahaba Khandaq khodte hue kehte the, aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmate the. Jau ki roti badbudar pighle hue ghee ke sath lai gayi, aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Haqiqi bhalai akhirat ki bhalai hai."
"1320","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, kaha: Thabit ne ham se bayan kiya, Anas se: ke Nabi ki azwaj Uhud ke din subah sawere apni pithon par mashkize uthaye nikaltin, jabke un ki pindliyan zahir thin, pani pilatin."
"1321","Muhammad bin al-Fazl ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad bin Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se riwayat hai: Main Abdullah bin Abi Talhah ko Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke paas laya jab woh paida hue the, jabke Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ek chadar me apne ek oont ko qatraan laga rahe the, Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya tumhare paas khajoorein hain?' Maine kaha: 'Ji haan,' Maine Aap ko kuch khajoorein pesh kin to Aap ne unhe chabaya, phir us bacche ka munh khola aur us me thook diya, aur woh hont chapchapane laga, to Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: 'Ansar ko khajoor mehboob hai,' Aur Aap ne us ka naam Abdullah rakha."
"1322","Muhammad bin al-Fazl ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad bin Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se riwayat hai ke Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam is tarah roze rakhte ke kaha jata: 'Aap roze rakh rahe hain, roze rakh rahe hain,' aur is tarah roza chhod dete ke kaha jata: 'Aap roza nahi rakh rahe, roza nahi rakh rahe.'"
"1323","Muhammad bin al-Fazl ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad bin Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam se manga to Aap ne use bakriyon ka rewad ata farmaya, woh apni qaum ke paas gaya aur kehne laga: 'Ae meri qaum, Islam qabool kar lo, kyunki Allah ki qasam Muhammad aise shakhs ki tarah ata farmate hain jo faqr se nahi darta,' koi shakhs Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke paas sirf duniya ki gharz se aata phir shaam tak us ka deen us ke nazdeek duniya aur jo kuch us me hai us se zyada mehboob ho jata."
"1324","Muhammad bin al-Fazl ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad bin Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: Ek raat namaz ke liye iqamat kahi gayi to ek aadmi ne kaha: 'Ya Rasulallah, mujhe ek haajat hai,' to Aap us ke saath khade sar-goshi karte rahe yahan tak ke log ya baaz log oonghne lage, phir Aap ne un ke saath namaz padhai aur wuzu ka zikr nahi kiya gaya."
"1325","Muhammad bin al-Fazl aur Sulayman bin Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hain: Hammad bin Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai ke Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ek hi din me apni tamam azwaj ke paas gaye."
"1326","Muhammad bin al-Fazl aur Sulayman bin Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hain: Hammad bin Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai ke Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne ek chatai par namaz padhai jabke Umm Sulaym aur Umm Haram hamare peeche thin aur Aap ne unhe apni dahini janib khada kiya jaisa ke Thabit ka khayal tha."
"1327","Muhammad bin al-Fazl ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad bin Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hain: Thabit ne hame khabar di, Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne Uhud ke din ek talwar uthai aur farmaya: 'Is talwar ko is ke haq ke saath kaun lega?' Ek ne kaha: 'Main,' dusre ne kaha: 'Main,' teesre ne kaha: 'Main,' Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: 'Tum me se kaun ise is ke haq ke saath lega?' Log peeche hat gaye, Simak Abu Dujanah ne kaha: 'Main ise lunga, Ya Rasulallah,' phir unhon ne ise le liya aur Uhud ke din mushrikeen ke saron ko cheer diya."
"1328","Sulayman bin Harb ne mujh se bayan kiya, kehte hain: Hammad bin Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: 'Teen khaslaten hain jo shakhs me hon us ne iman ki halawat pa li: ye ke Allah aur us ke Rasul us ke nazdeek har cheez se zyada mehboob hon, ye ke woh kisi bande se sirf Allah Azza wa Jall ke liye muhabbat kare, aur ye ke aag me phenk diya jana us ke nazdeek Yahudiyat ya Nasraniyat ki taraf lautne se zyada mehboob ho.'"
"1329","Sulayman bin Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad bin Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: 'Qayamat ke din jannat walon me se ek aadmi laya jayega aur Allah Ta'ala farmayega: Ae ibn Adam, tune apna thikana kaisa paya? Woh kahega: Ae mere Rab, behtareen thikana, kaha jayega: Tamanna kar aur maang, woh kahega: Main tamanna aur sawal nahi karta siwaye is ke ke mujhe duniya ki taraf lautaya jaye aur das martaba qatl kiya jaun — is fazilat ki wajah se jo woh shahadat ki dekhega, phir jahannam walon me se ek aadmi laya jayega aur Allah us se farmayega: Ae ibn Adam, tune apna thikana kaisa paya? Woh kahega: Ae mere Rab, badtareen thikana, kaha jayega: Kya tu zameen bhar sone ke badle is se chhutkara hasil karna pasand karega? Woh kahega: Ji haan, Allah Azza wa Jall farmayega: Tu jhooth kehta hai, maine tujh se is se zyada aasan cheez ka mutalaba kiya tha lekin tune na kiya.'"
"1330","Sulayman bin Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hain: Hammad bin Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se riwayat hai ke Qabilah Aslam ke ek naujawan ne kaha: 'Ya Rasulallah, main jihad karna chahta hun lekin mere paas taiyyari ka saman nahi hai,' Aap ne farmaya: 'Fulan Ansari ne taiyyari ki thi phir beemar ho gaya, us ke paas jao aur us se kaho: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam tumhe salam kehte hain aur farmate hain: Jo saman tune apne liye taiyyar kiya hai woh mujhe de de,' woh us ke paas gaya aur kaha: 'Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam tumhe salam kehte hain aur farmate hain: Jo saman tune taiyyar kiya hai woh mujhe de de,' us ne kaha: 'Ae fulan, jo saman tune mere liye taiyyar kiya tha woh use de de aur us me se kuch bhi rok kar na rakh, Allah ki qasam us me se kuch bhi rok kar na rakh taake hame us me barkat di jaye.'"
"1331","Abu Nuaym ne hum se bayan kiya, Umarah bin Zadham as-Saidalani ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: Mera ek bhai tha aur Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam us se milte aur farmate: 'Ae Abu Umayr, chhoti chidya ka kya hua?'"
"1332","Abu Nuaym ne hum se bayan kiya, Talhah bin Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hain: Thabit al-Bunani ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hain: Maine Anas ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam suraj ghuroob hone ke baad aur maghrib ki namaz se pehle hamare paas tashreef late aur hame namaz padhte hue dekhte, na hame mana farmate na hukm dete."
"1333","Abu Ishaq Ahmad bin Ishaq al-Hadrami ne hame khabar di, Hammad bin Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit aur Humayd se, Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai ke jab Abdur Rahman bin Awf Madinah aaye to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne un ke aur Sad bin ar-Rabi ke darmiyan muakhat qaim farmai, Sad ne un se kaha: 'Ae mere bhai, main Madinah ke sab se zyada maldar logon me se hun, mere maal ka nisf dekh lo aur le lo, aur meri do biwiyan hain in me se jise chahe dekh lo taake main use tumhare liye chhod dun,' unhon ne kaha: 'Allah tumhare ahl aur maal me barkat de, mujhe bazaar dikhao,' logon ne unhe bazaar dikhaya to unhon ne khareed o farokht ki aur nafa kamaya aur kuch ghee aur aqit ke saath wapas aaye, phir jab tak Allah ne chaha thehre rahe phir zaafran ke nishan ke saath aaye, Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne un se farmaya: 'Mahyam?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Maine ek aurat se nikah kar liya hai,' Aap ne farmaya: 'Use mehr me kya diya?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Khajoor ki guthli ke wazan ke barabar sona,' Aap ne farmaya: 'Walima karo chahe ek bakri hi se ho,' Abdur Rahman ne kaha: 'Us ke baad maine apne aap ko aisa dekha ke agar main koi patthar uthata to khayal karta ke us ke neeche sona ya chandi paunga.'"
"1334","al-Hasan bin Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad bin Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit al-Bunani se, Anas se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne kaha: 'Ya Rasulallah, fulan ka ek khajoor ka darakht hai aur main apni diwar usi se mukammal kar sakta hun, use hukm dijiye ke woh mujhe de de taake main us se apni diwar mukammal kar lun,' Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne us se farmaya: 'Use jannat me ek khajoor ke darakht ke badle ise de do,' lekin us ne inkar kar diya, Abu ad-Dahdah us ke paas aaye aur kaha: 'Apna khajoor ka darakht mere baagh ke badle mujhe bech do,' us ne aisa kar diya, phir woh Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke paas aaye aur kaha: 'Ya Rasulallah, maine khajoor ka darakht apne baagh ke badle khareed liya hai, ise us ko de dijiye aur maine ise Aap ko de diya hai,' Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: 'Abu ad-Dahdah ke liye jannat me khajoor ke kitne bhari guchhe hain' — ye baat baar baar farmai, phir woh apni biwi ke paas gaye aur kaha: 'Ae Umm ad-Dahdah, baagh se nikal jao kyunki maine ise jannat me ek khajoor ke darakht ke badle bech diya hai,' us ne kaha: 'Faide mand sauda hai,' ya is jaisa koi kalma kaha."
"1335","al-Hasan bin Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad bin Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se riwayat hai ke jab Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam apne bistar par tashreef le jate to farmate: 'Tamam taareef Allah ke liye hai jis ne hame khilaya, pilaya, kafi ho gaya aur panah di, kitne hi log hain jinhe na kifayat hai na panah.'"
"1336","al-Hasan bin Musa ne hame khabar di, Hammad bin Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ammar bin Abi Ammar ne hame khabar di, Abbas se — aur Thabit al-Bunani, Anas se riwayat hai ke Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam khajoor ke tane se tek lagakar khutba diya karte the, jab mimbar bana diya gaya to Aap mimbar ki taraf muntaqil ho gaye to tana rone laga yahan tak ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam us ke paas tashreef laye aur use gale laga liya to woh khamosh ho gaya, Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: 'Agar main use gale na lagata to woh Qayamat tak rota rehta.'"
"1337","al-Hasan bin Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad bin Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam se kaha: 'Ae hamare behtareen aur hamare behtareen ke bete, aur ae hamare sardar aur hamare sardar ke bete,' Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: 'Apni baat par qaim raho aur shaitan tumhe gumrah na kar de, main Muhammad bin Abdullah hun, Allah ka banda aur us ka Rasul, Allah ki qasam main pasand nahi karta ke tum mujhe us maqam se upar badhao jo Allah ne mujhe ata farmaya hai.'"
"1338","al-Hasan bin Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hain: Hammad bin Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se riwayat hai ke Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne barish ki dua ki aur apne hathon ki pusht se aasman ki taraf ishara kiya."
"1339","Yahya bin Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad bin Zayd ne hame khabar di, Thabit se, Anas se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke samne khada hua aur kaha: 'Ya Rasulallah, Qayamat kab hai?' Logon ne use kheench kar bitha diya, phir woh dusri martaba khada hua aur Aap se sawal kiya to logon ne use kheench kar bitha diya, phir woh teesri martaba khada hua aur kaha: 'Ya Rasulallah, Qayamat kab hai?' Aap ne farmaya: 'Tujh par afsos, tune us ke liye kya taiyyari ki hai?' Us ne kaha: 'Allah aur us ke Rasul ki muhabbat,' Nabi ne us se farmaya: 'Baith jao, beshak tum usi ke saath ho jise tum mehboob rakhte ho,' Anas bin Malik ne kaha: Hum Islam ke baad kabhi itne khush nahi hue jitne us ke is qaul par khush hue: 'Baith jao, beshak tum usi ke saath ho jise tum mehboob rakhte ho,' unhon ne kaha: 'Mujhe ummeed hai ke main Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam, Abu Bakr aur Umar ke saath rahunga kyunki main un se muhabbat karta hun agarche main un ke aamal se kotah hun.'"
"1340","Sulayman bin Harb ne mujh se bayan kiya, Hammad bin Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke mubarak baal kaanon se tajawuz nahi karte the."
"1341","Mujhe Sulaiman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, kaha: Hamein Hammad ibn Zaid ne Thabit se, unhon ne Anas se naqal kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam logon mein sab se zyada khubsurat, logon mein sab se zyada sakhi aur logon mein sab se zyada bahadur the. Madinah wale ek raat ghabra gaye, pas hum awaz ki taraf nikle, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Abu Talhah ke ek nange ghode par, talwar gardan mein latkaye hue, khabar ki tahqiq kar ke wapas aate hue un se mile, farmate hue: Ghabrao mat, ghabrao mat. Phir farmaya: Hum ne ise tez paya. Hammad ne kaha: Woh ek aisa ghoda tha jo sust tha, phir us din ke baad woh kabhi peeche na raha. Hammad ne kaha: Yeh Thabit ki hadith mein hai ya kisi aur ki hadith mein."
"1342","Mujhe Sulaiman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, kaha: Hamein Hammad ibn Zaid ne Thabit se, unhon ne Anas se, aur Ayyub se, unhon ne Abu Qilabah se, unhon ne Anas se naqal kiya: ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ek safar mein the, aur Anjashah naam ka ek habshi ladka un ke liye hudi padh raha tha. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aahista, tum par afsos ae Anjashah, sheeshe ke bartanon ko hankana. Abu Qilabah ne kaha: Yani auraton ko."
"1343","Mujhe Sulaiman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne Thabit se, unhon ne Anas se naqal kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Bara mardon ke liye hudi padhte the, aur Anjashah auraton ke liye hudi padhte the, aur un ki awaz khubsurat thi. Unhon ne hudi padhi to oont tez chalne lage. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aahista ae Anjashah, tum par afsos, sheeshe ke bartanon ko hankana. Abu Qilabah ne kaha: Yani auraton ko."
"1344","Mujhe Sulaiman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne Thabit se, unhon ne Anas se naqal kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki oontni al-Adba kabhi peeche na rehti thi. Ek dehati apne ek jawan oont par aya, us se daud lagayi aur us se aage nikal gaya. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke Sahaba par yeh bhari guzra, pas Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah par haq hai ke duniya ki jo cheez buland hoti hai use Woh past kar deta hai."
"1345","Mujhe Sulaiman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne Thabit se, unhon ne Anas se naqal kiya: ke Yemen wale Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke pas aye aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, hamare sath ek aadmi bhejein jo hamein Quran sikhaye. Aap ne Abu Ubaidah ibn al-Jarrah ka hath pakda aur unhein un ke sath bhej diya, farmate hue: Yeh is ummat ke ameen hain."
"1346","Mujhe Sulaiman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne Thabit se, unhon ne Anas se naqal kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main Jannat mein dakhil hua aur ek aahat suni. Maine kaha: Yeh kya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Yeh Bilal hain. Phir main Jannat mein dakhil hua aur ek aahat suni. Maine kaha: Yeh kya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Yeh Bilal hain. Phir main Jannat mein dakhil hua aur ek aahat suni. Maine kaha: Yeh kya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Yeh al-Ghumaysa bint Milhan hain, Umm Sulaim, Anas ibn Malik ki walida."
"1347","Mujhe Sulaiman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne Thabit se, unhon ne Anas se naqal kiya: ke Abu Talhah Uhud ke din Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke samne teer chalate the, aur woh mahir teer-andaz the. Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam un ke peeche the, aur jab woh teer chalate to Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apna qad uncha kar ke dekhte ke un ka teer kahan gira. Abu Talhah apne hath se Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke seene ko peeche hatate, kehte hue: Ae Allah ke Rasul, is tarah, koi teer aap ko na lagega. Abu Talhah Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke samne dhal bane hue the, kehte hue: Ae Allah ke Rasul, main mazboot aur tanomand hun, pas mujhe apni hajat ki taraf mutawajjeh karein aur mujhe jahan chahein bhejein."
"1348","Mujhe Sulaiman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne Thabit se, unhon ne Anas se naqal kiya: ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Uhud ke din farmaya: Ae Allah, agar Tu chahe to zameen par Teri ibadat na ki jayegi."
"1349","Mujhe Sulaiman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne Thabit se, unhon ne Anas se naqal kiya: ke aqal mein khalal wali ek aurat ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, mujhe ek hajat hai. Aap khade hue aur farmaya: Ae falan ki maan, jo rasta chaaho ikhtiyar karo taake main tumhare sath tumhari hajat puri karun. Aap use na chhode yahan tak ke us ki hajat puri ho gayi."
"1350","Mujhe Sulaiman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne Thabit se, unhon ne Anas se naqal kiya: ke al-Rubayyi ki behan Umm Harithah ne ek shakhs ko zakhmi kar diya, aur muqaddama Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke pas laya gaya. Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qisas. Umm Harithah ne kaha: Kya falan se qisas liya jayega. Allah ki qasam, us se qisas na liya jayega. Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Umm Harithah, yeh Allah Taala ka faisla hai. Us ne kaha: Nahi, Allah ki qasam, us se qisas na liya jayega. Phir unhon ne logon se guftagu ki yahan tak ke un se sulah kar li aur unhon ne khoon-baha qabool kar liya. Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke bandon mein se kuch aise hain ke agar woh Allah par qasam khayein to Allah use pura kar deta hai."
"1351","Mujhe Sulaiman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne Thabit se, unhon ne Anas ibn Malik se naqal kiya: ke jab Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apne bistar par jate to farmate: Tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai jis ne hamein khilaya, hamein pilaya, hamein kafi hua aur hamein panah di, kitne hi aise hain jinhein na kifayat hai na panah."
"1352","Mujhe Sulaiman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne Thabit se, unhon ne Anas se naqal kiya: ke jab Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam khana khate to apni teen ungliyan chaatte, aur farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ka luqma gir jaye to use uthaye, us se takleef-deh cheez door kare, use khaye aur use Shaitan ke liye na chhode. Woh hamein bartan ponchhne ka hukm dete, farmate hue: Tum mein se koi nahi janta ke us ke khane ke kis hisse mein barkat hai."
"1353","Mujhe Sulaiman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne Thabit se, unhon ne Anas se naqal kiya: ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam musalsal roze rakhte, aur un ke Sahaba mein se kuch musalsal roze rakhte. Aap ne farmaya: Agar mahina mere liye lamba kar diya jata to main is tarah musalsal roze rakhta ke ghulu karne wale apna ghulu tark kar dete. Main apne Rab ke pas raat guzarta hun, woh mujhe khilata aur pilata hai."
"1354","Mujhe Sulaiman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne Thabit se, unhon ne Anas se naqal kiya: ke ek aadmi Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke liye Quran likhta tha. Jab woh use Sami Alim imla karate to woh Sami Basir ya is jaisa likhta. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmate: Tum ne kya likha. Woh kehta: Aisa aisa. Aap farmate: Rehne do. Us ne al-Baqarah aur Al Imran padhi thi, aur jis ne unhein padha us ne Quran ka bahut hissa padha. Phir woh chala gaya aur kaha: Main logon mein Muhammad ke baare mein sab se zyada janne wala hun, woh mujhe imla karate aur main un ke kahe ke khilaf likhta. Woh mujh se kehte: Tum ne kya likha. Main kehta: Aisa aisa, aur woh kehte: Rehne do. Phir woh mar gaya, aur zameen ne use bahar phenk diya, phir woh dafan kiya gaya, aur zameen ne use bahar phenk diya. Abu Talhah ne kaha: Main gaya yahan tak ke use bahar pada hua dekha."
"1355","Mujhe Sulaiman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne Thabit se, unhon ne Anas se naqal kiya: ke ek aadmi ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se manga, aur Aap ne use bakriyan dein. Woh apni qaum ke pas wapas gaya aur kaha: Ae logo, Muhammad ke pas aao, pas Allah ki qasam, woh aisa dena deta hai jo faqr se nahi darta. Anas ne kaha: Aadmi ata jabke woh duniya ke siwa kuch nahi chahta, phir shaam tak us ka deen us ke nazdeek duniya aur jo kuch us mein hai se zyada pyara ho jata."
"1356","Mujhe Sulaiman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne Thabit se naqal kiya, unhon ne kaha: Anas ne kaha: Umm Sulaim ka ek pyala tha, aur koi mashroob na tha magar maine Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko us se pilaya: pani, shehed, doodh aur nabidh."
"1357","Mujhe Abu al-Walid ne bayan kiya, kaha: Hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne Thabit se, unhon ne Anas ibn Malik se naqal kiya: ke ek janaza Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke samne se guzra, aur unhon ne us ki khubi se tareef ki, to Aap ne farmaya: Wajib ho gayi. Woh dusre janaze ke sath guzre aur us ki burai se tareef ki, to Aap ne farmaya: Wajib ho gayi. Phir farmaya: Tum zameen par Allah ke gawah ho."
"1358","Hamein Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, hamein Thabit ne Anas ibn Malik se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki anguthi aisi thi, aur unhon ne apne bayein hath se ishara kiya, apna angutha apni chhoti ungli ki pusht par rakhte hue."
"1359","Mujhe Amr ibn Asim ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne Thabit aur Humaid se, unhon ne Anas se naqal kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki anguthi par naqsh tha: Muhammad, Rasulullah."
"1360","Hamein Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne Thabit se, unhon ne Anas se naqal kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kisi ke liye dua mein koshish farmate to kehte: Allah tum par nek logon ki namaz qayam kare jo raat ko qiyam karte aur din ko roza rakhte hain, jo na gunahgar hain na badkar."
"1361","Sulayman ibn Harb ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mughirah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se, unhone kaha: Main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki das saal khidmat ki, aur unhone mujhe kabhi 'uff' tak nahi kaha, aur na kisi kaam ke baare mein jo main ne kiya ke 'tum ne aisa kyun kiya', aur na kisi kaam ke baare mein jo main ne nahi kiya ke 'tum ne aisa kyun nahi kiya'."
"1362","Sulayman ibn Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se: Anas se Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke khizab ke baare mein pucha gaya, to unhone kaha: Aap ne itne safed baal nahi paye ke khizab karte; agar main chahta to Aap ki dadhi ke safed baal gin leta. Abu Bakr ka khizab mehndi aur katam se tha, aur Umar ka khizab mehndi se tha."
"1363","Sulayman ibn Harb ne mujh se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se, unhone kaha: Main ne resham ya dibaj ko, aur na kisi cheez ko jo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki hatheli se zyada narm ho, kabhi nahi chua, aur na kabhi koi khushbu - ya unhone kaha: koi itr - Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki khushbu - ya unhone kaha: ke itr - se zyada umdah sunghi."
"1364","Sulayman ibn Harb ne mujh se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se, unhone kaha: Jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam par bimari bhaari ho gayi, to Fatimah ne kaha: Haye mere walid ki takleef. Aap ne un se kaha: Aaj ke baad tumhare walid ko koi takleef nahi hogi. Jab Aap ki wafaat ho gayi, to Fatimah radiyallahu anha ne kaha: Haye mere walid, unhone ek Rab ki pukar ka jawab diya jo unhe bula raha tha; haye mere walid, Jannat al-Firdaws un ka thikana hai; haye mere walid, Jibrail ko hum un ki wafaat ki khabar dete hain; haye mere walid, woh apne Rab ke kitne qareeb hain. Jab Aap dafn kiye gaye, to Fatimah ne kaha: Aye Anas, kya tumhare dil Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sar par mitti dalna gawara kar sake?"
"1365","Sulayman ibn Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se: ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne paani talab farmaya, to ek kushadah pyale mein paani laya gaya. Aap ne apni hatheli us mein rakh di - goya main ab bhi paani ko Aap ki ungliyon ke darmiyan se chashmon ki tarah phootte hue dekh raha hun. Unhone kaha: Main ne logon ka andaza sattar se assi ke darmiyan lagaya."
"1366","Sulayman ibn Harb ne mujh se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se: ke ek aadmi ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se pucha: Qayamat kab hai? Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us se farmaya: Tum ne us ke liye kya tayyari ki hai? Us ne kaha: Kuch nahi, siwaye is ke ke main Allah aur Us ke Rasool se muhabbat karta hun. Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Aadmi usi ke saath hoga jis se woh muhabbat karta hai. Anas ne kaha: Hum kisi cheez se itne khush nahi hue jitna Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke is farmaan se khush hue: 'Aadmi usi ke saath hoga jis se woh muhabbat karta hai.' Anas ne kaha: Main Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se muhabbat karta hun, aur Abu Bakr aur Umar se muhabbat karta hun, aur mujhe umeed hai ke main apni un se muhabbat ki wajah se un ke saath hunga, agarche main un jaise aamal nahi karta."
"1367","Sulayman ibn Harb ne mujh se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se: ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf par zard khizab ka nishaan dekha to un se farmaya: Ye kya hai? Unhone kaha: Main ne ek khajoor ki guthli ke wazan barabar sone ke mehr par ek aurat se nikah kiya hai. Aap ne farmaya: Allah tumhe barkat de; walima karo, chahe ek bakri hi se ho."
"1368","Sulayman ibn Harb ne mujh se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se: Main ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko apni kisi zauja ke liye aisa walima karte nahi dekha jaisa unhone Zaynab ke liye kiya; unhone ek bakri ka walima kiya."
"1369","1369 - Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Yusuf ibn Atiyyah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Thabit ne hum se bayan kiya, Anas se, ke ek aurat ek mard ke nikah mein thi aur us ka baap bimaar ho gaya, to woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aayi aur kaha: Ya Rasoolallah, mere walid bimaar hain aur mere shauhar mujhe un ki timardari ki ijazat nahi dete. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us se farmaya: Apne shauhar ki ita'at karo. Phir us ke walid ka inteqal ho gaya, aur us ne apne shauhar se un ka janazah padhne ki ijazat maangi, magar us ke shauhar ne use namaz padhne ki ijazat na di. To us ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se pucha, to Aap ne farmaya: Apne shauhar ki ita'at karo. To us ne apne shauhar ki ita'at ki aur apne walid ka janazah na padha. Phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us se farmaya: Allah ne tumhare shauhar ki ita'at ki wajah se tumhare walid ko bakhsh diya hai."
"1370","1370 - Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Jafar ibn Sulayman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Thabit ne hum se bayan kiya, Anas se: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ek aadmi ke paas tashreef laye jabke woh qareeb al-marg tha, aur us se farmaya: Tum apne aap ko kaisa paate ho? Us ne kaha: Main umeed rakhta hun aur darta hun. Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Aise mauqe par ye dono cheezen kisi bande ke dil mein jama nahi hotin magar Allah use woh ata karta hai jis ki woh umeed rakhta hai aur use us cheez se aman deta hai jis se woh darta hai."
"1371","1371 - Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Jafar ibn Sulayman ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se, unhone kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam apni maa ke saath ek bache ke rone ki awaz sunte jabke Aap namaz mein hote, ya namaz mein kuch hota, to Aap mukhtasar surat padh lete."
"1372","1372 - Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Shubah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas ibn Malik se, unhone kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Momin ko kisi takleef ki wajah se jo use pahunchi ho maut ki tamanna nahi karni chahiye; lekin agar use aisa karna hi pade, ya agar tumhe aisa karna hi pade, to use yun kehna chahiye: 'Aye Allah, mujhe zinda rakh jab tak zindagi mere liye behtar ho, aur mujhe wafaat de jab wafaat mere liye behtar ho.'"
"1373","1373 - Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Shubah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas ibn Malik se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se: ke Aap aksar ye dua karte the: 'Aye hamare Rab, hamein duniya mein bhalayi ata farma aur akhirat mein bhalayi ata farma aur hamein aag ke azab se bacha.' Unhone kaha: To main ne Thabit se kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se? Unhone kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se."
"1374","1374 - Amr ibn Asim al-Kilabi ne mujhe khabar di, unhone kaha: al-Mubarak ibn Fadalah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se, unhone kaha: Kaha gaya: Ya Rasoolallah, ye ek aadmi hai jo koi namaz nahi padhta magar us mein 'Qul Huwa Allahu Ahad' padhta hai, kabhi use tanha padhta hai aur kabhi use kisi dusri surat ke saath padhta hai. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us se farmaya: Tum is se kya irada rakhte ho? Us ne kaha: Ya Rasoolallah, main is se muhabbat karta hun. Aap ne farmaya: To tumhari is se muhabbat ne tumhe Jannat mein dakhil kar diya hai."
"1375","1375 - Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: al-Harith ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Thabit aur Abu Imran al-Jawni ne hum se bayan kiya, Anas ibn Malik se, unhone kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mujhe kisi kaam se bheja, to main ne bachon ko khelte hue dekha, to main un ke saath baith gaya. Phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam tashreef laye aur bachon ko salam kiya."
"1376","1376 - Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: al-Harith ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Thabit al-Bunani ne hum se bayan kiya, Anas se, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Aye fulaan, kya tum ne aisa-aisa kiya hai? Us ne kaha: Nahi, us Zaat ki qasam jis ke siwa koi mabud nahi, main ne nahi kiya, jabke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam jaante the ke us ne kiya hai. Aap ne ye baat us se teen martaba dohrayi, har martaba woh qasam khata jabke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam jaante the ke us ne kiya hai. Phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us se farmaya: Allah ne tumhare jhoot ko tumhare sachche qaul 'La ilaha illallah' ki wajah se mita diya hai."
"1377","1377 - Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: al-Harith ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Thabit al-Bunani ne hum se bayan kiya, Anas se, unhone kaha: Logon ne kaha: Ya Rasoolallah, jab hum Aap ke paas hote hain to ek haal mein hote hain, lekin jab hum Aap ke paas se chale jaate hain to dusre haal mein ho jaate hain, aur hamein dar hai ke ye nifaq hai. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un se farmaya: Tum apne Rab ke baare mein kaise ho? Unhone kaha: Allah khalwat aur jalwat mein hamara Rab hai. Aap ne farmaya: Tum apne Nabi ke baare mein kaise ho? Unhone kaha: Aap khalwat aur jalwat mein hamare Nabi hain. Aap ne farmaya: Ye nifaq nahi hai."
"1378","1378 - Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, aur mera khayal hai ke sirf Anas se, unhone kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs do betiyon ya do behnon ya teen ki parwarish kare yahan tak ke woh juda ho jayen (nikah se) ya woh unhe chhod kar wafaat pa jaye, to main aur woh Jannat mein in dono ki tarah honge - aur Aap ne apni do ungliyon ko mila diya."
"1379","1379 - Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit aur Abd al-Aziz ibn Suhayb aur Shuayb ibn al-Habhab se, Anas se: ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Safiyyah ko azad kiya aur un ki azadi ko un ka mehr qarar diya. Unhone kaha: Phir main ne Abd al-Aziz ko Thabit se puchte hue suna, kehte hue: Aye Abu Muhammad, kya tum ne Anas se is hadith ke baare mein pucha, unhone use mehr mein kya diya? Unhone kaha: Un ki zaat ko."
"1380","1380 - Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se, unhone kaha: Main tumhare saath namaz padhne se is tarah nahi rukta jaisa main ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko namaz padhte dekha. Unhone kaha: Aur jab Anas ruku karte phir seedhe khade hote, to sajdah na karte yahan tak ke koi kehta - ya hum kehte: Woh bhool gaye hain. Aur jab woh sajdah karte aur apna sar uthate, to (dusra) sajdah na karte yahan tak ke koi kehta - ya hum kehte: Woh bhool gaye hain."
"1381","1381 - Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se: ke ek dehati Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki masjid me aaya aur us me peshab kar diya, to ek aadmi us ki taraf lapka. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Use chhor do, use mat roko. Unhon ne kaha: Phir aap ne pani ka ek dol ya pani ka ek bartan mangwaya aur use us par baha diya."
"1382","1382 - Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Thabit ne hum se bayan kiya, Anas se, jinhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke samne se ek janaza guzra aur us ki achchhai se tareef ki gai, to Allah ke Rasul sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Wajib ho gai. Phir ek aur janaza guzra aur us ka burai se zikr kiya gaya, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Wajib ho gai. Aap se arz kiya gaya: Ya Rasul Allah, aap ne is ke bare me farmaya: Wajib ho gai, aur is ke bare me bhi farmaya: Wajib ho gai. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak log, ya mominin, zamin par Allah ke gawah hain."
"1383","1383 - Yahya ibn Ishaq ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umarah ibn Zadham ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit al-Bunani se, Anas ibn Malik se, ke jab Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf ne hijrat ki, to Allah ke Rasul sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un ke aur Sad ibn al-Rabi ke darmiyan bhai chara qaim farmaya. Unhon ne un se kaha: Mere do bagh hain, to mere dono baghon me se jo chaho pasand kar lo. Unhon ne kaha: Allah tumhare dono baghon me tumhare liye barkat de; main isi liye Musalman nahin hua. Mujhe bazar dikhao. Unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne unhen bazar dikhaya, aur woh ghee aur aqit aur khalen kharidne lage, aur unhon ne maal jama kiya aur shadi ki. Phir woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pas aaye jabke un par zard khushbu ka nishan tha, to aap ne farmaya: Ye kya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne shadi ki hai. Aap ne farmaya: Allah tumhen barkat de; walima karo chahe ek bakri se. Unhon ne kaha: Phir un ka maal barh gaya yahan tak ke kapra aur aata aur ghalla lade hue saat sau oont un ke pas aaye. Unhon ne kaha: Jab woh Madinah me dakhil hue, to ahl-e-Madinah me zor ki awaz suni gai. Aishah ne kaha: Ye shor kaisa hai. Un se kaha gaya: Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf ka qafila aaya hai, saat sau oont kapra aur aata aur ghalla lade hue. Aishah ne kaha: Main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Aur Abd al-Rahman Jannat me dakhil nahin honge magar ghisat kar. Jab ye bat Abd al-Rahman tak pahunchi, to unhon ne kaha: Ae ammi, main tumhen gawah banata hun ke ye apne bojhon aur kajawon aur asbab samet Allah Azza wa Jalla ki rah me hain."
"1384","1384 - Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah se, Thabit se, Anas se, ke Allah ke Rasul sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Mushrikon par Abu Talhah ki awaz ek dastay se zyada sakht hai."
"1385","1385 - Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Bakr ne hum se bayan kiya, Humayd se, Thabit se, Anas se: ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne safed-o-siyah singon wale do mendhon ki qurbani ki."
"1386","1386 - Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah se, Thabit se, Anas se, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah Azza wa Jalla ne Jannat me Adam ko banaya, to unhen jitni muddat chaha chhore rakha. Iblis un ke gird chakkar lagane laga ke dekhe woh kya hain. Jab us ne unhen khokhla dekha, to jan liya ke woh aisi makhluq banaye gaye hain jo apne aap par qaboo nahin rakhti."
"1387","1387 - Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Aswad ibn Amir ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah se, Thabit aur Ali ibn Zayd se, Anas se: ke jab Uhud ke din mushrik Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam par ghalib aaye, to aap ne farmaya: Kaun unhen hum se hatayega, aur woh Jannat me mera sathi hoga. Ansar me se ek mard khara hua aur lara yahan tak ke shahid ho gaya. Phir ek aur unhen hatate hue khara hua aur lara yahan tak ke saat shahid ho gaye. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne apne sahaba se farmaya: Hum ne apne sathiyon se insaf nahin kiya."
"1388","1388 - Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umarah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas se: ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Umm Sulaym ko ek aurat ko dekhne ke liye bheja. Aap ne farmaya: Us ke munh ko sungho aur us ki takhnon ko dekho."
"1389","1389 - Yazid ibn Harun ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd al-Tawil ne humen khabar di, Anas ibn Malik se, ke Abdullah ibn Salam Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pas aaye jab aap Madinah tashrif laye, aur kaha: Main aap se teen baton ke bare me puchhne wala hun jinhen Nabi ke siwa koi nahin janta. Aap ne farmaya: Puchho. Unhon ne kaha: Qayamat ke muamlat me se pehli cheez kya hai, ya Qayamat ki nishaniyon me se, aur Jannatiyon ka pehla khana kya hoga, aur bachche ko bap ke mushabeh aur bachche ko maan ke mushabeh kya banata hai. Aap ne farmaya: Jibril ne abhi mujhe un ki khabar di hai. Unhon ne kaha: Jibril. Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Woh farishton me se Yahudiyon ka dushman hai. Aap ne farmaya: Qayamat ki nishaniyon me se pehli ye hai ke ek aag mashriq se niklegi aur logon ko maghrib ki taraf jama karegi. Aur Jannatiyon ka pehla khana jo khayenge woh machhli ke kaleje ka zaid tukra hai. Aur bachche ke bap ke mushabeh aur maan ke mushabeh hone ka sabab ye hai ke jab mard ka pani aurat ke pani par sabqat le jaye to woh bap ke mushabeh hota hai, aur jab aurat ka pani mard ke pani par sabqat le jaye to woh maan ke mushabeh hota hai. Unhon ne kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin aur aap Allah ke Rasul hain. Phir unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, Yahudi buhtan tarash log hain, to mujhe un se chhupa len, phir mere Islam ke bare me janne se pehle un se mere bare me puchhen: Main un me kaisa aadmi hun. Phir un me se ek jamaat aayi, aur Allah ke Rasul sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un se farmaya: Abdullah tum me kaisa aadmi hai. Unhon ne kaha: Hum me se behtarin aur hum me se behtarin ka beta, hamare sardar aur hamare sardar ke bete, hum me se sab se zyada alim aur hum me se sab se zyada alim ke bete. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara kya khayal hai agar Abdullah Islam le aaye. Unhon ne kaha: Allah unhen is se bachaye. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Abdullah un ke samne nikle aur kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasul hain. Unhon ne kaha: Hum me se badtarin aur hum me se badtarin ka beta, aur isi tarah ki baten. Abdullah kehte hain: Ya Rasul Allah, isi se main darta tha."
"1390","1390 - Yazid ibn Harun ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd al-Tawil ne humen khabar di, Anas ibn Malik se, ke Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki taraf hijrat ki, aur aap ne un ke aur Sad ibn al-Rabi ke darmiyan bhai chara qaim farmaya. Sad ne un se kaha: Ae Abd al-Rahman, main Ansar me se sab se zyada maldar hun, aur main apna maal tum se adha adha bant lunga, aur meri do biwiyan hain aur main un me se ek ko talaq de dunga, to jab us ki iddat khatm ho jaye to us se nikah kar lena. Abd al-Rahman ne un se kaha: Allah tumhare ahl aur tumhare maal me tumhare liye barkat de, lekin mujhe bazar dikhao. To unhon ne unhen bazar dikhaya, aur woh us din wapas nahin aaye yahan tak ke unhon ne ghee aur aqit me se kuch nafa kamaya. Woh kuch din rahe, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam un ke pas se guzre aur un par zard khushbu ka nishan dekha. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un se farmaya: Ye kya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne nikah kiya hai, ya Rasul Allah. Aap ne farmaya: Kis se. Unhon ne kaha: Ansar ki ek aurat se. Aap ne farmaya: Use mahr me kya diya. Unhon ne kaha: Khajur ki guthli ke wazan, ya khajur ki guthli ke wazan ke barabar, sona. Aap ne farmaya: Walima karo chahe ek bakri se."
"1391","1391 - Yazid ibn Harun ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ne humen khabar di, Anas ibn Malik se: ke Abu Musa ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se sawari mangi, aur aap se kuch mashghuliyat pesh aayi, to aap ne qasam khai ke aap unhen sawari nahin denge, phir aap ne unhen sawari di. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, aap ne qasam khai thi ke aap mujhe sawari nahin denge. Aap ne farmaya: Aur main qasam khata hun ke main tumhen zaroor sawari dunga; aur aap ne unhen sawari di."
"1392","1392 - Yazid ibn Harun ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ne humen khabar di, Anas se, jinhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul sallallahu alaihi wasallam Madinah tashrif laye jabke un ke do din the jin me woh khelte the. Allah ke Rasul sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Main tumhare pas aaya jabke tumhare do din the jin me tum khelte the, aur Allah Tabarak wa Taala ne un ke badle tumhen un se behtar do din diye hain: Fitr ka din aur Adha ka din."
"1393","1393 - Yazid ibn Harun ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ne humen khabar di, Anas se, jinhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Tumhen kisi par rashk nahin karna chahiye yahan tak ke dekho us ka khatma kis par hota hai. Ke banda apni zindagi ke ek arse, ya apne waqt ke ek hisse tak, nek amalon par amal karta hai, yahan tak ke agar woh unhi par mare to Jannat me dakhil ho, phir woh badal jata hai aur bure amalon par amal karta hai. Aur banda apni zindagi ke ek arse tak bure amalon par amal karta hai, yahan tak ke agar woh unhi par mare to Jahannum me dakhil ho, phir woh badal jata hai aur nek amalon par amal karta hai. Aur jab Allah kisi bande se bhalai ka irada farmata hai, to use kaam par laga deta hai. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, woh use kaise kaam par lagata hai. Aap ne farmaya: Use nek amal ke liye bedar kar deta hai, phir use usi par faut karta hai."
"1394","1394 - Yazid ibn Harun ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd al-Tawil ne humen khabar di, Anas ibn Malik se, jinhon ne kaha: Jab bhi hum raat ko Allah ke Rasul sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko namaz parhte dekhna chahte, hum unhen dekhte, aur jab bhi hum unhen raat ko sote dekhna chahte, hum unhen sote dekhte."
"1395","1395 - Yazid ibn Harun ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd al-Tawil ne humen khabar di, Anas ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul sallallahu alaihi wasallam mahine me roze rakhte yahan tak ke hum kehte: Us me se kisi hisse me iftar nahin karte; aur iftar karte yahan tak ke hum kehte: Us me se kisi hisse me roza nahin rakhte."
"1396","1396 - Yazid ibn Harun ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd al-Tawil ne humen khabar di, Anas se: ke un ke chacha Badr ki larai se ghair hazir rahe, aur kaha: Main us pehli larai se ghair hazir raha jo Allah ke Rasul sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mushrikon se lari; agar Allah Azza wa Jalla mujhe kisi larai me hazir kare to Allah dekhega main kaise amal karta hun. Jab Uhud ka din aaya aur Musalman bepardah ho gaye, to unhon ne kaha: Ya Allah, main Teri taraf un se bezari ka izhar karta hun jo ye laye hain yani mushrik, aur Tujh se un par mazirat chahta hun jo inhon ne kiya yani un ke sahaba. Phir woh aage barhe, aur Sad Uhud se pehle akhri sire par un se mile. Unhon ne kaha: Main tumhare sath hun. Unhon ne kaha: Jo unhon ne kiya main woh na kar saka. Woh assi se zyada talwar ke war aur neze ke zakhm aur teer ke nishan samet paye gaye. Unhon ne kaha: Aur hum kehte the ke un ke aur un ke sathiyon ke bare me nazil hua: Un me se woh hain jinhon ne apni nazr puri ki aur un me se woh hain jo intezar kar rahe hain. Unhon ne kaha: yani ye ayat."
"1397","1397 - Yazid ibn Harun ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ne humen khabar di, Anas se: ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam is dua se dua mangte the: Ya Allah, main Teri panah mangta hun fikr aur gham aur susti aur burhape aur aajizi se."
"1398","1398 - Yazid ibn Harun ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ne humen khabar di, Anas se, jinhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Tum me se koi kisi taklif ki wajah se jo use pahunchi ho ya pahunchne wali ho maut ki tamanna na kare; balke ye kahe: Ya Allah, mujhe us waqt tak zinda rakh jab tak zindagi mere liye behtar ho, aur mujhe us waqt wafat de jab Tu jane ke wafat mere liye behtar hai."
"1399","1399 - Yazid ibn Harun ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ne humen khabar di, Anas se: ke Allah ke Rasul sallallahu alaihi wasallam ek aise aadmi ki iyadat ke liye tashrif laye jo jhare hue chooze ki tarah ho gaya tha, aur farmaya: Kya tum kisi cheez se dua mangte the ya Us se kuch mangte the. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha tha: Ya Allah, jo azaab Tu mujhe Akhirat me dene wala hai, use mere liye duniya me hi jaldi de de. Allah ke Rasul sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Subhan Allah, phir tum use bardasht nahin kar sakte, aur tum use hargiz bardasht na kar sakoge. Tum ne ye kyun na kaha: Ae hamare Rab, humen duniya me bhalai de aur Akhirat me bhalai de aur humen Jahannum ke azaab se bacha."
"1400","1400 - Yazid ibn Harun ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd aur Yahya al-Sawwaf dono ne mil kar humen khabar di, Anas se, jinhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Kya main tumhen Ansar ke behtarin mohallon ki khabar na dun. Unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahin, ya Rasul Allah. Aap ne farmaya: Banu al-Najjar ke mohalle, phir Banu Abd al-Ashhal ke mohalle, phir Banu al-Harith ibn al-Khazraj ke mohalle, phir Banu Saidah ke mohalle. Phir Allah ke Rasul sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Aur Ansar ke tamam mohallon me khair hai. Dono me se ek ne kaha: Aur aap ne use buland awaz se farmaya."
"1401","1401 - Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Sulayman al-Taymi ne hamein bayan kiya, al-Hasan aur Humayd al-Tawil se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne bhai ki madad karo chahe wo zalim ho ya mazlum. Logon ne kaha: Ya Rasulallah, jab wo mazlum ho to hum us ki madad karte hain, lekin jab wo zalim ho to hum us ki madad kaise karen? Aap ne farmaya: Tum use zulm se rok do."
"1402","1402 - Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ne hamein khabar di, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam Tabuk ke ghazwah se wapas aaye aur Madinah ke qareeb pahunche to farmaya: Beshak Madinah mein kuch log hain: tum ne koi safar nahi kiya aur na koi wadi uboor ki magar wo us mein tumhare sath the. Logon ne kaha: Ya Rasulallah, jabke wo Madinah mein hain? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, uzr ne unhein rok diya."
"1403","1403 - Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ne hamein khabar di, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Taybah ne Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko singhi lagai, to Aap ne us ke liye ghalle ke do paimane ka hukm diya, aur us ke aaqaon se us ke bare mein guftugu ki to unhon ne us ka kharaj kam kar diya. Aur Aap ne farmaya: Tum jin cheezon se ilaj karte ho un mein sab se behtar singhi lagwana aur hindi qust hai, aur apne bachchon ko halaq ke dard ko dabane se aziyat na do."
"1404","1404 - Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ne hamein khabar di, Anas se: ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam masjid mein dakhil hue aur do sutunon ke darmiyan bandhi hui rassi dekhi. Aap ne farmaya: Ye rassi kaisi hai? Logon ne kaha: Ye falan aurat ki hai; wo namaz padhti hai, aur jab thak jati hai to us se latak jati hai. Aap ne farmaya: Use chahiye ke jab tak samajh ke sath padh sake namaz padhe; jab use ghalabah ka khauf ho to so jaye."
"1405","1405 - Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ne hamein khabar di, Anas se: ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam Badr ke maqam par the jab Musalmanon ne Aap ko pukarte hue suna: Ae Abu Jahl ibn Hisham, aur ae Utbah ibn Rabiah, aur ae Shaybah ibn Rabiah, aur ae Umayyah ibn Khalaf, kya tum ne apne Rab ke wade ko sach paya? Pas maine apne Rab ke wade ko sach paya hai. Logon ne kaha: Ya Rasulallah, aap aise logon ko pukar rahe hain jo gal sar chuke hain. Aap ne farmaya: Tum meri baat ko un se zyada sunne wale nahi ho, lekin wo jawab dene ki taqat nahi rakhte."
"1406","1406 - Yazid ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ne hamein khabar di, Anas ibn Malik se: ke namaz khadi ho chuki thi aur takbir kehne se pehle Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne apna chehra logon ki taraf phera aur farmaya: Apni safen seedhi karo aur qareeb qareeb khade ho, pas main tumhein apni peeth ke peeche se dekhta hun. Beshak hum mein se koi apna kandha apne bhai ke kandhe se aur apna qadam us ke qadam se aur apna ghutna us ke ghutne se namaz mein milata tha."
"1407","1407 - Yazid ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ne hamein khabar di, Anas se: ke Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam pasand karte the ke Muhajireen aur Ansar Aap ke qareeb rahen taake wo Aap se seekhen."
"1408","1408 - Yazid ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ne hamein khabar di, Anas se: ke Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam al-Baqi mein the jab ek aadmi ne dusre aadmi ko pukara: Ae Abu al-Qasim. Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam mutawajjeh hue, to us ne kaha: Ya Rasulallah, maine aap ko murad nahi liya; maine to falan aadmi ko murad liya tha. Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere naam par naam rakho, lekin meri kuniyat par kuniyat na rakho."
"1409","1409 - Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ne hamein khabar di, Anas se: ke Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ek raat apne hujre mein namaz padh rahe the, aur Aap ke kuch sahaba Aap ke paas aaye aur Aap ki namaz ke sath namaz padhi, to Aap ne mukhtasar kar di. Phir Aap ghar mein dakhil hue, phir bahar tashreef laye, aur baar baar aisa hi karte rahe, har baar namaz padhte aur andar dakhil hote. Jab subah hui to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulallah, hum ne Aap ke sath namaz padhi aur hum chahte the ke aap namaz ko tawil karen. Aap ne farmaya: Mujhe tumhari jagah ka ilm tha, aur maine ye jaan bujh kar kiya."
"1410","1410 - Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd al-Tawil ne hamein khabar di, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Anqareeb aisi qaum aayegi jin ke dil tumhare dilon se zyada narm honge. Phir Ashari aaye, un mein Abu Musa bhi the, aur wo rajaz padhne lage aur kehne lage: [shi'r asl matan mein hazf hai]."
"1411","1411 - Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd al-Tawil ne hamein khabar di, Anas se: ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ka guzar ek aadmi par hua jabke wo qurbani ke oont ko haank raha tha. Aap ne farmaya: Is par sawar ho jao. Us ne kaha: Ye qurbani ka janwar hai. Aap ne farmaya: Is par sawar ho jao."
"1412","1412 - Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd al-Tawil ne hamein khabar di, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat qayam nahi hogi yahan tak ke zameen par koi Allah, Allah kehne wala baqi na rahe."
"1413","1413 - Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd al-Tawil ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Jab ye ayat nazil hui: Tum hargiz neki ko nahi pa sakte jab tak tum us mein se kharch na karo jo tumhein mehboob hai, ya: Kaun hai jo Allah ko qarz-e-hasan de, to Abu Talhah ne kaha: Ya Rasulallah, falan jagah mera bagh Allah Azza wa Jalla ke liye hai, aur agar main use chhupa sakta to us ka elan na karta. Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Use apne rishtedaron ya qaraabat-daron mein taqseem kar do."
"1414","1414 - Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd al-Tawil ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Anas se pucha gaya: Kya Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne apne baal range the? Unhon ne kaha: Safed baal ne Aap ko badnuma nahi kiya tha. Kaha gaya: Kya safedi badnumai hai? Unhon ne kaha: Tum sab use napasand karte ho; Aap ki dadhi ke agle hisse mein sirf kuch baal the, aur unhon ne dadhi ke agle hisse ki taraf ishara kiya."
"1415","1415 - Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ne hamein khabar di, Anas se: ke Umm Sulaym ka ek beta tha jise Abu Umayr kaha jata tha, aur us ke paas nughayr nami ek chhoti chirya thi. Jab Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam un ke han tashreef late to us se mazaq karte. Aap un ke han tashreef laye aur use ghamgeen dekha, aur farmaya: Abu Umayr ko kya hua? Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulallah, us ki nughayr mar gayi hai. Aap farmane lage: Ae Abu Umayr, nughayr ko kya hua?"
"1416","1416 - Abu Wahb Abdullah ibn Bakr al-Sahmi ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ne hamein bayan kiya, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Talhah ka ek beta tha jise Abu Umayr kaha jata tha, aur us ke paas ek nughayr thi jis se wo khelta tha. Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam jab andar tashreef late to us se muhabbat bhari guftugu farmate. Aap tashreef laye aur us ki nughayr mar chuki thi, aur Aap ne use ghamgeen dekha, aur farmaya: Abu Umayr ko kya hua? Logon ne kaha: Ya Rasulallah, us ki nughayr mar gayi hai. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abu Umayr, nughayr ko kya hua?"
"1417","1417 - Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Anas se pucha gaya: Kya Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam dua ke waqt haath uthate the? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, ye Jumuah ke din hua jab barish rok di gayi thi aur zameen banjar ho gayi thi aur maal halak ho raha tha. Aap ne haath uthaye yahan tak ke maine Aap ki baghlon ki safedi dekhi, jabke maine aasman mein koi badal nahi dekha tha. Aap ne barish ki dua ki, aur Aap ne namaz khatam bhi nahi ki thi ke qareeb rehne wala naujawan bhi apne ghar walon tak wapas lautne ki fikr karne laga. Ye silsila ek hafte tak jari raha. Jab agla Jumuah aaya to logon ne kaha: Ya Rasulallah, ghar gir gaye hain aur sawar rok diye gaye hain aur maal halak ho gaya hai. Unhon ne kaha: To Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam muskuraye, phir apne hathon se farmaya: Ae Allah, hamare ird gird barsa aur ham par na barsa. Unhon ne kaha: To badal Madinah se hat gaya."
"1418","1418 - Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hamein khabar di, Musa ibn Ubaydah se, Muhammad ibn Thabit se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab koi aadmi apne bhai se kahe: Jazak Allahu khayran, to us ne tareef mein kamal kar diya."
"1419","1419 - Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hamein khabar di, Musa ibn Ubaydah se, Muhammad ibn Thabit se, Abu Hurayrah se: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam farmaya karte the: Ae Allah, jo Tu ne mujhe sikhaya hai us se mujhe faida pahuncha, aur mujhe wo sikha jo mujhe faida de, aur mere ilm mein izafa farma. Har haal mein Allah ke liye hamd hai. Ae mere Rab, main Ahle Jahannam ke haal se Teri panah mangta hun."
"1420","1420 - Sulayman ibn Dawud ne hamein bayan kiya, Zuhayr ibn Muawiyah se, Sad Abu Mujahid al-Tai ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Mudallah, Ummahaat al-Mumineen ke azad karda ghulam, ne mujhe bayan kiya ke unhon ne Abu Hurayrah ko kehte hue suna: Hum ne kaha: Ya Rasulallah, jab hum aap ke paas hote hain to hamare dil narm ho jate hain aur hum ahle akhirat mein se ho jate hain, lekin jab hum aap ke paas se nikalte hain aur auraton aur bachchon ki khushbu sunghte hain to ye duniya hamein achhi lagne lagti hai. Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us Zaat ki jis ke Haath mein meri jaan hai, agar tum waise hi raho jaise tum mere paas hote ho to farishte tum se hathon se musafaha karen aur tumhare gharon mein tumhari ziyarat karen. Aur agar tum gunah na karo to Allah aisi qaum le aaye jo gunah kare aur maghfirat talab kare, to Wo unhein bakhsh de. Hum ne kaha: Ya Rasulallah, hamein Jannat ke bare mein batayen: us ki imarat kis cheez se hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ek eent sone ki aur ek eent chandi ki, us ke kankare moti aur yaqut hain, us ka gara mushk hai, aur us ki mitti zafran hai. Jo us mein dakhil hoga wo nematon mein rahega aur kabhi takleef nahi uthayega, aur hamesha rahega aur kabhi marega nahi. Us ke kapde kabhi purane nahi honge, aur us ki jawani kabhi khatam nahi hogi. Teen hain jin ki dua rad nahi hoti: rozedar yahan tak ke wo iftar kar le, adil hukmaran, aur mazlum ki dua. Use badalon par uthaya jata hai, us ke liye aasman ke darwaze khol diye jate hain, aur Rab Tabarak wa Taala farmata hai: Meri Izzat ki qasam, main zaroor tumhari madad karunga chahe kuch der baad hi sahi."
"1421","1421 - Abu Asim ne hamein khabar di, al-Hajjaj al-Sawwaf se, Ibn Abi Kathir se, Abu Jafar se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Teen duaein qabool hoti hain, un mein koi shak nahin: baap ki dua apni aulad ke khilaf, mazloom ki dua, aur musafir ki dua."
"1422","1422 - Uthman ibn Umar ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nahhas ibn Qahm ne hamein bayan kiya, Shaddad Abu Ammar se, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs nafl chasht ki namaz ki pabandi kare, us ke gunah bakhsh diye jayenge agarche samandar ki jhag se bhi zyada hon."
"1423","1423 - Abu al-Walid ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne hamein bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, Humayd ibn Abd al-Rahman al-Himyari se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se, unhon ne farmaya: Ramazan ke baad sab se afzal roza Allah ka mahina al-Muharram hai, aur farz ke baad sab se afzal namaz raat ki namaz hai."
"1424","1424 - Sulayman ibn Dawud ne hamein bayan kiya, Sadaqah ibn Musa se, Muhammad ibn Wasi ne hamein bayan kiya, Shutayr ibn Nahar al-Abdi se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tumhara Rabb Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya: Agar Mere bande Meri itaat karte, to Mein unhein raat ko barish deta, aur din ko un par suraj nikalta, aur unhein bijli ki garaj ki awaz na sunne deta. Aur Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Apne iman ki tajdeed karo. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, hum apne iman ki tajdeed kaise karein. Unhon ne farmaya: Kasrat se kaho: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin."
"1425","1425 - Affan ibn Muslim aur Abu al-Walid ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Salamah ne hamein bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Wasi se, Shutayr ibn Nahar se, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Husn-e-zan achhi ibadat ka hissa hai."
"1426","1426 - Abu al-Walid ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Salamah ne hamein bayan kiya, Abu Imran al-Jawni se, ek shakhs se, Abu Hurayrah se: ke ek shakhs ne Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se apne dil ki sakhti ki shikayat ki. Unhon ne farmaya: Agar tum chahte ho ke tumhara dil narm ho, to miskin ko khana khilao aur yateem ke sar par hath phero."
"1427","1427 - Abd al-Malik ibn Amr al-Aqadi ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Mughirah ibn Abd al-Rahman ne hamein bayan kiya, Abu al-Zinad se, Musa ibn Abi Uthman se, un ke walid se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se, unhon ne farmaya: Allah Taala ne Adam ko Apni surat par paida kiya."
"1428","1428 - Abd al-Malik ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa ibn Ulayy ne hamein bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abd al-Aziz ibn Marwan se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se, unhon ne farmaya: Insan mein sab se buri cheez sakht bukhl aur ghabra dene wali buzdili hai."
"1429","1429 - Sulayman ibn Harb ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Zayd ne hamein bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se, Abu Hurayrah se: ke Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne apne sahaba se khushkhabri dete hue farmaya: Tumhare pas Ramazan aya hai, ek babarkat mahina; Allah ne tum par us ke roze farz kiye hain. Us mein Jannat ke darwaze khol diye jate hain, aur us mein Jahannam ke darwaze band kar diye jate hain, aur us mein shayateen ko jakad diya jata hai. Us mein ek raat hai jo hazar mahinon se behtar hai; jo us ki bhalai se mehrum raha, woh waqai mehrum raha."
"1430","1430 - Abd al-Malik ibn Amr ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulayman ibn Bilal ne hamein bayan kiya, Ibrahim ibn Abi Asid se, un ke dada se, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Hasad se bacho, kyunke hasad nekiyon ko kha jata hai jaise aag lakdi ko khati hai - ya unhon ne kaha: ghaas ko."
"1431","1431 - Abd al-Malik ibn Amr aur Sulayman ibn Dawud ne hamein bayan kiya, Zuhayr ibn Muhammad se, Musa ibn Wardan se, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Admi apne gehre dost ke deen par hota hai, pas tum mein se har ek dekhe ke woh kise dost banata hai."
"1432","1432 - Abdullah ibn Maslamah ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Abi Humayd ne hamein bayan kiya, Musa ibn Wardan se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Jannat mein yaqoot ke sutun hain, un par zamurrad ke bala khane hain; un ke khule hue darwaze hain jo aise chamakte hain jaise roshan sitara chamakta hai. Hum ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, un mein kaun rahega. Unhon ne farmaya: Woh jo Allah Azza wa Jalla ke liye ek dusre se mohabbat karte hain, aur Allah Azza wa Jalla ke liye ek sath baithte hain, aur Allah Azza wa Jalla ke liye ek dusre se milte hain."
"1433","1433 - Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hamein bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Hajjaj ibn Furafisah se, Makhul se, Abu Hurayrah se, marfuan, unhon ne kaha: Jo shakhs halal tariqe se duniya talab kare, sawal se bachne ke liye, aur apne ghar walon ke liye mehnat karte hue, aur apne parosi se husn-e-suluk karte hue, woh Qayamat ke Din is hal mein ayega ke us ka chehra chaundhwin raat ke chand ki tarah hoga. Aur jo shakhs fakhr aur muqabla aur dikhawe ke liye halal tariqe se duniya talab kare, woh Allah Azza wa Jalla se is hal mein milega ke Woh us par naraz hoga."
"1434","1434 - Umar ibn Said al-Dimashqi ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Said ibn Abd al-Aziz al-Tanukhi ne hamein bayan kiya, Makhul se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs na khud jihad kare, na kisi mujahid ko tayyar kare, na Allah ki rah mein kisi mujahid ke ghar walon mein bhalai ke sath us ka qaim maqam bane, Allah use kisi musibat mein mubtala karega."
"1435","1435 - Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, ek shakhs se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Qayamat qaim nahin hogi yahan tak ke admi apne bhai ki qabr ke pas se guzrega aur kahega: Kash mein us ki jagah hota."
"1436","1436 - Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhayb ibn Khalid ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn Umayyah ne hamein bayan kiya, Abu Amr ibn Muhammad ibn Hurayth se, un ke dada Hurayth se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se, unhon ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz parhe, to apne samne koi cheez rakhe; agar na paye, to lathi gadh le; agar na paye, to lakeer kheench le. Phir jo us ke samne se guzrega, woh use nuqsan nahin pahunchayega."
"1437","1437 - Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Mansur se, Abbad ibn Unays se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Muazzin ko jahan tak us ki awaz pahunchti hai bakhsh diya jata hai, aur har tar aur khushk cheez jo use sunti hai us ki tasdeeq karti hai. Aur jo us ke sath hazir ho us ke liye pachees nekiyan hain."
"1438","1438 - Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Aban se, al-Ala ibn Ziyad se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ke bandon mein Allah ko sab se zyada mehboob woh hain jo suraj aur chand ki nigrani karte hain."
"1439","1439 - Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Ibn Abi Anas se, un ke walid se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab Ramazan ka mahina ata hai, Jahannam ke darwaze band kar diye jate hain, rehmat ke darwaze khol diye jate hain, aur shayateen ko jakad diya jata hai."
"1440","1440 - Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Hisham ibn Urwah se, Wahb ibn Kaysan se, ke Muhammad ibn Amr ne use khabar di ke Salamah ibn al-Azraq Ibn Umar ke pas baithe the jab ek janaza guzra jabke aurtein us par ro rahi thin. Ibn Umar ne is ko napasand kiya aur unhein danta. Salamah ibn al-Azraq ne un se kaha: Aisa na kaho, Ae Abu Abd al-Rahman, kyunke mein gawahi deta hun ke mein ne Abu Hurayrah ko kehte suna: Allah ke Rasul (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke pas se ek janaza guzra jabke mein un ke sath tha, Umar ibn al-Khattab ke sath, aur aurtein us par ro rahi thin. Umar ne unhein danta aur malamat ki. Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Inhein chor do, Ae Umar, kyunke aankh ansu bahati hai, jaan musibat zadah hai, aur ahad qareeb ka hai. Ibn Umar ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasul behtar jante hain, Allah aur Us ke Rasul behtar jante hain."
"1441","1441 - Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Ayyub se, Amr ibn Dinar se, Hisham ibn Yahya se, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab koi shakhs muflis ho jaye aur bae' apna maal sahi salim maujood paye to woh dusre qarz khwahon ki nisbat us ka ziyada haqdar hai."
"1442","1442 - Abu Nuaym ne ham se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Dawud ibn Qays ne ham se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Said jo Abdullah ibn Amir ke azad kardah ghulam hain ne ham se riwayat ki, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Najash mat karo, ek dusre se bughz mat rakho, ek dusre se ru-gardani mat karo, ek dusre se hasad mat karo, aur tum mein se koi dusre ki be' par be' na kare. Allah ke bande bhai bhai ban jao. Musalman Musalman ka bhai hai: na us par zulm karta hai, na use be-yar o madadgar chhorta hai, na use haqir samajhta hai. Taqwa yahan hai - apne seene ki taraf ishara karte hue. Musalman ki har cheez dusre Musalman par haram hai: us ka khoon aur us ki izzat. Admi ke liye yahi burai kafi hai ke woh apne Musalman bhai ko haqir samjhe."
"1443","1443 - Rawh ibn Ubadah ne ham se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne ham se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: al-Ala ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Yaqub ne mujhe khabar di, Abu Abdullah se, ke unhon ne Abu Hurayrah ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Suraj kisi din aise tulu ya ghurub nahi hota jo Jumuah se behtar ho. Koi makhluq aisi nahi magar woh Jumuah ke din ghabrati hai siwaye in do wazn walon ke: jinn aur insan. Masjid ke har darwaze par do farishte hote hain jo pehle aane walon ko tartib se likhte hain: ek shakhs ki tarah jis ne oont pesh kiya, aur ek shakhs ki tarah jis ne gaay pesh ki, aur ek shakhs ki tarah jis ne bakri pesh ki, aur ek shakhs ki tarah jis ne parinda pesh kiya, aur ek shakhs ki tarah jis ne anda pesh kiya. Jab imam baith jata hai to saheefe lapet diye jate hain."
"1444","1444 - Yunus ibn Muhammad ne ham se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn al-Furat al-Tamimi ne ham se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Said ibn Luqman ne ham se riwayat ki, Abd al-Rahman al-Ansari se, Abu Hurayrah se: Main ne Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Bazaron mein khana kaminepan hai."
"1445","1445 - Sulayman ibn Dawud ne ham se riwayat ki, Imran al-Qattan se, Qatadah se, Abbas al-Jushami se, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Kitabullah Azz wa Jall mein se ek surah jo tees ayaton wali hai, us ne ek shakhs ki shafaat ki hatta ke use Aag se nikal kar Jannat mein dakhil kara diya, aur woh surah Tabarak hai."
"1446","1446 - Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne ham se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ibn Mihran ne ham se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Abi Kathir ne ham se riwayat ki, Amir al-Uqayli se, un ke walid se, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat mein dakhil hone wale sab se pehle teen hain: ek ghulam jis ne apne Rabb ki ibadat ko khoob umda kiya aur apne aaqaon ke huquq ada kiye, ek tangdast shakhs jo pakdaman hai aur sawal se bachta hai, aur ek shakhs jo Allah ke raste mein qital karta raha hatta ke qatl kar diya gaya. Aur Aag mein dakhil hone wale sab se pehle teen hain: ek faqir jo takabbur karne wala hai, ek hakim jis ko iqtidar diya gaya, aur ek maldar shakhs jis ne apne maal ke huquq ada na kiye."
"1447","1447 - Yaqub ibn Ibrahim al-Zuhri ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne ham se riwayat ki, Salih ibn Kaysan se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Abd al-Rahman ne kaha: main ne Abu Hurayrah ko kehte hue suna: Beshak Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya - aur Allah khoob janne wala hai: Do aankhon ko Aag ka chhuna haram hai: ek aankh jo Allah Azz wa Jall ke khauf se roi, aur ek aankh jo Islam aur ahl-e-Islam ki hifazat mein ahl-e-kufr ke muqabale raat bhar pehra deti rahi. Aur Aap ne farmaya: Koi banda Allah ke khauf se rota hai aur us ki aankhon se aansu behtay hain phir Allah use kabhi Aag mein dakhil nahi karega hatta ke barish aasman par wapas laut jaye. Aur kaha jata hai: Aap mimbar par khare hue jab log Mutah se ek roti ke tukre ke sath wapas aaye. Jab Aap ne un ke maamle ka zikr kiya to Aap ki aankhen ashkon se bhar gayin, to Aap ne apna chehra ponchha aur farmaya: Main sirf ek insan hun; main shaitan se Allah ki panah mangta hun. Admi apne bhai ki wajah se khud ko zyada samajhta hai. Jis ka mere zimme koi wada ho - to Salman al-Farisi ne kaha: mera hai, ai Allah ke Rasul - to Aap ne woh use de diya. Aur Barakah ne kaha, jab Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki sahabzadi jo Uthman ke nikah mein thin wafaat pa rahi thin aur Aap wahan maujood the: Aap ki aankhen bhar ayin aur Barakah roi aur apne baal noch liye, to Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne use danta. Us ne kaha: Kya Aap rote hain, ai Allah ke Rasul, jabke hum khamosh rahen? Aap ne farmaya: Jo tum ne mujh se dekha woh us ke liye rehmat hai; main sirf ek insan hun. Beshak momin Allah ke nazdik har achhe maqam par hai, chahe sakhti mein ho ya aasani mein."
"1448","1448 - Khalid ibn Makhlad ne mujh se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Sulayman ibn Bilal ne ham se riwayat ki, Salih ibn Kaysan ne mujh se riwayat ki, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Murghe ko bura mat kaho, pas woh namaz ke liye jagata hai."
"1449","1449 - Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne mujh se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se riwayat ki, al-Awzai se, Jahman se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Har cheez ki ek taharat hai, aur badan ki taharat roza hai."
"1450","1450 - Abd al-Rahim ibn Abd al-Rahman al-Muharibi aur Muawiyah ibn Amr ne mujh se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Zaidah ne ham se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Abi Sulaym ne ham se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: main ne al-Jallas se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Marwan ne Abu Hurayrah se pucha: Aap ne Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko janazah par dua kaise padhte hue suna? Unhon ne kaha: Aap farmate the: Ai Allah, Tu ne ise paida kiya aur Tu ne ise Islam ki hidayat di, aur Tu ne is ki ruh qabz ki; Tu is ke poshida aur zahir ko janta hai. Hum sifarishi ban kar aaye hain, pas ise bakhsh de."
"1451","1451 - al-Hasan ibn Musa ne ham se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Salamah ne ham se riwayat ki, Abu Sinan se, Uthman ibn Abi Sawdah se, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Musalman apne bhai ki iyadat karta hai ya Allah ki khatir us se mulaqat ko jata hai, to Allah Azz wa Jall farmata hai: Tu pak hai aur tera chalna pak hai, aur tu ne Jannat mein ek thikana bana liya hai."
"1452","1452 - Umar ibn Sad ne ham se riwayat ki, Ubaydullah ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Mawhab se, un ke chacha se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum mein se koi jan le ke us par kya gunah hai apne bhai ke samne se guzarne mein jabke woh us ke samne hail hote hue apne Rabb se sargoshi kar raha ho, to us jagah chalis saal khare rehna us qadam se zyada mehboob hota jo us ne us ke samne uthaya."
"1453","1453 - Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hamein khabar di, Musa ibn Ubaydah al-Rabadhi se, Ayyub ibn Khalid se, Ubaydullah ibn Abi Rafi se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din meri ummat mein se raat aur sailab ki tarah log aayenge. Farishte kahenge, jab Muhammad ke sath un ki ummat mein se tamam anbiya ke sath aane walon se ziyada log aayenge: [ikhtitam]. Matbua nuskhe aur qalamī nuskhe mein: Ubaydullah hai, jabke takhrij ke masadir mein Abdullah hai, aur Allah khoob janne wala hai."
"1454","1454 - Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hamein khabar di, Musa ibn Ubaydah se, un ke bhai se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke Haath mein meri jaan hai, Jannat mein koi dakhil nahi hoga magar woh jo rahem dil ho. Hum ne kaha: Hum sab rahem dil hain, ai Allah ke Rasul. Aap ne farmaya: Reham dili yeh nahi ke tum mein se koi apne qaraabatdar par reham kare; balke yeh hai ke woh logon par aam taur par reham kare aur logon ke liye aam taur par dard mehsoos kare."
"1455","1455 - Abdullah ibn Maslamah ne ham se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Aziz ibn Muhammad ne ham se riwayat ki, Muhammad ibn Talha se, Mihsan ibn Ali se, Awf ibn al-Harith se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo wuzu kare aur apna wuzu khoob achhi tarah mukammal kare, phir chale aur dekhe ke log namaz padh chuke hain, to Allah use us shakhs ka sawab dega jis ne woh namaz padhi aur us mein hazir hua, un ke sawab mein se kuch kam kiye baghair."
"1456","1456 - Qabisah ne ham se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne ham se riwayat ki, al-Jurayri se, Abu Nadrah se, al-Tufawi se, Abu Hurayrah se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Auraton ki khushbu woh hai jis ka rang zahir ho aur khushbu chhupi hui ho, aur mardon ki khushbu woh hai jis ki khushbu zahir ho aur rang chhupa hua ho."
"1457","1457 - Said ibn al-Rabi ne ham se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Shubah ne ham se riwayat ki, Abu al-Dahhak se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Abu Hurayrah ko suna, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Jannat mein ek darakht hai jis ke saaye mein sawar sau saal, ya sattar saal chalta rahega. Shubah ne kaha: Aur mera khayal sirf sau saal ka hai. Phir unhon ne kaha: Sau saal baghair use uboor kiye - shajar-e-khuld."
"1458","1458 - Abu Ali al-Hanafi ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Dhi'b ne ham se riwayat ki, Abd al-Rahman ibn Mihran se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Sad se, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Masjidon se jitna door, phir jitna door, utna hi sawab mein bada hai."
"1459","1459 - Abu Ali al-Hanafi ne mujh se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Dhi'b ne ham se riwayat ki, al-Aswad ibn al-Ala ibn Jariyah al-Thaqafi se, Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Abu Hurayrah se, ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo shakhs apne ghar se meri masjid ki taraf nikalta hai, to ek qadam neki likhta hai aur dusra qadam burai ko mitata hai."
"1460","1460 - Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne ham se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Aqil al-Thaqafi ne ham se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Sinan al-Tamimi ne ham se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: main ne Bukayr ibn Fayruz ko kehte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: main ne Abu Hurayrah ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo dara woh raat ke awwal hisse mein chal pada, aur jo raat ke awwal hisse mein chal pada woh manzil ko pahunch gaya. Khabardar, Allah ka sauda qeemti hai; khabardar, Allah ka sauda Jannat hai."
"1461","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sharik ne hum se bayan kiya, Asim ibn Ubaydullah se, Ubayd ibn Abi Ubayd se jo Abu Ruhm ke azaad kardah hain, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Hurayrah ke sath chal raha tha jab ek aurat guzri jabke us ki khushbu phail rahi thi, unhon ne us se kaha: Ae Jabbar ki bandi, tum kahan ja rahi ho ya tumhara kya irada hai, us ne kaha: Masjid ki taraf, unhon ne kaha: Kya tum ne is ke liye khushbu lagai hai, us ne kaha: Ji haan, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo aurat is masjid ke liye khushbu lagati hai, woh khushbu nahi lagati magar is mein namaz ke liye, us ki namaz qubul nahi ki jayegi hatta ke woh janabat ke ghusl ki tarah ghusl kare."
"1462","Abu al-Walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne hamein khabar di, Yala ibn Ata se, Abu Alqamah al-Ansari se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurayrah ne mujh se apne munh se mere munh tak bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Jis ne meri itaat ki us ne Allah ki itaat ki, aur jis ne meri nafarmani ki us ne Allah ki nafarmani ki, aur jis ne hukmaran ki itaat ki us ne meri itaat ki, hukmaran to sirf ek dhaal hai, agar woh baith kar namaz parhe to baith kar namaz parho, jab woh kahe: Allah ne us ki sun li jis ne us ki hamd ki, to kaho: Ae Allah, ae hamare Rab, tere hi liye hamd hai, pas jab zameen walon ka kalam aasman walon ke kalam ke muwafiq ho jata hai to us ke guzishta gunah bakhsh diye jate hain, unhon ne kaha: Aur Qaisar halak hoga aur us ke baad koi Qaisar nahi hoga, aur Kisra halak hoga aur us ke baad koi Kisra nahi hoga, unhon ne kaha: Aur unhon ne kaha: Allah se paanch cheezon se panah mango: Jahannam ke azab se aur qabr ke azab se aur zindagi aur maut ki fitne se aur Masih Dajjal ke fitne se."
"1463","Yunus ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Qasim ibn al-Fadl ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Harun al-Abdi ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar ye baat na hoti ke kutte ummaton mein se ek ummat hain to main un ke qatl ka hukm deta, pas un mein se har siyah siyah kutte ko qatl karo, unhon ne kaha: Pas main ne Abu Hurayrah se kaha: Un ke kalon ko un ke surkhon par kya fazilat hai, Abu Hurayrah ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se aise hi kaha jaise tum ne kaha, aur Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah Tabarak wa Taala ne jinno ke ek qabile par laanat ki aur unhein zameen ke darindon ki surat mein maskh kar diya, ye siyah kutte jinno mein se hain aur ye shikari janwaron mein se khabees tareen hain."
"1464","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Aziz ibn al-Numan ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Hayyan se, Ata al-Khurasani se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: In chaar ki muhabbat momin ke dil ke siwa kahin jama nahi hoti: Abu Bakr aur Umar aur Uthman aur Ali."
"1465","Umar ibn Said al-Dimashqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Said ibn Abd al-Aziz ne hum se bayan kiya, Ismail ibn Ubaydullah se, Khalid ibn Husayn se, Abu Hurayrah se: Main ne kisi shakhs ko Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se zyada ye kehte hue nahi dekha: Main Allah se bakhshish talab karta hun aur us ki taraf tauba karta hun."
"1466","Abd al-Rahman ibn Sad jo al-Razi hain ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Abi Qays ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim ibn Muhajir se, Mujahid se, Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Dhubab se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Walad al-zina Jannat mein dakhil nahi hoga, aur na us ki nasal se koi saat pushton tak."
"1467","Yamar ibn Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Said ibn Abi Ayyub ne hamein khabar di, Yahya ibn Abi Sulayman se, Zayd ibn Abi Attab se, Abu Hurayrah se ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalmanon mein behtareen ghar woh hai jis mein koi yateem ho jis se husn-e-suluk kiya jata ho, aur Musalmanon mein badtareen ghar woh hai jis mein koi yateem ho jis se badsuluki ki jati ho, phir unhon ne apni do ungliyon se farmaya: Main aur yateem ka kafil Jannat mein is tarah honge, jabke unhon ne apni do ungliyon se ishara kiya."
"1468","Yamar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Fadl ibn Ghazwan ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Abi Num al-Bajali se, Abu Hurayrah se, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Qasim, Nabi al-Taubah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs kisi begunah ghulam par us baat se tohmat lagaye jo us ne us ke khilaf kahi, Qayamat ke din us par hadd qaim ki jayegi illa ye ke woh aisa hi ho jaisa us ne kaha, Musnad Abu Hurayrah khatm hui."
"1469","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ibn Husayn ne hamein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Urwah ibn al-Zubayr se, Aishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Ramadan ki ek raat tashreef laye aur masjid mein namaz parhi, aur logon ne un ke peeche namaz parhi, jab subah hui to unhon ne us ka tazkira kiya, aur dusri raat log zyada ho gaye, jab teesri raat hui to masjid apne logon se bhar gayi, lekin Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam us raat un ki taraf tashreef na laye, jab subah hui to unhon ne un se us ka zikr kiya, to unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe tumhare maqam ka ilm tha, aur main ne jaan bujh kar aisa kiya."
"1470","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Urwah se, Aishah se: Ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam raat ko gyarah rakatein namaz parhte the, jab fajr tulu hoti to do halki rakatein parhte, phir apne dahine pehlu par tek lagate hatta ke muazzin aata aur unhein namaz ki khabar deta."
"1471","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Urwah se, Aishah se, unhon ne kaha: Yahudiyon ka ek giroh Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas dakhil hua aur kaha: Tum par maut ho, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aur tum par, Aishah ne kaha: Pas main usay samajh gayin aur kaha: Tum par maut aur laanat ho, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Narmi karo, ae Aishah, beshak Allah har muamle mein narmi ko pasand farmata hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, kya aap ne nahi suna unhon ne kya kaha, Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya main ne nahi kaha: Aur tum par."
"1472","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Urwah se, Aishah se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam gunah aur qarz se panah manga karte the, Aishah radiyallahu anha ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, aap kitni kasrat se qarz se panah mangte hain, unhon ne farmaya: Jab admi maqruz hota hai aur wada karta hai to wada khilafi karta hai, aur jab baat karta hai to jhut bolta hai."
"1473","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Urwah se, Aishah se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aurat mujh se mangte hue apni do betiyon ke sath aayi, aur us ne mere paas ek khajur ke siwa kuch na paya, main ne woh use de di, aur us ne use apni dono betiyon mein taqseem kar diya aur us mein se kuch na khaya, phir woh khari hui aur chali gayi, woh aur us ki dono betiyan, us ke thori der baad Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam mere paas tashreef laye, aur main ne unhein us ka qissa sunaya, Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs in betiyon mein se kisi cheez se aazmaya jaye aur un se husn-e-suluk kare to woh us ke liye Aag se dhaal hongi."
"1474","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Urwah se, Aishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam muawwizat ke sath apne upar dam kiya karte the, unhon ne kaha: Pas main ne al-Zuhri se pucha: Woh apne upar kis tarah dam karte the, unhon ne kaha: Woh apne hathon par dam karte, phir un se apna chehra ponchhte, unhon ne kaha: Jab woh bhari ho gaye to main un par unhi se dam karne lagi aur unhein unhi ke hath se ponchhne lagi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam."
"1475","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Urwah se, Aishah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Khadijah par jab tak woh faut na huin koi nikah nahi kiya."
"1476","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Urwah se, Aishah se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Abu Musa ki awaz suni jabke woh tilawat kar rahe the, to farmaya: Is shakhs ko Aal-e-Dawud ke mizmaron mein se diya gaya hai."
"1477","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Urwah se, Aishah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par Makkah mein namaz do do rakatein farz ki gayi thi, jab woh Madinah tashreef le gaye to chaar farz ki gayin, jabke safar ki namaz do rakatein hi rehne di gayi, al-Zuhri ne kaha: Pas main ne Urwah se kaha: Aishah ko safar mein namaz puri parhne par kis cheez ne amada kiya, halanke woh janti thin ke Allah Azza wa Jalla ne use sirf do rakatein farz kiya hai, unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne us ki wahi taweel ki jo Uthman ne Mina mein namaz puri parhne ki ki thi."
"1478","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Urwah se, Aishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kisi amal ko chhor dete halanke woh use karna pasand farmate, is khauf se ke log use sunnat ke taur par apna lein aur woh un par farz kar di jaye, unhon ne kaha: Aur woh us cheez ko pasand farmate jo logon par halki ho."
"1479","Abd al-Razzaq ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Urwah se, Aishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Farishte nur se paida kiye gaye, jinn aag ke be-dhuan shoale se paida kiye gaye, aur Adam us cheez se paida kiye gaye jo tumhein bayan ki gayi hai."
"1480","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Urwah se, Aishah se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un se farmaya: Ye Jibril hain, aur woh tumhein salam kehte hain, unhon ne kaha: Un par bhi salam aur Allah ki rehmat aur us ki barkatein hon, aap woh dekhte hain jo hum nahi dekhte."
"1481","1481 - Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne hamein khabar di, az al-Zuhri, az Urwah, az Aishah, jinhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne kabhi apne hath se na kisi khadim ko mara, na kisi aurat ko, na kisi cheez ko, siwa is ke ke Allah ki rah mein jihad kar rahe hon. Aur na aap ne kabhi apni zaat ke liye us cheez ka badla liya jo aap ke sath ki gayi, yahan tak ke Allah ki hurmaton ko pamal kiya jata to phir aap Allah Azza wa Jalla ke liye badla lete. Aur aap ko do maamlon mein ikhtiyar nahi diya jata tha magar aap un mein se zyada aasan ko ikhtiyar farmate, jab tak wo gunah na ho; agar wo gunah hota to aap logon mein sab se zyada us gunah se door rehte."
"1482","1482 - Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne hamein khabar di, az al-Zuhri, az Urwah aur Hisham ibn Urwah, az un ke walid, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne Aishah se pucha: Kya Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam apne ghar mein kaam karte the? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam apni jutti gaanthe the aur apna kapda seete the aur apne ghar mein kaam karte the jaise tum mein se koi apne ghar mein kaam karta hai."
"1483","Kathir ibn Hisham ne hum se riwayat ki, Ja'far ibn Burqan ne hum se riwayat ki, kehte hain: Maine al-Zuhri se ek shakhs ke baare mein pucha jo apni biwi ko ikhtiyar de aur wo use ikhtiyar kar le, to unhon ne kaha: Urwa ne mujh se riwayat ki, az Aisha, ke unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam mere paas tashreef laye aur farmaya: Main tumhare saamne ek mu'amla pesh karunga, to tum jaldbazi na karna hatta ke apne walidain se mashwara kar lo. Maine kaha: Wo mu'amla kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Phir aap ne mujh par tilawat farmayi: 'Aye Nabi, apni biwiyon se keh dijiye: Agar tum duniya ki zindagi aur us ki zeenat chahti ho to aao, main tumhein faida pahunchadun aur husn-o-khubi ke sath tumhein rukhsat kar dun. Aur agar tum Allah aur Us ke Rasul aur aakhirat ke ghar ko chahti ho to beshak Allah ne tum mein se neko karon ke liye bahut bada ajr tayyar kar rakha hai.' Aisha ne kaha: To maine aap se kaha: Is mu'amle mein aap mujhe mere walidain se mashwara karne ka hukm dete hain? Balke main Allah aur Us ke Rasul aur aakhirat ke ghar ko ikhtiyar karti hun. Aisha ne kaha: To Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam is par raazi hue aur is se khush hue aur farmaya: Main tumhari saheliyon ke saamne wahi pesh karunga jo maine tumhare saamne pesh kiya hai. Maine kaha: To unhein ye na batayiyega ke maine kya ikhtiyar kiya hai, lekin aap ne aisa na kiya; aap un se wahi farmate jaise aap ne Aisha se farmaya tha, phir aap farmate: Aisha ne Allah aur Us ke Rasul aur aakhirat ke ghar ko ikhtiyar kiya hai. Aisha ne kaha: To Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne hamein ikhtiyar diya tha, aur aap ne us se talaq ka irada nahi farmaya tha."
"1484","Abdullah ibn Yazid al-Muqri ne mujh se riwayat ki, Sa'id ibn Abi Ayyub ne hum se riwayat ki, Uqayl ne mujh se riwayat ki, az Ibn Shihab, az Urwa, az Aisha, jinhon ne kaha: Jab Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam sone ka irada farmate to apne dono hathon ko jod lete aur un mein phoonk maarte aur 'Qul Huwa Allahu Ahad' aur 'Qul A'udhu bi Rabbil Falaq' aur 'Qul A'udhu bi Rabbin Nas' ki tilawat farmate, phir unhein apne chehre aur sar aur baqi jism par pherte. Uqayl ne kaha: Aur maine Ibn Shihab ko aisa karte hue dekha."
"1485","Uthman ibn Umar ne hamein khabar di, Yunus ne hamein khabar di, az al-Zuhri, az Urwa, az Aisha, ke al-Hawla un ke paas se guzrein jabke Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam un ke paas the. Unhon ne kaha: To maine kaha: Ye al-Hawla hain, aur log kehte hain ke wo raat ko soti hi nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Kya wo raat ko soti nahi? A'maal mein se utna hi ikhtiyar karo jitne ki tum taaqat rakhte ho; pas Allah ki qasam, Allah nahi uktata hatta ke tum ukta jao."
"1486","Sulayman ibn Harb ne mujh se riwayat ki, Shu'ba ne hum se riwayat ki, az al-Mu'ammal, jo ahl-e-Sham mein se ek shakhs hain, jinhon ne kaha: Maine al-Zuhri ko riwayat karte hue suna az Urwa, az Aisha, ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam, jab Fajr se pehle do rak'atein padh lete to let jate."
"1487","Muhammad ibn Isma'il ibn Abi Fudayk ne mujh se riwayat ki, kehte hain: Ibn Abi Dhi'b ne mujhe khabar di, az Ibn Shihab, az Urwa, az Aisha, ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab momin bimar padta hai to ye use aise paak kar deta hai jaise bhaathi lohe ke mail ko paak kar deti hai."
"1488","Al-Hasan ibn Musa ne hum se riwayat ki, Hammad ibn Salama ne hum se riwayat ki, Hisham ibn Urwa ne hum se riwayat ki, az apne walid, az Aisha, ke jab Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam al-Ahzab se farigh hue to ghusl khanah mein dakhil hue aur ghusl farmaya, phir Jibril alayhis salam aap ke paas aaye. Unhon ne kaha: To maine unhein ghar ke darwaze ki darar se dekha jabke ghubar ne un ke sar ko jakad rakha tha, aur unhon ne kaha: Aye Muhammad, kya aap ne hathyar rakh diye hain? Jibril ne kaha: Hum ne abhi tak hathyar nahi rakhe; Banu Qurayza par chadhayi kijiye."
"1489","Abu Usama ne hamein khabar di, az Hisham ibn Urwa, az un ke walid, az Aisha, jinhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam mithai aur shahad ko mahboob rakhte the."
"1490","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, az Ma'mar, az Hisham ibn Urwa, az un ke walid, az Aisha, jinhon ne kaha: Al-Harith ibn Hisham ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se sawal kiya, arz karte hue: Aye Allah ke Rasul, aap ke paas wahi kaise aati hai? Aap ne farmaya: Kabhi mere paas ghanti ki jhankar ki tarah jhankar ke sath aati hai, phir wo mujh se juda ho jati hai jabke maine use yaad kar liya hota hai, aur ye mujh par sab se zyada sakht hoti hai; aur kabhi farishta - ya aap ne farmaya: shakhs - ki surat mein mere paas aata hai aur mujh se kalaam karta hai, aur main jo wo kehta hai yaad kar leta hun."
"1491","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Ma'mar ne hamein khabar di, az Hisham ibn Urwa, az un ke walid, az Aisha, jinhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke zamane mein hum par ek mahina guzar jata tha jis mein hum aag na jalate the, aur wo sirf pani aur khajoor hota tha, siwa is ke ke Allah Ansar ki kuch auraton ko jaza-e-khair de, pas wo kabhi kabhi hamein kuch doodh hadiya kar deti thin."
"1492","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Ma'mar ne hamein khabar di, az Hisham ibn Urwa, az un ke walid, az Aisha, ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam farmaya karte the: 'Aye Allah, main Jahannam ki aazmaish aur Jahannam ke azab se Teri panah maangta hun, aur main qabr ki aazmaish se Teri panah maangta hun, aur main faqr ki aazmaish ke shar aur maal dari ki aazmaish ke shar se Teri panah maangta hun, aur main Masih al-Dajjal ki aazmaish se Teri panah maangta hun. Aye Allah, mere dil ko mere gunahon se aise paak kar de jaise Tu ne safed kapde ko gandagi se paak kiya, aur mere aur mere gunahon ke darmiyan aise doori farma de jaise Tu ne mashriq aur maghrib ke darmiyan doori farmayi hai. Aye Allah, main susti aur budhape aur gunah aur qarz se Teri panah maangta hun.'"
"1493","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Ma'mar ne hamein khabar di, az Hisham ibn Urwa, az un ke walid, az Aisha, ke Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Narmi jis qaum mein bhi hui use faida pahunchaya, aur sakhti jis qaum mein bhi hui use nuqsan pahunchaya."
"1494","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Ma'mar ne hamein khabar di, az Hisham ibn Urwa, az un ke walid, az Aisha, ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam baith kar namaz padhte, phir jab ruku ke qareeb hote to khade ho jate aur tees ya chalis aayatein tilawat farmate, phir ruku farmate."
"1495","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Ma'mar ne hamein khabar di, az Hisham ibn Urwa, az un ke walid, jinhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr ne Aisha se pucha: Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko kitne kapdon mein kafnaya gaya? Unhon ne kaha: Teen kapdon mein. Unhon ne kaha: Aur mujhe teen kapdon mein kafnana: mera kapda do aur kapdon ke sath, aur use dho dena - un ka wo kapda jo wo pehna karte the. Aisha ne kaha: Kya hum aap ke liye naya kapda na kharidein? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi, zindah naya kapde ka zyada haqdar hai; ye to sirf peep ke liye hai, yani jo un se niklega. Phir unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ki wafat kis din hui? Unhon ne kaha: Peer ke din. Unhon ne kaha: Aaj kaun sa din hai? Unhon ne kaha: Peer ka din. Unhon ne kaha: Mujhe umeed hai ke main raat tak baqi rahun. Phir un ki wafat shaam ko hui aur usi raat subah se pehle dafn kiye gaye, radi Allahu anhu."
"1496","Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hamein khabar di, az Sufyan, az Hisham ibn Urwa, az un ke walid, az Aisha, jinhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi mangna chahe to ziyada mange, pas wo sirf apne Rabb Azza wa Jalla se maang raha hai."
"1497","Muhadir ne mujh se riwayat ki, Hisham ibn Urwa ne hum se riwayat ki, az apne walid, az Aisha, jinhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ruqya farmate the: 'Takleef door kar dijiye, aye logon ke Rabb; shifa Tere hath mein hai; Tere siwa koi use door karne wala nahi.'"
"1498","Muhadir ne mujh se riwayat ki, Hisham ne hum se riwayat ki, az apne walid, az Aisha, jinhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bukhar Jahannam ki garmi se hai, pas use pani se thanda karo."
"1499","Khalid ibn Makhlad al-Bajali ne mujh se riwayat ki, Yahya ibn Umayr ne mujh se riwayat ki, Hisham ibn Urwa ne mujh se riwayat ki, az apne walid, az Aisha, jinhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne ek dehati se ek wasq ajwa khajoor ke badle ek oont kharida, phir Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne apne ghar walon ke paas khajoor talash ki to na payi, to aap ne is ka zikr dehati se kiya, aur dehati chillaya: Haye dhoka! Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke sahaba ne kaha: Balke tu hi dhokebaaz hai, aye Allah ke dushman. Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Use chhod do, pas haq wale ko baat kehne ka haq hai. Phir Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne Khawla bint Hakim ki taraf paigham bheja aur dehati ko qasid ke sath bheja, farmate hue: Un se kaho: Maine is dehati se ek wasq khajoor ke badle ye oont kharida hai, lekin maine apne ghar walon ke paas wo na paya, pas is dehati ke liye mujhe ek wasq ajwa khajoor udhaar de dijiye. Jab dehati ne apna haq pa liya to Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas wapas aaya, to aap ne us se farmaya: Kya tumhein mil gaya? Us ne kaha: Haan, aur aap ne pura ada kiya aur umdagi se ada kiya. Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein behtareen wo hain jo pura ada karen aur umdagi se ada karen."
"1500","Abdullah ibn Maslama ne mujh se riwayat ki, Abd al-Aziz ibn Muhammad ne hum se riwayat ki, az Hisham ibn Urwa, az un ke walid, az Aisha, ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Banda ahl-e-jannat ke a'maal karta hai halanke wo ahl-e-jahannam mein se hota hai, aur banda ahl-e-jahannam ke a'maal karta hai halanke wo ahl-e-jannat mein se hota hai."
"1501","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne hum se bayan kiya, Sharik ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne A'isha se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) roze ki halat mein bosa dete the, phir woh hansin."
"1502","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Urwa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne A'isha se ke kuch log sakht ibadat kar rahe the, to Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne unhen mana kiya, to unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, hum aap ki tarah nahin hain, kyunke Allah ne aap ke agle aur pichle gunah maaf kar diye hain. Aap ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam, main tum sab mein Allah ko sab se zyada janne wala hun aur tum sab mein Us se sab se zyada darne wala hun. Aur unhon ne farmaya: A'mal mein se tum par woh lazim hai jis ki tum taqat rakhte ho, kyunke Allah Azza wa Jalla nahin thakta yahan tak ke tum thak jao. Aur un ko sab se mehboob amal woh tha jo musalsal ho, agarche thora ho."
"1503","Shaddad ibn Hakim ne hum se bayan kiya, Isa ibn Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne A'isha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) tohfa qabool farmate the aur us ka badla dete the."
"1504","Ibn Abi Shayba ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu Usama ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne A'isha se ke unhon ne Asma se ek haar udhar liya aur woh gum ho gaya, to Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne apne sahaba mein se kuch ko us ki talash ke liye bheja, aur unhen namaz ne aa liya. Unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne baghair wuzu namaz parh li, aur jab woh Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke paas aaye to unhon ne aap se us ki shikayat ki. Unhon ne kaha: Phir tayammum ki ayat nazil hui, aur Usayd ibn Hudayr ne kaha: Allah aap ko khair se jaza de, kyunke Allah ki qasam aap ko kabhi koi mamla pesh nahin aaya magar Allah ne aap ke liye us se nikalne ka rasta banaya aur us mein Musalmanon ke liye barkat rakhi."
"1505","Ibn Abi Shayba ne mujh se bayan kiya, Waki' ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne A'isha se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne mere ghar mein Asr ke baad ki do rak'aten kabhi tark nahin kin."
"1506","Al-Nadr ibn Shumayl ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ne hum ko khabar di, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne A'isha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ka bistar chamre ka tha jo khajoor ke reshe se bhara hua tha."
"1507","Al-Nadr ibn Shumayl ne hum ko khabar di, Hisham ibn Urwa ne hum ko khabar di, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne A'isha se ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko sufaid Yamani sooti kapre ke teen kapron mein kafan diya gaya tha."
"1508","Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Isma'il ibn Umayya se, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Urwa se, unhon ne Urwa se, unhon ne A'isha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne mujh se Shawwal mein nikah kiya aur mujhe Shawwal mein hi aap ke paas rukhsat kiya gaya, to aap ki biwiyon mein se kaun mujh se zyada aap ke nazdeek khush-naseeb thi. Unhon ne kaha: Aur woh apni aurton ko Shawwal mein rukhsat karna pasand karti thin."
"1509","Yazid ibn Harun ne hum ko khabar di, al-Hajjaj ibn Artah ne hum ko khabar di, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, unhon ne Urwa se, unhon ne A'isha se, unhon ne kaha: Ek raat maine Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko na paya, to main bahar nikli aur kya dekhti hun ke woh al-Baqi' mein the, apna sar aasman ki taraf uthaye hue. Unhon ne farmaya: Ae A'isha, kya tumhen dar tha ke Allah aur Us ka Rasool tum par zulm karenge. Unhon ne kaha: Maine kaha: Baat woh nahin hai, ae Allah ke Rasool, lekin maine samjha ke aap apni kisi biwi ke paas gaye hain. Unhon ne farmaya: Allah Tabarak wa Ta'ala Sha'ban ki pandrahwin raat ko aasman-e-dunya par nuzool farmata hai aur Kalb ki bakriyon ke baalon ki tadad se zyada logon ko bakhsh deta hai."
"1510","Ja'far ibn Awn ne hum ko khabar di, Hisham ibn Sa'd ne hum ko khabar di, Abu Hazim se, unhon ne Yazid ibn Ruman se, unhon ne Urwa se, unhon ne A'isha se, unhon ne kaha: A'isha ne mujh se kaha: Ae meri behan ke bete, Allah ki qasam, hum hilal dekhte the, phir hilal, phir hilal, do mahinon mein teen hilal, aur Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke gharon mein aag nahin jalai jati thi. Maine kaha: Ae khala, tumhen kya guzara deta tha. Unhon ne kaha: Hamare Ansar mein se padosi the, woh kitne achche padosi the; un ke paas doodh dene wale janwar the, aur woh apne doodh mein se Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko bhejte the, aur woh use hamare liye milate the aur humen pilate the."
"1511","Abd al-Razzaq ne hum ko khabar di, Ma'mar ne hum ko khabar di, Ibn al-Munkadir se, unhon ne Urwa se, unhon ne A'isha se ke ek shakhs aaya aur Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se ijazat chahi, to Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ye qaum ka kya hi bura bhai aur qabile ka beta hai. Jab woh andar aaya to aap apne chehre ke saath us ki taraf mutawajjeh hue aur us se guftagu ki, aur jab woh chala gaya to A'isha ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, aap ne us ke bare mein jo kaha so kaha, phir aap apne chehre aur apni guftagu ke saath us ki taraf mutawajjeh hue. Unhon ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din Allah ke nazdeek martabe ke etebar se badtareen logon mein se woh shakhs hai jis se log us ki burai ki wajah se bachte hon - ya unhon ne farmaya: us ki fahhash-goi ki wajah se."
"1512","Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Salam ibn Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, Ishaq ibn Abi Farwa se, unhon ne Uthman ibn Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne A'isha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs qatal kiya jaye, woh shirk ke siwa har gunah ka kaffara hai."
"1513","Qabisa ibn Uqba ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Usama ibn Zayd se, unhon ne Uthman ibn Urwa se, unhon ne Urwa se, unhon ne A'isha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla aur Us ke farishte safon ko milane walon par rehmat bhejte hain."
"1514","Ibrahim ibn al-Ash'ath ne hum se bayan kiya, Fudayl ibn Iyad ne hum se bayan kiya, Sulayman se, unhon ne Tamim ibn Salama se, unhon ne Urwa se, unhon ne A'isha se, unhon ne kaha: Paak hai Woh Zaat jis ki sama'at tamam aawazon ko ghere hue hai. Ek aurat Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se sargoshi kar rahi thi jabke us ki baat ka kuch hissa main sun rahi thi aur kuch mujh se chhupa raha tha, jab Allah Tabarak wa Ta'ala ne nazil farmaya: Allah ne us aurat ki baat sun li jo apne shauhar ke bare mein aap se jhagarti hai."
"1515","Yazid ibn Harun ne hum ko khabar di, Shu'ba ibn al-Hajjaj ne hum ko khabar di, Sa'd ibn Ibrahim se, unhon ne Abu Salama se, unhon ne A'isha se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se pucha ke kaun se a'mal afzal hain. Unhon ne farmaya: Jo sab se zyada musalsal ho, agarche thora ho."
"1516","Yazid ibn Harun ne hum ko khabar di, Muhammad ibn Amr ne hum ko khabar di, Abu Salama se ke unhon ne A'isha se Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke roze ke bare mein pucha, to unhon ne kaha: Woh roza rakhte the yahan tak ke hum kehte the: Woh iftar nahin karte, aur woh iftar karte the yahan tak ke hum kehte the: Woh roza nahin rakhte. Aur maine unhen Sha'ban se zyada kisi mahine mein roza rakhte hue nahin dekha; woh thore se hisse ke siwa tamam Sha'ban roza rakhte the - balke woh tamam Sha'ban roza rakhte the."
"1517","Abd al-Malik ibn Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Dhi'b ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Harith ibn Abd al-Rahman se, unhon ne Abu Salama se, unhon ne A'isha se ke Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne chand ki taraf dekha aur farmaya: Ae A'isha, is ke shar se Allah ki panah mango, kyunke yehi andheri raat hai jab woh chha jati hai."
"1518","Abd al-Malik ibn Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, Hatim ibn Isma'il ne hum se bayan kiya, Salih ibn Muhammad se, unhon ne Abu Salama se, unhon ne A'isha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) aasman ki taraf apna sar na uthate the magar ye kehte the: Ae dilon ko pherne wale, mere dil ko Apni ita'at par sabit qadam rakh."
"1519","Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hum ko khabar di, Musa ibn Ubayda se, unhon ne Maslama ibn Abi al-Ash'ath se, unhon ne Abu Salih se, unhon ne Abu Salama se, unhon ne A'isha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne Jibril se farmaya: Maine chaha ke tumhen tumhari surat mein dekhun. Unhon ne kaha: Kya tum ye pasand karte ho. Unhon ne farmaya: Ji han. Unhon ne kaha: Tumhara wa'da raat ke falan waqt Baqi' al-Gharqad mein hai. To Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) un se apne wa'de par mile, aur unhon ne apne paron mein se ek par phailaya aur aasman ke ufuq ko dhaanp liya yahan tak ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne aasman ka kuch na dekha, aur Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) us par behosh ho kar gir pade."
"1520","Amr ibn Awn ne mujh ko khabar di, Abu Awana ne hum ko khabar di, Umar ibn Abi Salama se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: A'isha, Allah un se raazi ho, ne kaha: Mujh par us baat ki tohmat lagai gai jis ki mujh par tohmat lagai gai jabke main ghafil thi, jabke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) mere paas baithe hue the, jab un par wahi nazil ki gai. Unhon ne kaha: Aur jab un par wahi nazil ki jati thi to un par oongh jaisi kaifiyat taari ho jati thi. To un par wahi nazil ki gai jabke woh mere paas baithe hue the, phir woh seedhe ho kar baithe aur apna chehra ponchha, phir farmaya: Ae A'isha, khush ho jao. Maine kaha: Allah ki hamd ki wajah se, tumhari hamd ki wajah se nahin. Phir unhon ne ye ayat tilawat ki: Beshak jo log paak-daman, ghafil, momin aurton par tohmat lagate hain, do ayaton ke aakhir tak."
"1521","Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya, Shayban ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Abu Salama se, A'isha aur Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Makkah me dus baras muqeem rahe is haal me ke Qur'an un par nazil hota raha, aur Madinah me dus baras."
"1522","Ibn Abi Shayba ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu Abd al-Rahman al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Abi Ayyub se, jinhon ne kaha: Uqayl aur Yunus ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab se, Abu Salama se, A'isha se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs meri ummat me se qarz ka bojh uthaye, phir use ada karne ki koshish kare aur ada karne se pehle faut ho jaye to main us ka wali hun."
"1523","Abu Asim ne humein khabar di, Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman se, al-Qasim se, A'isha se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne A'isha se farmaya: Jis shakhs ko narmi me se us ka hissa diya gaya use rizq me se us ka hissa diya gaya, aur jo shakhs narmi me se apne hisse se mehrum raha wo rizq me se apne hisse se mehrum raha."
"1524","Uthman ibn Umar ne humein khabar di, Shu'ba ne humein khabar di, Waqid se, Ibn Abi Mulayka se, al-Qasim ibn Muhammad se, A'isha se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs logon ki narazgi ke bawajood Allah ko razi kare Allah use logon ke muqable me kafi ho jata hai, aur jo shakhs logon ko razi karne ke liye Allah ko naraz kare Allah use logon ke supurd kar deta hai."
"1525","Abd al-Razzaq ne humein khabar di, Ma'mar ne humein khabar di, Ayyub se, al-Qasim se, A'isha se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab barish dekhte to farmate: Aye Allah, musladhar barish - ya farmaya: pakiza, nafa bakhsh barish."
"1526","Abd al-Razzaq ne humein khabar di, al-Thawri se, Asim ibn Ubaydullah ibn Asim se, al-Qasim ibn Muhammad se, A'isha se, jinhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekha ke wo Uthman ibn Maz'un ke paas tashreef laye jabke wo faut ho chuke the, to Aap ne un ka chehra khola, phir un par jhuke aur unhein bosa diya, phir roye hatta ke main ne ansu Aap ke rukhsaron par behtay dekhe."
"1527","Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu Khalid al-Ahmar ne hum se bayan kiya, Mansur ibn Hayyan se, Ibn Bujayd se, un ki dadi se, A'isha se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sawali ko khali na lauto, chahe ek khur hi kyun na ho."
"1528","Ibrahim ibn al-Ash'ath ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Fudayl ibn Iyad ne hum se bayan kiya, Baqiyya ibn al-Walid ne humein khabar di, Bahir ibn Sa'd ne mujh se bayan kiya, Khalid ibn Ma'dan se, Kathir ibn Murra al-Hadrami se, A'isha se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Abu Bakr ke sath un ke han tashreef laye, aur Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un se farmaya: Aye A'isha, humein khilao. Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, hamare paas koi khana nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Humein khilao. Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, hamare paas koi khana nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Humein khilao. Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, hamare paas koi khana nahi. Abu Bakr ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, momin aurat kisi cheez ke bare me qasam nahi khati ke wo us ke paas nahi jabke wo us ke paas ho. Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aur tumhein kya malum ke wo momin hai ya nahi? Auraton me momin aurat ki misaal kawwon me safed panjon wale kawwe jaisi hai. Aur Jahannum ahmaqon se paida ki gayi hai, aur auratein ahmaqon me se hain siwaye sahiba-e-adl aur chiraagh wali ke."
"1529","Ibrahim ibn al-Ash'ath ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Fudayl ibn Iyad ne hum se bayan kiya, Mansur se, Hilal ibn Yasaf se, Farwa ibn Nawfal se, jinhon ne kaha: Main ne A'isha se kaha: Mujhe koi aisi cheez sikhayen jo Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam dua me kaha karte the taake main us se dua karun. Unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmaya karte the: Aye Allah, mujhe bakhsh de jo main janta hun aur jo main nahi janta."
"1530","Ibn Abi Shayba ne mujh se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, Mis'ar se, Sa'd ibn Ibrahim se, al-Hasan se, Sa'sa'a se, al-Ahnaf se, jinhon ne kaha: Ek aurat apni do betiyon ke sath A'isha ke paas ayi to unhon ne use teen khajoorein di; unhon ne har ek ko ek khajoor di, phir bachi hui ek ko un dono ke darmiyan taqseem kar diya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam un ke paas tashreef laye to unhon ne Aap ko ye baat batayi. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhein kis baat par ta'ajjub hua? Wo is amal ki wajah se Jannat me dakhil ho gayi hai."
"1531","Ya'la ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Amr ne humein khabar di, Abu Salama se, Umm Salama se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Asr ke baad mere paas tashreef laye aur do rakatein parhein. Main ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, ye namaz to aap pehle nahi parha karte the. Aap ne farmaya: Banu Tamim ka ek wafd aaya tha aur us ne mujhe do rak'aton se rok diya jo main Zuhr ke baad parha karta tha."
"1532","Ya'la ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne humein khabar di, Nafi' se, Safiyya se, A'isha aur Umm Salama se ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kisi aisi aurat ke liye jo Allah aur Yawm-e-Akhirat par iman rakhti ho ye halal nahi ke wo kisi mayyat par teen din se zyada sog manaye, siwaye apne shohar ke. Aur sog ye hai: ke wo na kanghi kare, na surma lagaye, na khushbu ko haath lagaye, na mehndi lagaye, na ranga hua kapra pehne, aur na apne ghar se nikle."
"1533","Abd al-Razzaq ne humein khabar di, Abdullah ibn Sa'id ibn Abi Hind ne humein khabar di, apne walid se, jinhon ne kaha: Umm Salama ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam mere ghar me so rahe the jab Husayn ghutnon ke bal chalte hue aaye. Unhon ne kaha: To main darwaze par baith gayi aur unhein rok diya is dar se ke wo andar dakhil ho kar Aap ko jaga na dein. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main kisi cheez se ghafil hui to wo reng kar andar dakhil hue aur Aap ke pet par baith gaye. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke rone ki awaz suni to main ayi aur kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, Allah ki qasam mujhe un ka pata na chala. Aap ne farmaya: Jibril alaihis salam mere paas aaye jabke wo mere pet par baithe hue the, aur mujh se kaha: Kya aap un se mohabbat karte hain? Main ne kaha: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Aap ki ummat unhein qatl karegi. Kya main aap ko wo mitti na dikhaun jahan unhein qatl kiya jayega? Aap ne farmaya: Main ne kaha: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Phir unhon ne apne par se zameen par mara aur mere liye ye mitti le aaye. Unhon ne kaha: Aur un ke haath me surkh mitti thi, is haal me ke wo ro rahe the aur farma rahe the: Kaash mujhe malum hota ke mere baad tumhein kaun qatl karega."
"1534","Ahmad ibn Yunus ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abd al-Hamid ibn Bahram ne hum se bayan kiya, Shahr ibn Hawshab ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Main ne Umm Salama ko bayan karte hue suna ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aksar apni dua me farmate the: Aye Allah, dilon ko pherne wale, mere dil ko Apne deen par sabit rakh. Main ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, kya dil waqai phere jate hain? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, Allah ki makhlooq me se Aulad-e-Adam ka koi fard aisa nahi magar us ka dil Allah ki ungliyon me se do ungliyon ke darmiyan hai, agar Wo chahe to use seedha rakhta hai aur agar chahe to use tedha kar deta hai. Pas hum Allah apne Rab se sawal karte hain ke Wo humein hidayat dene ke baad hamare dilon ko tedha na kare, aur hum Us se sawal karte hain ke Wo apni taraf se humein rehmat ata farmaye, beshak Wo hi Wahaab hai. Main ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, kya aap mujhe koi dua nahi sikhayenge jis ke sath main apne liye dua karun? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, kaho: Aye Allah, Nabi Muhammad ke Rab, mere gunah ko bakhsh de aur mere dil ke gusse ko door kar de aur mujhe gumrah kun fitnon se mehfooz rakh jab wo hum par nazil hon."
"1535","Abd al-Malik ibn Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'ba ne hum se bayan kiya, Musa ibn Abi A'isha se, jinhon ne kaha: Main ne Umm Salama ke ek azad karda ghulam ko Umm Salama se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat karte hue suna ke jab subah hoti to Aap farmate: Aye Allah, main Tujh se nafa bakhsh ilm aur pakiza rizq aur maqbool amal ka sawal karta hun."
"1536","Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Mansur se, al-Sha'bi se, Umm Salama se, jinhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apne ghar se nikalte to farmate: Allah ke naam se, mere Rab, main Teri panah chahta hun is se ke main phisl jaun ya gumrah ho jaun, ya zulm karun ya jahalat karun, ya mujh par jahalat ki jaye."
"1537","Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne humein khabar di, al-A'mash se, Shaqiq se, Umm Salama se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mayyat ke paas hazir ho to achhi baat kaho, kyunke farishte tumhari kahi hui baat par ameen kehte hain. Unhon ne kaha: Pas jab Abu Salama faut hue to main ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, main kya kahun? Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Aye Allah, unhein bakhsh de aur un ke baad humein achha janisheen ata farma. Pas Allah ne un ke baad mujhe Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ata farmaye."
"1538","Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne humein khabar di, Isra'il ne humein khabar di, Mansur se, Salim ibn Abi al-Ja'd se, Abu Salama se, Umm Salama se, jinhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko kabhi koi mahina mukammal roze rakhte hue nahi dekha siwaye Sha'ban ke, kyunke Aap use Ramadan se mila dete the to wo do musalsal mahine ho jate the. Aur Aap saal bhar is tarah roze rakhte ke hum kehte: Aap roza todte hi nahi, aur Aap is tarah roza chod dete ke hum kehte: Aap roza rakhte hi nahi."
"1539","al-Hasan ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, Ali ibn Zayd se, al-Hasan se, Umm Salama se ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmaya karte the: Mere Rab, bakhsh de aur rehem farma aur mujhe sab se seedhe raste ki taraf hidayat de."
"1540","Zayd ibn al-Hubab al-Ukli ne humein khabar di, Abd al-Mu'min ibn Khalid al-Hanafi ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Burayda ne mujh se bayan kiya, Umm Salama, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki zawja se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko qamees se zyada koi libas mehboob nahi tha."
"1541","Mujhe Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne bayan kiya, hamein Muhammad ibn al-Fudayl ne bayan kiya, Abu Nasr Abdullah ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Musawir al-Himyari se, un ki walida se, Umm Salama se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jo aurat is haal mein faut ho ke us ka shauhar us se raazi ho, woh Jannat mein dakhil hogi."
"1542","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shayba ne bayan kiya, hamein Yazid ibn Harun ne bayan kiya, Hammam se, Qatada se, Salih Abu al-Khalil se, Safina se, Umm Salama se, ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jis marz mein faut hue us ke dauran farmate the: Namaz aur jo tumhare dayen hathon ki milkiyat mein hai. Woh ise kehte rahe yahan tak ke un ki zaban usi se bhar gayi."
"1543","Hamein Ibn Abi Shayba ne bayan kiya, hamein Ishaq ibn Mansur ne bayan kiya, Huraym se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Ishaq se, Abu Kathir mawla Umm Salama se, Umm Salama se, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Maghrib ki azan ke waqt kaho: Aye Allah, Teri raat ke aane aur Tere din ke jane aur Teri duaaon ki aawazon aur Teri namazon ki haziri ke sadqe, mujhe bakhsh de. Aur jab woh raat ko bedar hotin to kehtin: Mere Rab, mujhe bakhsh de aur reham farma aur sab se seedhe raste ki hidayat de."
"1544","Hamein Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Salama ne bayan kiya, Asim ibn Bahdala se, Sawa al-Khuza'i se, Hafsa se, ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) maheene ke teen din roza rakhte the: Peer aur Jumerat, aur agle hafte ka Peer."
"1545","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shayba ne bayan kiya, hamein Husayn ibn Ali ne bayan kiya, Za'ida se, Asim se, al-Musayyab se - aur Husayn ke siwa ek aur ne kaha: Za'ida se, Sawa se, Hafsa se - unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apne bistar par tashrif le jate to apna dayan hath apne dayan rukhsar ke niche rakhte. Aur un ka dayan un ke khane aur peene aur taharat aur kapron aur namaz ke liye tha, aur un ka bayan us ke siwa ke liye tha. Aur woh Peer aur Jumerat ka roza rakhte the."
"1546","Hamein Ya'la ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, hamein Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, Hafsa se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Fajr se pehle ki do rak'aton ko halka rakhte the."
"1547","Hamein Abu Asim ne khabar di, Ibn Jurayj se, Uthman ibn Khalid se, Abdullah ibn Sa'id se, ke unhein Hafsa ne khabar di ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apna kapra apni ranon ke darmiyan rakha hua tha, phir Abu Bakr aaye aur dakhil hue jabke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) usi haalat mein the, phir Umar aaye, phir Ali aaye, phir Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba mein se log aaye aur un se guftagu ki. Phir Uthman aaye aur ijazat mangi, to aap ne us se satr پوشی ki, phir unhein ijazat di. Jab woh chale gaye to maine kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasul, Abu Bakr ne ijazat mangi, phir Umar ne, phir Ali ne, jabke aap apni us haalat mein the, lekin jab Uthman ne ijazat mangi to aap ne kapre se satr پوشی ki. Unhon ne farmaya: Kya main us se haya na karun jis se farishte haya karte hain."
"1548","Hamein Ya'la ibn Muhammad ne bayan kiya, hamein Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne bayan kiya, Bukayr ibn Abdullah al-Ashajj se, Sulayman ibn Yasar se, Maymuna se jo Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zawja hain, unhon ne kaha: Maine apni ek laundi aazad ki, phir Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere paas tashrif laye to maine unhein use aazad karne ki khabar di. Unhon ne farmaya: Allah tujhe ajr de; agar tu use apne mamun ko de deti to tere ajr ke liye zyada hota."
"1549","Mujhe Abu al-Walid ne bayan kiya, hamein Jarir al-Razi ne bayan kiya, Mansur se, Ziyad ibn Amr ibn Hind se, Imran ibn Hudhayfa se, unhon ne kaha: Maymuna aksar qarz leti thin, to un ke ghar walon ne un se is bare mein baat ki aur unhein malamat ki aur un par toot pade. Unhon ne kaha: Main qarz lena tark nahi karungi, kyunke maine apne Nabi aur apne mehboob (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jo bhi qarz le jabke Allah Azza wa Jalla janta ho ke woh use ada karne ka irada rakhta hai, to Allah Azza wa Jalla us ki taraf se use duniya mein ada kar deta hai."
"1550","Hamein Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Layla se, Salama ibn Kuhayl se, Kurayb se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Maymuna se jo meri khala hain, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke ghusl janabat ke bare mein pucha. Unhon ne kaha: Ek bartan laya jata, to woh apne dayen se apne bayen par pani dalte aur apni sharmgah aur jo cheez use lagi thi use dhote, phir namaz jaisa wuzu karte, phir apna sar aur baqi jism dhote, phir hat kar apne qadam dhote. Phir ek rumal laya jata aur un ke samne rakha jata, to woh apni ungliyan jhatakte aur use chhute na the."
"1551","Mujhe Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne bayan kiya, hamein Hafs ibn Ghiyath ne bayan kiya, al-Shaybani se, Abdullah ibn Shaddad se, Maymuna se jo Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zawja hain, unhon ne kaha: Jab hum mein se koi haiza hoti to Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) use izar lapetne ka hukm dete, phir use chhute."
"1552","Hamein al-Nadr ibn Shumayl ne khabar di, hamein Isra'il ibn Yunus ne khabar di, hamein Abu Ishaq ne khabar di, al-Musayyab ibn Rafi' se, Anbasa ibn Abi Sufyan se, un ki behan Umm Habiba se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo barah nafl rak'atein parhe, us ke liye Jannat mein ek ghar banaya jayega: Zuhr se pehle chaar, Zuhr ke baad do, Maghrib ke baad do, Isha ke baad do, aur Fajr ki namaz se pehle do."
"1553","Hamein Rawh ibn Ubada ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Awza'i ne bayan kiya, Hassan ibn Atiyya se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Anbasa ibn Abi Sufyan par maut utri to un ki bechaini sakht ho gayi, to kaha gaya: Ye bechaini kaisi hai. Unhon ne kaha: Maine Umm Habiba se - yani un ki behan se - kehte hue suna: Maine Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jo din mein barah rak'atein parhe, Allah Azza wa Jalla us ke gosht ko Aag par haram kar deta hai. Aur maine tab se unhein tark nahi kiya."
"1554","Mujhe Muhammad ibn Yazid ibn Khunays ne bayan kiya, hamein Sa'id ibn Hassan al-Makhzumi ne bayan kiya, mujhe Umm Salih ne bayan kiya, Safiyya bint Shayba se, Umm Habiba se jo Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zawja hain, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ka har qaul us ke khilaf hai, us ke haq mein nahi, siwaye neki ka hukm dene ya burai se rokne ya Allah Azza wa Jalla ke zikr ke."
"1555","Hamein al-Hasan ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, hamein Layth ibn Sa'd ne bayan kiya, hamein Yazid ibn Abi Habib ne bayan kiya, Suwayd ibn Qays se, Mu'awiya ibn Hudayj se, Mu'awiya ibn Abi Sufyan se, Allah un se raazi ho, ke unhon ne apni behan Umm Habiba se jo Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zawja hain, pucha ke kya Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us kapre mein namaz parhte the jis mein jima' kiya tha. Unhon ne kaha: Haan, jab tak us mein koi nagawari na dekhte."
"1556","Hamein Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, hamein Ma'mar ne khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Ali ibn Husayn se, Safiyya bint Huyayy se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) e'tikaf mein the, to main raat ko un ki ziyarat ko aayi aur un se baat ki, phir main wapas jane ko uthi to woh mujhe wapas chhorne ke liye mere sath uthe. Unhon ne kaha: Aur un ka maskan Usama ibn Zayd ke ghar mein tha. Ansar ke do aadmi guzre, aur jab unhon ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha to tez chalne lage. Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Apni jagah thahre raho; ye Safiyya bint Huyayy hain. Unhon ne kaha: Subhan Allah, aye Allah ke Rasul. Unhon ne farmaya: Shaitan insan mein khoon ki tarah daudta hai, aur mujhe darr hua ke woh tumhare dilon mein shar - ya unhon ne kaha: koi cheez - dal dega."
"1557","Hamein Uthman ibn Umar ne bayan kiya, hamein Shu'ba ne khabar di, Qatada se, Abu Ayyub se, Juwayriya bint al-Harith se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Jumu'a ke din mere paas tashrif laye jabke main roze se thi, aur farmaya: Kya tum ne kal roza rakha tha. Maine kaha: Nahi. Unhon ne farmaya: Kya tum kal roza rakhogi. Maine kaha: Nahi. Unhon ne farmaya: To roza khol do."
"1558","Mujhe Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne bayan kiya, hamein Sharik ne bayan kiya, Jabir se, un ki khala Umm Uthman se, al-Tufayl se jo Juwayriya ke bhatije hain, Juwayriya se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jo is duniya mein resham ka libas pehne, Allah use Qiyamat ke din aag ka libas pehnayega."
"1559","Hamein Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Jurayj ne bayan kiya, Abd al-Hamid ibn Jubayr se, Sa'id ibn al-Musayyab se, Umm Sharik se, ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne chipkali ko qatl karne ka hukm diya, aur farmaya: Woh Ibrahim (alaihis salam) par phoonk marti thi."
"1560","Hamein Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne khabar di, Isra'il se, Abu Ishaq se, Yahya ibn Husayn se, un ki dadi Umm Husayn se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Mina mein logon se khutba dete hue dekha, apne kapre mein lipte hue, jabke un ke bazu ke upari gosht mein kapkapahat thi, farmate the: Aye logon, Allah se daro aur suno aur ita'at karo, agarche tum par ek Habshi ghulam ko amir bana diya jaye; us ki suno aur us ki ita'at karo jab tak woh tumhare liye Allah ki Kitab ko qaim rakhe."
"1561","Affan ibn Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'ba ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Husayn ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone mujhe khabar di ke unhone apni dadi se suna woh keh rahi thi: maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Sallam ko Arafat mein khutbah dete hue suna, aap farma rahe the: agar tum par ek ghulam bhi amir muqarrar kar diya jaye jo Kitabullah ke mutabiq tumhari qiyadat kare to uski suno aur uski ita'at karo."
"1562","Zayd ibn Hubab al-Ukli ne hum se bayan kiya, Musa ibn Ubayda al-Rabadhi se, Mundhir ibn al-Jahm ne mujh se bayan kiya, Umar ibn Khalda al-Ansari se, unki walida se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Sallam ne Ayyam-e-Mina mein Ali ko bheja ke ye elaan kar dein: ye khane aur peene aur jima' ke din hain."
"1563","Abdullah ibn Maslama ne mujh se bayan kiya, Fa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaydullah ibn Ali ibn Abi Rafi' se, unki dadi se, unhone kaha: jab Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Sallam ko koi zakhm ya chot pahunchti to main us par mehndi lagati thi."
"1564","Abu al-Walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu Awana ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr se, Umm al-Ala naam ki ek khatun se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Sallam ne unki ayadat ki jab woh bimar thi aur farmaya: khush ho jao ai Umm al-Ala, be-shak Musalman ki bimari uske gunahon ko is tarah door kar deti hai jaise aag chandi aur sone ke mail ko door kar deti hai."
"1565","Ibn Abi Shayba ne mujh se bayan kiya, Sharik ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalaf ibn Hawshab se, Maymun se, unhone kaha: maine Umm al-Darda se pucha: kya aap ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Sallam se kuch suna hai? Unhone kaha: haan, maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Sallam ko farmate hue suna: Mizan mein sab se pehle rakhi jane wali cheez husn-e-akhlaq hai."
"1566","Ibn Abi Shayba ne hum se bayan kiya, Waki' ne hum se bayan kiya, Umm Ghurab se, Aqila naam ki ek khatun se, Salama se jo Kharasha ibn al-Hurr ki behn hain, unhone kaha: maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Sallam ko farmate hue suna: logon par ek aisa zamana aayega jab woh ek ghanta khade rahenge aur unhein namaz padhane wala koi imam nahi milega."
"1567","Ibn Abi Shayba ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahim ibn Sulayman ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Abi Ziyad se, Sulayman ibn Amr ibn al-Ahwas se, unki walida Umm Jundub se, unhone kaha: maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Sallam ko Yawm al-Nahr ke din wadi ke darmiyan se Jamrat al-Aqaba ko rami karte hue dekha jabke aap apni sawari par the, phir aap chale gaye, aur Qabila-e-Khath'am ki ek aurat apne ek ladke ke sath jo ek bimari mein mubtala tha aap ke peeche aayi, us ne kaha: ai Allah ke Rasul, ye mera beta hai aur mere khandan ka baqiya hai, aur ise ek bimari hai, ye bolta nahi hai, Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Sallam ne farmaya: mere pas kuch pani lao, pani laya gaya to aap ne apne hathon ko dhoya aur kulli ki, phir use us khatun ko de diya aur farmaya: ise is mein se pilao aur is par bahao, aur iske liye Allah Azza wa Jalla se shifa talab karo, unhone kaha: phir meri mulaqat us khatun se hui aur maine kaha: kya tum mujhe is mein se kuch de dogi? Us ne kaha: ye sirf is bimar ke liye hai, unhone kaha: phir agle saal meri mulaqat us khatun se hui aur maine us se us ladke ke bare mein pucha to us ne kaha: woh theek ho gaya aur use aisi samajh hasil hui jo aam logon ki samajh se badh kar hai."
"1568","Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'ba ne humein khabar di, Habib se, unhone kaha: maine hamari ek azad karda londi se suna jise Layla kaha jata tha woh Umm Umara se riwayat kar rahi thi ke Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Sallam ke pas khana laya gaya aur aap ne us mein se khaya, phir aap ne us se farmaya: qareeb aao aur khao, us ne kaha: main roze se hun, aap ne farmaya: jab roze-dar ke samne khana khaya jaye to farishte us par rahmat bhejte rehte hain yahan tak ke woh farigh ho jayen."
"1569","Muhammad ibn Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Qasim ibn Ghannam se, unke khandan ke kuch afrad se, Umm Farwa se - aur woh Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Sallam se bai'at karne waliyon mein se thi - unhone kaha: maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Sallam se pucha ke kaun sa amal afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: namaz ko uske awwal waqt mein padhna."
"1570","Muhammad ibn Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, Hani ibn Uthman ne hum se bayan kiya, unki walida Humayda bint Yasir se, unki dadi Yusayra se - aur woh muhajir khawateen mein se thi - unhone kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Sallam ne hum se farmaya: tum par tahlil aur tasbih aur taqdis lazim hai, ghafil na ho jana ke tum rahmat bhula do, aur ungliyon ke poron par gino, be-shak unse sawal kiya jayega aur unhein bolne ki quwwat di jayegi."
"1571","Yazid ibn Harun ne humein khabar di, Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne humein khabar di, al-Harith ibn Fudayl se, al-Zuhri se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abdullah ibn Ka'b se, unke walid se, unhone kaha: jab Ka'b par maut ka waqt aaya to Umm Bishr bint al-Bara unke pas aayi aur kaha: ai Abu Abd al-Rahman, agar tum mere bete fulan se milo to use mera salam pahunchana, unhone us se kaha: Allah tumhein bakhshe ai Umm Bishr, hum is se zyada mashghul hain, us ne kaha: kya tum ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Sallam ko farmate hue suna: momin ki ruh Jannat mein jahan chahe sair karti hai, aur kafir ki ruh Sijjin mein hoti hai? Unhone kaha: haan, us ne kaha: to baat yahi hai."
"1572","Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, kaha ke al-A'mash ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir se, Umm Mubashshir al-Ansariyya se, unhone kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Sallam mere pas tashrif laye jabke main apne khajuron ke bagh mein thi, aur farmaya: ye khajuren kis ki hain? Maine kaha: meri hain, aap ne farmaya: inhein kis ne lagaya hai, kisi Musalman ne ya kafir ne? Maine kaha: Musalman ne, aap ne farmaya: jo bhi Musalman koi paudha lagata hai ya koi kheti bota hai phir us mein se koi insan ya parinda ya janwar khata hai to woh uske liye sadqa hai."
"1573","Abd al-Razzaq ne humein khabar di, Ma'mar aur al-Thawri ne humein khabar di, Hisham ibn Urwa se, Fatima bint al-Mundhir se, Asma bint Abi Bakr se, unhone kaha: hum ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Sallam ke zamane mein ek ghoda zibah kiya aur use khaya."
"1574","Abd al-Razzaq ne humein khabar di, Ma'mar ne humein khabar di, kaha ke maine Hisham ibn Urwa se suna, Fatima bint al-Mundhir se, Asma bint Abi Bakr se, unhone kaha: hum ne Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Sallam ke zamane mein Ramadan ke ek din roza iftar kar liya, phir suraj nikal aaya, ek aadmi ne Hisham se kaha: kya unhone uski qaza ki ya nahi? Unhone kaha: mujhe malum nahi."
"1575","Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Uqba se, Ibn Shihab se, Urwa se, Asma bint Abi Bakr se, ke jab woh tharid banati to use kuch der dhak kar rakhti yahan tak ke uski garmi khatam ho jati, phir kehti: maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Sallam ko farmate hue suna: ye barkat ke liye zyada behtar hai."
"1576","Ibn Abi Shayba ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahim ibn Sulayman ne hum se bayan kiya, Hajjaj se, Abu Umar se, Asma bint Abi Bakr se, ke unhone dibaj ke ghundiyon wali ek chadar nikali, kehte hue: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Sallam dushman se samna karte waqt ye pehna karte the."
"1577","Habban ibn Hilal aur Sulayman ibn Harb aur Hajjaj ibn Minhal ne mujh se bayan kiya, kaha ke Hammad ibn Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Shahr ibn Hawshab se, Asma bint Yazid se, unhone kaha: maine Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Sallam ko farmate hue suna: ai mere bando jinhone apni janon par ziyadati ki hai, Allah ki rahmat se mayoos na ho, Allah tamam gunahon ko bakhsh deta hai - aur use parwah nahi."
"1578","Abu Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaydullah ibn Abi Ziyad se, Shahr ibn Hawshab se, Asma bint Yazid se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Sallam ne farmaya: Allah ka Ism-e-A'zam in do ayaton mein hai: Allah, uske siwa koi mabud nahi, woh al-Hayy al-Qayyum hai, aur: tumhara mabud ek hi mabud hai."
"1579","Abu Asim ne humein khabar di, Ubaydullah ibn Abi Ziyad se, Shahr ibn Hawshab se, Asma bint Yazid se, unhone kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Sallam ne farmaya: jo shakhs apne bhai ke gosht ka uski ghair maujudgi mein difa kare, Allah par haq hai ke use Jahannam ki aag se azad kar de."
"1580","Abd al-Razzaq ne humein khabar di, Ma'mar ne humein khabar di, Ibn Khuthaym se, Shahr ibn Hawshab se, Asma bint Yazid se, ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Sallam ne farmaya: kya main tumhein tum mein se behtareen logon ke bare mein na bataun? Unhone kaha: haan, ai Allah ke Rasul, aap ne farmaya: woh jinhein dekha jaye to Allah yaad aaye, phir aap ne farmaya: kya main tumhein tum mein se badtareen logon ke bare mein na bataun: woh jo chughli karte hain, jo doston ke darmiyan fasad dalte hain, jo be-gunah logon ke liye mushkilat talash karte hain."
"1581","Husayn ibn Ali al-Ju'fi ne hum se bayan kiya, Za'ida se, Aban ibn Abi Ayyash se, Shahr ibn Hawshab se, Asma bint Yazid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla qayamat ke din ek pukarne wale ko uthayega jo pukarega: Aaj majma wale jaan lenge ke izzat ka sab se zyada mustahiq kaun hai, kahan hain woh log jinhain na tijarat na kharid o farokht Allah ke zikr se ghafil karti hai, pas woh uthenge aur Jannat mein dakhil honge, phir pukarne wala lautega aur kahega: Majma wale jaan lenge ke izzat ka sab se zyada mustahiq kaun hai, kahan hain woh jin ke pehlu bichonon se juda rehte hain, pas woh Jannat mein dakhil honge, phir pukarne wala lautega aur kahega: Majma wale jaan lenge ke izzat ka sab se zyada mustahiq kaun hai, kehte hue: Kahan hain woh jo har haal mein Allah ki hamd karte hain, aur woh pehle do girohon se zyada tadaad mein honge, pas woh Jannat mein dakhil honge."
"1582","Abd al-Razzaq ne hum ko khabar di, Ma'mar ne hum ko khabar di, Ibn Khuthaym se, Shahr ibn Hawshab se, Asma bint Yazid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) ne farmaya: Dajjal zameen mein chalis baras rahega, ek saal ek mahine ki tarah, ek mahina ek hafte ki tarah, ek hafta ek din ki tarah, aur ek din aag mein khajoor ki tehni ke bharakne ki tarah."
"1583","Ahmad ibn Yunus ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abd al-Hamid ibn Bahram ne hum se bayan kiya, Shahr ibn Hawshab ne mujh se bayan kiya, Asma bint Yazid ne mujh se bayan kiya, ke Rasul Allah (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) ne farmaya: Ghoron ki peshaniyon mein qayamat tak ke liye bhalai bandhi hui hai, jo unhain Allah ke raste mein tayyari ke taur par bandhe aur un par Allah ke raste mein sawab ki niyyat se kharch kare to un ki seri aur bhook, un ki serabi aur pyas, un ka gobar aur peshab qayamat ke din us ke tarazu mein kamyabi honge, aur jo unhain dikhawe aur shohrat aur fakhr aur takabbur ke liye bandhe to un ki seri aur bhook aur pyas aur serabi aur gobar aur peshab qayamat ke din us ke tarazu mein khasara honge."
"1584","Ibn Abi Shayba ne mujh se bayan kiya, Waki' ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Bakr ibn Abi al-Jahm al-Adawi se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Fatima bint Qays ko kehte hue suna: Rasul Allah (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) ne mujh se farmaya: Jab tum halal ho jao to mujhe ittila dena, pas unhon ne un ko ittila di, unhon ne kaha: Phir Mu'awiya aur Abu Jahm ibn Mukhayyir aur Usama ibn Zayd ne un se nikah ka paigham bheja, Rasul Allah (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) ne farmaya: Rahe Mu'awiya to woh tangdast shakhs hai jis ke paas maal nahi, aur rahe Abu Jahm to woh aisa shakhs hai jo auraton ko marta hai, lekin Usama ibn Zayd, to unhon ne apne haath se is tarah kaha: Usama, Usama, Rasul Allah (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) ne un se farmaya: Allah ki ita'at aur Us ke Rasul ki ita'at tumhare liye behtar hai, pas unhon ne us se nikah kar liya aur is par un se rashk kiya gaya."
"1585","Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Uyayna ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah se, Ibn Abbas se, un ki walida Umm al-Fadl se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Nabi (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) ko Maghrib mein al-Mursalat ki tilawat karte hue suna."
"1586","Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Amr ne hum ko khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Tammam ibn al-Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Umm al-Fadl ne mujhe 'qasam un ki jo lagatar bheji jayen' ki tilawat karte hue suna to kaha: Aye mere bete, yeh aakhri surat hai jo maine Rasul Allah (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) ko Maghrib ki namaz mein logon ki imamat karte hue padhte hue suni."
"1587","Abdullah ibn Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Abi Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu al-Aswad ne mujh se bayan kiya, al-Nu'man ibn Abi Ayyash al-Zuraqi se, Khawla bint Thamir al-Ansariyya se, ke unhon ne Rasul Allah (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) ko farmate hue suna: Duniya hari bhari aur meethi hai, aur log Allah ke maal mein nahaq ghusenge, un ke liye qayamat ke din Aag hai."
"1588","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, Umar ibn Kathir ibn Aflah se, Ubayd Sanuta se, Khawla bint Qays se, ke Rasul Allah (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) ne farmaya: Yeh maal meetha aur hara bhara hai, jo use haq ke saath le us ke liye is mein barkat di jayegi, aur Allah aur Us ke Rasul ke maal mein ghusne wale bahut se logon ke liye us din Aag hogi jis din woh Us se milega."
"1589","al-Hasan ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalid ibn Dhakwan Abu al-Husayn se, unhon ne kaha: Auratein daf bajati thin, to maine is ka zikr al-Rubayyi' bint Mu'awwidh se kiya, to unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) meri shaadi ke din mere paas aaye aur mere is bistar ki jagah par baithe, jabke hamare paas do laundiyan thin jo daf baja rahi thin aur mere aaba ki ta'rif kar rahi thin jo Badr ke din qatl hue the, unhon ne apne kehne mein kaha, to Nabi (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) ne farmaya: Raha yeh, to ise na kaho."
"1590","Abu Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, Yasar ibn Abd al-Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Meri dadi Umm Hakim bint Dinar, jo Umm Ishaq ki aazad karda thin, ne mujh se bayan kiya, Umm Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasul Allah (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) ke paas aayi, aur roti aur gosht laya gaya, unhon ne kaha: Aur maine Nabi (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) ke khane mein se khane ki khwahish ki, to unhon ne farmaya: Aao, aye Umm Ishaq, aur khao, unhon ne kaha: Pas maine khaya, phir unhon ne mujhe gosht wali haddi pakdai, to maine use apne munh ki taraf uthaya, phir mujhe yaad aaya ke main rozedar thi, to mera haath reh gaya, na use apne munh tak utha sakti thi na use rakh sakti thi, Rasul Allah (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) ne farmaya: Tumhe kya hua, aye Umm Ishaq, maine kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasul, main rozedar thi, Rasul Allah (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) ne farmaya: Apna roza poora karo, phir Dhu al-Yadayn ne kaha: Ab, us ke ser hone ke ba'd, Nabi (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) ne farmaya: Yeh sirf rizq hai jo Allah ne us ki taraf pahunchaya."
"1591","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Mas'udi ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Malik ibn Abi Hathma se, al-Shifa bint Abdullah se, aur woh muhajir auraton mein se thin, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) se afzal amal ke bare mein pucha gaya, unhon ne farmaya: Allah par iman, aur Allah ke raste mein jihad, aur hajj mabrur."
"1592","Abd al-Razzaq ne hum ko khabar di, Ma'mar ne hum ko khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Humayd ibn Abd al-Rahman se, un ki walida Umm Kulthum bint Uqba se, aur woh pehli hijrat karne wali auraton mein se thin, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasul Allah (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) ko farmate hue suna: Woh jhoota nahi jo logon ke darmiyan sulah karaye, bhalai kehte hue ya bhalai pahunchate hue."
"1593","Abd al-Razzaq ne hum ko khabar di, Ma'mar ne hum ko khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Kharija ibn Zayd se, unhon ne kaha: Umm al-Ala al-Ansariyya, jab muhajireen Madina aaye to Ansar ne un ke thahrane ke liye qur'a andazi ki, unhon ne kaha: Pas Uthman ibn Maz'un hamare hisse mein aaye, woh bimar hue to hum ne un ki timardari ki, phir woh faut ho gaye, Rasul Allah (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) aaye aur un ke paas dakhil hue, to maine kaha: Tum par Allah ki rehmat ho, aye Abu al-Sa'ib, meri gawahi hai ke Allah ne tumhe izzat di hai, Nabi (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) ne farmaya: Aur tum kaise janti ho ke Allah ne use izzat di hai, maine kaha: Main nahi janti, Allah ki qasam, Nabi (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) ne farmaya: Rahe woh to un ke paas un ke Rabb Azza wa Jalla ki taraf se yaqeen aa chuka, aur main un ke liye Allah Azza wa Jalla se bhalai ki ummeed rakhta hun, Allah ki qasam, main nahi janta, halanke main Allah ka Rasul hun, ke mere saath kya kiya jayega, na tumhare saath, unhon ne kaha: Pas maine kaha: Allah ki qasam, main un ke ba'd kabhi kisi ko paak qarar nahi dungi, unhon ne kaha: Phir maine Uthman ke liye ba'd mein khwab mein ek behta hua chashma dekha, to maine ise Rasul Allah (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) se bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Yeh un ka amal hai, Ma'mar ne kaha: Aur maine al-Zuhri ke siwa ek aur se suna kehte hue: Musalmanon ne woh baat napasand ki jo Rasul Allah (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) ne Uthman se kahi, yahan tak ke Zaynab bint Rasulillah (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) faut ho gain, aur unhon ne farmaya: Hamare peshrau Uthman ibn Maz'un se ja milo."
"1594","Umar ibn Sa'id al-Dimashqi ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Abd al-Aziz al-Tunukhi ne hum se bayan kiya, Makhul se, Umm Ayman se, ke unhon ne Rasul Allah (Allah ki salamti aur barkatein un par hon) ko apne ghar walon mein se ba'z ko nasihat karte hue suna, farmate hue: Allah ke saath kisi cheez ko shareek na karo, agarche tum kaat diye jao ya aag se jala diye jao, ma'rake ke din farar ikhtiyar na karo, agar logon par maut aaye jabke tum un mein ho to sabit qadam raho, apne walidain ki ita'at karo, agarche woh tumhe apna maal chhorne ka hukm dein, jaan bujh kar namaz tark na karo, kyunke jo jaan bujh kar namaz tark kare woh Allah ki hifazat se bari hai, sharab se bacho, kyunke woh har burai ki kunji hai, nafarmani se bacho, kyunke woh Allah ko ghazabnak karti hai, iqtidar ke bare mein us ke walon se jhagra na karo, agarche tum dekho ke woh tumhara hai, apne ghar walon par apni istita'at se kharch karo, un se apna asa na uthao, aur unhain Allah Azza wa Jalla se darao, Amr ne kaha: Sa'id ke siwa ek aur ne hum se bayan kiya ke al-Zuhri ne kaha: Jin ko is nasihat se nasihat ki gayi woh Thawban the."
